"""经典十九本攻略（enUS 对照层，_gen_guide19.py 生成）。

键 = Data_DungeonGuide.lua 经典十九本标记块里的 zhCN 全文，值 = 采集英文原文（占位符已回填）。
zhTW 由 gen_zhtw_data.py 对 zhCN 自动 opencc，不经本表。
"""

FREE = {
    "": "",
    "Forever 新增肯瑞托声望，肯瑞托战袍需要崇拜。演示中城市中央屏障后还有一个「大 boss」未能开战，身份至今未明。": "Forever adds a Kirin Tor reputation; the Kirin Tabard asks for exalted. A 'big boss' behind a barrier in mid-city was never fought in the demo — its identity is still open.",
    "Legacy 挑战只有在最后一个 boss 遗迹守护者死后才算完成。": "The Legacy challenge counts the dungeon as done only when the last boss, the Relic Guardian, dies.",
    "Legacy 挑战计于击杀 creature 260274 —— 一个数据库尚未命名的 id，很可能就是最终 boss。": "The Legacy challenge counts the dungeon as done when creature 260274 dies — an unnamed id, likely the last boss.",
    "Risen troll sentries guard the middle of the run; standard elite packs — control and burn them down one at a time.": "",
    "The demo's late stretch had naga in tight packs. Pull carefully — chain-pulling two packs at once is the main way to wipe here.": "",
    "The demo's opening stretch: makrura and small crabs along the flooded approach. Individually weak, but they come in packs.": "",
    "这场法力系战斗很可能就是名单里的法力吞噬者／法力元素占位之一（试玩标注名「奥术谜团」Arcanic Enigma），对应关系尚待实机确认。打法：开战时 boss 身边带着两只法力幻影，它们的法力燃烧对被点名者压力极大，优先集火秒掉。boss 会偶尔用秘法囚笼控制一名队友 8 秒，需要能驱散魔法的队友解掉；治疗可以考虑站得离队伍远一些 —— 它会对近身目标施放范围奥术伤害。战斗全程它还会不断召唤小型奥术人偶，用顺劈清掉即可（优先级低于幻影，幻影本身不会补充）。": "This mana-themed fight most likely maps to one of the mana placeholders (Mana Devourer / Mana Elemental) under its playtest name Arcanic Enigma; the exact mapping is still unconfirmed. The fight itself: two Mana Phantoms accompany the boss, and their Mana Burn is very taxing on whoever is targeted, so burn them down quickly. The boss will occasionally CC a group member for 8 seconds with an arcane cage that must be dispelled with Magic dispel; the healer may want to stand far from the rest of the group, as the boss casts an AOE on targets close to it. Small Arcane Manalings spawn continuously throughout the fight and need to be cleaved down — they are a lower priority than the Phantoms, and the boss will not spawn additional Phantoms during the encounter.",
    "它是联盟任务「高地的恐怖」的猎杀目标 —— 在副本内击杀后拾取可怕的根核，带回给绿色守卫者雷希耶尔。战斗机制以实机为准。": "It is the target of the Alliance quest \"Horrors in the Highland\" — kill it inside the dungeon and bring the root core back to Rethiel the Greenwarden.",
    "——施放，带一只火焰元素宠物；——标准近战，能；——施放和；——标准近战，会；——打人很痛，低血量会狂怒；——圣骑士型，会治疗术；——标准近战。": "— casts , comes with a fire elemental pet; — standard melee, can ; — casts and ; — standard melee that can ; — hits hard and Enrage at low HP; — paladin type, can cast Heal; — standard melee.",
    "——牧师型，会和治疗术；——标准近战，施放；——近战，高伤害攻击；——施法型，有魔爆术和。": "— priest-like, can and Heal; — standard melee, casts ; — melee, high damage attack ; — caster type with Arcane Explosion & .",
    "——能自我治疗并施放；——施放火球术；——纯近战，会脚踢打施法者。": "— can self heal and cast ; — casts Fireball; — melee only, can Kick casters.",
    "三位小首领身后的蜘蛛房必须全清，才能解锁通往吞咽者拉姆斯登与男爵的大门。": "The spider rooms behind three mini-bosses must be fully cleared to unlock the gates toward Ramstein and the Baron.",
    "三只稀有精英（永醒的艾希尔、死灵勇士、铁脊死灵）刷新概率约 5%。看到落单的无拘之灵就是刷新点，清掉周围的亡灵怪，它们每 10-15 分钟重刷一次。": "Three rare spawns (Azshir the Sleepless, Fallen Champion, Ironspine) have roughly a 5% chance to be up. An isolated Unfettered Spirit marks a spawn point — kill the lone undead nearby and they respawn every 10-15 minutes.",
    "三名卫兵全是近战技能，远程保持距离就能规避大部分伤害。": "All three guards use melee abilities only — ranged attackers can avoid most damage by keeping their distance.",
    "上岛后在巨魔废墟间找到沉没洞穴（Sunken Hollow）；": "",
    "上岸后沿提瑞斯法林地的大路向东北走即可到达修道院。40 级以上有坐骑也可以改走西瘟疫之地，一路向西进入提瑞斯法林地——注意刚过境就是中立营地绝望壁垒，小心行事。": "From there follow the main road northeast through Tirisfal Glades to the monastery. If you're 40+ with a mount, you can alternatively travel from Western Plaguelands and run west into Tirisfal Glades — be careful, you'll cross right by the Horde encampment called the Bulwark.",
    "下 conserve 区的萨特群体有施法者与治疗，优先打断，逐组拉动。": "Satyr packs in the Lower Conservatory have casters and healers - interrupt and pull carefully.",
    "下层不需要钥匙，但建议顺路做晋升印章任务链，为进上层做准备。": "No key needed, but start the Seal of Ascension chain for UBRS.",
    "不可宽恕者 在地图 4 号位置的走廊刷新，开怪时会带上几只非精英小怪，所以不要在身上还带着别的怪、或者血蓝不满的情况下开他。除了这些小怪和一个附带减速效果的暗影法术之外，他没有任何真正的机制。": "The Unforgiven spawns in the corridor labeled 4 on the map, together with a few non-elite adds, so do not engage while already fighting other mobs or at low health and mana. He has no real mechanics beyond the adds and a shadow spell that also slows.",
    "不稳定的哨兵只有一个关键机制：「故障」—— 短暂起手后对 25 码内所有人造成高额伤害。远程全程保持最大距离，近战看到起手就跑出范围；等级和配置够硬的话近战也可以选择硬吃，但善待治疗是底线。注意：接近 boss 时旁边的建筑里会刷出非精英的愤怒魔典 —— 开怪前先清掉，战斗会轻松不少。": "Unstable Sentinel has one defining mechanic: Malfunction. Malfunction has a short wind-up before unleashing heavy AOE damage to anyone within 25 yards. Ranged players should stay at max range for the entire fight, and melee players should run out whenever you see the wind-up. Depending on your level and group composition you could likely stay in as a melee, but being kind to the healer should be the baseline. Note: non-elite enemies called Angry Tomes will spawn from the buildings as you approach the boss — kill these before engaging the fight to make things a little bit easier.",
    "不稳定的哨兵的「故障」有短暂起手，随后对 25 码内所有人造成重创：远程全程最大距离，近战看到起手就出。": "Unstable Sentinel's Malfunction has a short wind-up, then hits everyone within 25 yards hard: ranged stay at max range for the whole fight, melee run out when you see the wind-up.",
    "与古拉鲁克一样，这场战斗相当轻松：坦克背靠墙拉住，团队保持距离输出，顺利击杀即可。顺带一提，有的队伍开跑前会先做 /tar Jed Runewatcher，集合频道里那句“LFM UBRS doing Jed/Rend”就是从这儿来的。": "Just as with Goraluk , this fight is quite easy. Tank him back against the wall with raid group at range, which should lead to a straightforward kill. Charge Shield Bash Heroic Strike Note : Some groups will do a /tar Jed Runewatcher before beginning the run. This is where the origin of the chat message \"LFM UBRS doing Jed/Rend\" runs comes from.",
    "与图腾师类似，但改放——类似旋风的技能，将目标击昏 10 秒。如果中招的是治疗，坦克要当心别多拉。应对织尘者的最佳方式是一次只拉一只，并让混合职业随时准备给坦克补一手治疗。": "is similar to the Totemic, only instead of a rooting totem, it can cast which is a cyclone-like ability that stuns a target for 10 seconds. If this is cast on the healer, the tank should be wary of pulling too many mobs. The best way to deal with the dustweavers is to pull only 1 at a time and have the hybrid classes prepared to toss a heal onto the tank if necessary.",
    "东区的植物怪会把玩家缠绕定身，被缠住的队友要立刻集火解救。": "Warpwood elementals entangle players - free rooted teammates quickly.",
    "主宰拉姆塔斯单体伤害很高，身边还跟着两只剃刀沼泽刺鬃守卫，它们的旋风倾泻极具威胁。为免坦克被瞬间打崩，尽量把两只刺鬃守卫都控制住，然后集火拉姆塔斯即可轻松取胜。": "Overlord Ramtusk is a vivaciously strong boss with high single target damage. He is also flanked by 2 Razorfen Spearhide, whose Whirling Barrage ability makes them particularly lethal. In order to prevent your tank from getting decimated, make sure to CC both of the spearhides if you can. From there, focus down Ramtusk for an easy kill.",
    "乌克兹·沙顶是 48 级精英沙怒巨魔，身边跟着 46 级精英卢兹鲁。把这两个背对队伍，近战站背后躲避顺劈斩，先击杀鲁兹鲁，再处理乌克兹。": "Chief Ukorz Sandscalp is a level 48 elite Sandfury Troll, and is accompanied by a level 46 elite Ruuzlu. Make sure to face these two away from the group. Melee should stay behind them to avoid the cleave. Kill Ruuzlu first.",
    "乌克兹与鲁兹鲁双精英收尾，近战站背后躲顺劈，先杀鲁兹鲁。": "For the twin-elite finale, melee stay behind to dodge cleaves and kill Ruuzlu first.",
    "乌洛克召唤战前确认长矛任务物品已插好，战斗中每30秒可秒杀一只食人魔。": "Place the pike before Urok's encounter; click it every 30s to instakill an ogre.",
    "乌洛克是60级精英召唤boss。遭遇开始后，在他本人登场之前会先涌出多波精英食人魔。关键在于利用插在贡品堆上的长矛：每30秒可以选中一个食人魔点击长矛，直接秒杀该波中的一只食人魔，以此控制每波同时面对的数量。别忘了在点长矛之余配合控制技能，波次积累起来会非常吃紧。大约杀掉10只左右后，乌洛克才会终于现身。他拥有战士类的技能，包括破胆咆哮恐惧。开打前确保坦克拉稳仇恨，再放开输出。": "Urok Doomhowl is a level 60 elite summoned boss found within Lower . When Urok Doomhowl's encounter begins, many waves of elite ogres will appear first, before Urok himself. The key is to utilize the pike that you placed in the Tribute Pile. Every 30 seconds, you can click on the pike while targeting an ogre to insta-kill single ogre from a wave. This will help manage the number of mobs you fight at once per wave. Don't forget to also utilize CC in addition to clicking the pike, as these waves can get overwhelming over time. After you kill about 10 or so, Urok Doomhowl will finally appear. He's has warrior type abilities, including his Intimidating Roar fear. Make sure your tank has proper aggro before unleashing DPS on him.",
    "亡语者贾格巴会带着两名施法小怪一起开战，难度不小。他的统御意志能精神控制你的一名队友，足以扭转战局；两名施法小怪的伤害也非常可观。想安稳打完，至少控制住旁边一只小怪，最好两只都控。先快速击杀贾格巴解除精神控制的威胁，再回头收拾施法小怪。": "Death Speaker Jargba pulls with two caster mobs, making this fight quite tough. With his Dominate Mind ability, Jargba can turn the tides of battle by MCing one of your party members. Additionally, the caster allies do massive amounts of damage. In order to survive this engagement, you must CC at least 1 of the mobs beside Jargba, ideally both. Take the boss out quickly to get rid of the MC threat, and then finish off the casters to ensure victory.",
    "亡语者贾格巴的精神控制与主宰拉姆塔斯的高爆发是两大翻车点，开怪前务必清场控怪。": "Death Speaker Jargba's mind control and Overlord Ramtusk's burst damage are the two main wipe points — clear and CC before engaging.",
    "从东瘟疫之地西北角的斯坦索姆正门进入，沿街道推进，血色区与市集区都在这一侧。": "Enter through the main gate of Stratholme in northwestern Eastern Plaguelands — the Scarlet side and Market Row both lie along this route.",
    "从侧门（传染病穴）进入，即可到达亡灵区": "Take the service entrance (the Infectious Cavern) to reach the undead side",
    "从南海镇沿路北上进入奥特兰克山脉（首次前往是一段不短的路程），找到重建开放、穹顶已消失的达拉然城；": "Follow the road north from Southshore into the Alterac Mountains (a bit of a hike the first time) and find the rebuilt, dome-free city of Dalaran;",
    "从塞拉摩沿东海岸向北走，游过一段海面登上奥卡兹岛；": "",
    "从守望堡向东走到神庙区域。": "Head east from Watch Tower to the temple.",
    "从幽暗城出发，经银松森林、希尔斯布莱德丘陵进入湿地，沿路向东走到瑟根石（Thelgen Rock）—— 一路记得在塔伦米尔与落锤镇开飞行点；入口在瑟根石东南、丹奥加兹以西的山丘上（约 47.8, 56.3），是立在大树下的蓝色雾柱传送门，位于维尔加挖掘场遗址东南方地势更高处，入口旁设有集合石（约 53.4, 65.3）。": "",
    "从幽暗城飞往阿拉希高地的落锤镇，跑进悲伤沼泽抵达斯通纳德。出斯通纳德向西，穿过沼泽找到阿塔哈卡神庙区域。神庙四周环水，潜到中央水下平台从入口进入副本。": "Fly to Hammerfall in Arathi Highlands and run into the Swamp of Sorrows to Stonard.Head west from Stonard to the Temple of Atal'Hakkar area.Swim across the moat and enter from the submerged entrance.",
    "从暴风城出发，经暮色森林和逆风小径抵达悲伤沼泽，联盟据点守望堡在西侧。": "From Stormwind, travel through Duskwood and Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows; the Alliance camp Watch Tower is on the west side.",
    "从暴风城港口坐船到奥伯丁；": "Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine;",
    "从暴风城飞抵燃烧平原的摩根哨岗（或经暮色森林跑图）。": "Fly to Morgan's Vigil in Burning Steppes (or run via Duskwood).",
    "从橙门进入首先穿越腐孢洞穴：精英、混在非精英怪堆中，术士的在这里控场很好用。穿过洞穴时点掉幼虫喷吐器，阻止幼虫继续刷新；洞穴尽头的水池里等着你的是诺克赛恩（诺克赛恩）。": "Foulspore Cavern is the first area if you zone in from the orange entrance. You'll encounter elite mobs such as and mixed in with packs of non-elite . A works nicely here to help crowd control the elites. As you make your way through the cavern, look for the Larva Spewer to click on to cease the arrival of more larvae, and you'll find Noxxion waiting for you in a pool towards the end.",
    "从正门进入后右转（直行是活人区）": "Enter through the main gate, then turn right (straight ahead is the live side)",
    "从正门进入（活人区/血色区一侧）": "Enter through the main gate (the live/Scarlet side)",
    "从湿地的米奈希尔港乘船到塞拉摩（尘泥沼泽）；": "",
    "从瑟根石往东南方的山丘爬上去，在维尔加挖掘场遗址东南方高处寻找大树下的蓝雾传送门（约 47.8, 56.3），入口旁设有集合石（约 53.4, 65.3）。": "",
    "从米奈希尔港乘船前往塞拉摩岛。": "Take the boat from Menethil Harbor to Theramore Isle.",
    "从米奈希尔港码头左侧乘船前往塞拉摩岛。": "Take the boat on the left side of the docks in Menethil Harbor to Theramore Isle.",
    "从紫门进入首先穿越邪枝洞窟：精英/混在以远程攻击为主的非精英怪堆中；腐烂巡影者常年潜行巡逻，开怪前多留意！区域元素怪会放战争践踏，会施放纠缠根须。通往维利塔恩（维利塔恩）的路上，最大的忌讳就是引到不必要的额外怪。": "The Wicked Grotto is the first area you'll discover once zoning in from the purple entrance. You'll encounter an elite and/or mixed in with packs of non-elite who usually attack with ranged abilities. Putridus Shadowstalker usually patrol areas in stealth, so keep an eye out for them! Elementals that roam the area are who use War Stomp and who cast Entangling Roots. The biggest concern on the way to Lord Vyletongue is not pulling any unnecessary additional mobs.",
    "从荒芜之地的卡加斯向西跑进黑石山。进入黑石山后沿内部环桥走到中央下层平台，入口就在血色监牢一侧。没有暗炉钥匙时从正门长廊清怪进入；有钥匙可开侧门直达后半区。": "From Kargath in the Badlands, run west into Blackrock Mountain.Follow the inner ring down to the lower central platform; the entrance is by the Detention Block.Without the Shadowforge Key, fight through the main hallway; with it, open the side doors.",
    "从荒芜之地的卡加斯向西跑进黑石山。黑石塔入口在内部环桥的上层平台，与黑石深渊入口相对。进入后沿走廊下行即达下层区域，无需钥匙。": "From Kargath in the Badlands, run west into Blackrock Mountain.The entrance is on the upper central platform, across from BRD.Head down the hallway into the lower section; no key required.",
    "从荒芜之地的卡加斯向西跑进黑石山。黑石塔入口在内部环桥的上层平台，进入后先穿下层走廊。在黑石塔下层深处由持有晋升印章的队友开启通往上层的龙人门。": "From Kargath in the Badlands, run west into Blackrock Mountain.Take the upper platform entrance and fight through the LBRS hallway.A Seal of Ascension holder opens the drake door to UBRS deep in LBRS.",
    "从菲拉斯的羽月要塞出发，向东北进入厄运之槌区域。": "From Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas, head northeast to Dire Maul.",
    "从菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地出发，向北进入厄运之槌区域。厄运之槌是一座环形废墟都市，东区入口在东北一侧。没有月牙钥匙时从正门进入并沿通道推进；有钥匙可开东区各道内门。": "From Camp Mojache in Feralas, head north to Dire Maul.Dire Maul is a circular ruin complex; the East entrance is on the northeastern side.Without the Crescent Key, push through the main hallway; with it, open the inner doors.",
    "从藏宝海湾出发，沿野蛮海岸向南游泳前往吉利吉姆岛；": "",
    "他是典型的圣骑士型首领。注意他的制裁之锤和可以施放圣盾术的能力。击败他之后，大检察官怀特迈恩会从祭坛后面跑出来，第二场战斗随即开始。技能：惩罚光环 制裁之锤 十字军打击 圣疗术 圣盾术": "He's your typical paladin-type boss. Watch out for his Hammer of Justice and his ability to Divine Shield. After you defeat him, High Inquisitor Whitemane will run out from behind the altar and that fight will begin. Abilities: Retribution Aura Hammer of Justice Crusader Strike Lay on Hands Divine Shield",
    "伊兰尼库斯的阴影是55级精英，开怪时会把副本里残留的龙人全部召到他身边，所以开打前务必把场上龙人清理干净。远程保持出近战范围，躲开他的群体眩晕技能战争践踏；当前仇恨最高的目标会中深度沉睡，可以用渐隐术、拯救祝福、佯攻这类降仇恨技能来控制由谁来承受。近战永远别站龙头前面，同样提防战争践踏。按机制稳步输出即可，战斗时间很长，治疗注意控蓝！": "Shade of Eranikus, a level 55 elite, will summon any leftover dragonkin in the instance to his side, so it’s important to make sure you’ve cleared them all before pulling the boss. Ranged, stay out of melee range to avoid his AoE stun ability, War Stomp. The target with the highest threat will get afflicted with Deep Slumber. Players can use anti-aggro abilities such as Fade, Blessing of Salvation and Feint to help control who gets afflicted with Deep Slumber. Melee, never stand in front of the boss and be wary of his War Stomp ability. DPS him down following the mechanics and you’ll be fine. It’s a long fight so healers, be sure to keep an eye on your mana pool!",
    "伊森迪奥斯是可选boss，但大多数队伍（连做熔岩奔跑的都算）都会顺手把他打掉：好杀，而且他就守在铁匠要用的黑铁砧旁边。伊森迪奥斯本身不难，但坦克和全团都要小心别被击飞下平台——掉下去除了死一次，没有别的办法上来。": "Lord Incendius is an optional boss, but most groups (even those doing Lava Runs ) tend to grab him as he is an easy kill. He is also located by the Black Anvil, needed by Blacksmiths . Lord Incendius is not difficult, but tanks and group members need to make sure they don't get knocked off the platform because there is no getting back up outside of dying.",
    "伊琳娜·暗木 的打法就像打一个猎人，身边还带着宠物熊 费拉。除了 献祭陷阱 之外，她的所有技能都可以通过近身贴脸来规避。大多数队伍会先集火杀掉 伊琳娜·暗木，再回头收拾 费拉。": "Illyanna Ravenoak fights just like a hunter, accompanied by her pet bear Ferra. All of her abilities except Immolation Trap can be negated by standing in melee range of her. Most groups burn down Illyanna Ravenoak first, then kill Ferra.",
    "伊琳娜·暗木是猎人型首领，近身贴脸可以规避她的大部分技能。": "Illyanna Ravenoak fights like a hunter — standing in melee range negates most of her abilities.",
    "伊莫塔尔 会在房间各处召唤眼睛，指派一人（最好是远程）负责清掉。血量降到 50% 时他会施放 狂怒，治疗要准备好对坦克刷大治疗。他还会随机把玩家传送到房间中央——如果被传走的是坦克，等他跑回来重新建立仇恨即可。开怪前先清掉全部法力尖塔，他的护盾才会消失。": "Immol'thar will summon eyes around the room — assign someone, preferably a ranged attacker, to dispose of them. He will cast Enrage at 50% health, so healers should be ready with big heals on the tank. He also randomly teleports players to the middle of the room — if it is the tank, let them run back and re-establish aggro. Clear all the mana pylons first so his shield drops.",
    "伊莫塔尔牢笼前的走廊两侧布满法力尖塔，全部清掉之后他的护盾才会消失，通道才会打开。": "Mana pylons line the corridor to Immol'thar's prison — destroy every one of them to drop his shield and open the way forward.",
    "伊莫塔尔牢笼前的走廊巡逻密集，潜行职业能大幅降低清怪压力。": "The corridor before Immol'thar's prison is thick with patrols — stealth classes ease the run considerably.",
    "伊露希亚·巴罗夫是 60 级精英，位于下层北边的房间（巴罗夫家族墓窖）。她最大的威胁是统御意志——一个精神控制机制，中了的人要用昏迷或控制技能按住。她还会施放范围沉默和恐惧术，开怪前把她周围整个区域清干净。技能：痛苦诅咒 统御意志 恐惧术 沉默 暗影震击": "Lady Illucia Barov is a level 60 elite located in the northern room of the lower level (The Barov Family Vault). The biggest concern with fighting Lady Illucia Barov is her ability to Dominate Mind, a mind control mechanic. Be sure to stun or CC whoever is afflicted with Dominate Mind. She can also cast an AoE Silence and Fear, so make sure her entire area is clear before engaging. Abilities: Bane of Agony Dominate Mind Fear Silence Shadow Shock",
    "优先击杀缚地图腾与施法小怪，避免被定身、击昏连锁坑掉整队。": "Prioritize the Earthgrab Totems and caster mobs; roots and stuns chained on the wrong target can wipe the group.",
    "会「刷怪」的草丛": "Living grass (Pokémon mechanic)",
    "会把玩家缠绕定身，被缠住的人无法行动，队友应立刻集火解救或驱散。": "They entangle players - burst down the root or free your allies quickly.",
    "会施放治疗法术恢复同伴生命，优先打断或集火击杀，避免小怪战无限拖时。": "They heal their allies - interrupt or focus them down first to keep trash fights short.",
    "传令官基尔图诺斯是 60 级精英，位于阳台上，只有队伍里有人持有召唤道具时才能召唤。坦克接住仇恨并背靠墙站，防止被击退。人形态下他会使用施法者技能，让有驱散能力的队友解掉诅咒，尤其是套在治疗身上的那种。等他变成石像鬼形态后，只要坦克保持仇恨，就是一场标准的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。技能：无力诅咒 虚弱诅咒 麻痹之毒": "Kirtonos the Herald is a level 60 elite located out on the porch; he can only be summoned if someone in your group has the summoning item. Tank, grab aggro and keep your back to a wall to prevent knockback. In human form, Kirtonos the Herald uses his caster abilities — have someone dispel the curse, especially if it's on your healer. Once Kirtonos the Herald transforms into his gargoyle form, it becomes a tank and spank fight so long as your tank maintains aggro. Abilities: Curse of Impotence Curse of Weakness Paralyzing Poison",
    "传送门周围游荡着 26 级的高地陆行龟与 28-29 级精英高地潜行者，找入口时别顺手引到。": "Around the portal live level 26 Highland Tortoises and elite Highland Lurkers of 28-29 — don't pull them while finding the entrance.",
    "修行者高罗什打法就像一个带着旋风斩效果和致死打击的战士。在致死打击减益的间隙把治疗量拉满，只要治疗能撑过他每次致死打击的周期，这就是一场轻松的战斗。": "Gorosh the Dervish is like a warrior with Whirlwind and Mortal Strike. Maximize healing output outside of the Mortal Strike debuff. It is an easy fight as long as healer can sustain through the use Mortal Strike.",
    "傀儡与哨兵类怪物高甲高血且免疫 DoT，用直伤爆发处理，别用持续伤害磨。": "Golems and sentinels have high armor/HP and DoT immunity — burn them with direct damage instead of DoTs.",
    "傀儡统帅阿格曼奇是又一个大多数队伍打几轮之后就绕开的可选boss，也是本副本最难的战斗之一，这正是很多人干脆不碰他的原因。进这间房的主要理由是他旁边的图纸——每个团队都需要一名能制造这件物品的工程师，做好常来的准备。这场战斗难在闪电链：队伍一旦扎堆，伤害就会源源不断。真正的关键是散开站位，不让闪电链在目标之间随意弹跳，这是本场最主要的减员机制。": "Golem Lord Argelmach is an another optional boss that most avoid after the first few runs. It is one of the more challenging fights in , which is one reason why many avoid the fight all together. The primary reason to enter this room is for the , which is near Golem Lord Argelmach. Every raid will want an engineer who is able to craft this item, so be prepared to visit a lot. Golem Lord Argelmach is a difficult fight because of Chain Lightning. It is an unrelenting amount of damage if you're group is stacked too close together. As such, the real key to this fight is remaining spread out so that Chain Lightning doesn't freely bounce from target to target, which is the major killing mechanic on this fight.",
    "先清干净盐脊周边的小怪，这场战斗本身非常简单。它会不断对坦克施放「裂筋」，减速很重但不影响整体打法；周期性对 10 码内的目标施放「尘暴」，命中几率降低 25% —— 远程职业别站在近战位里。": "A very simple fight as long as you clear out the nearby mobs first. Saltspine casts Thunder Clap on the tank — a heavy slow that does not change how you play — and periodically Dust Storm on everyone within 10 yards, reducing attacks' chance to hit by 25%; casters should stay out of melee range.",
    "克罗卡斯 的攻击非常疼，还会用 破胆怒吼 恐惧队员。他的血量降到 50% 左右时会召唤两只 戈多克掠夺者——准备好控制这些小怪，并让坦克稳住对 克罗卡斯 的仇恨。和其他卫兵一样，施法者尽量保持最远距离输出。打贡品跑法时穿上戈多克伪装与他对话，可以完全跳过这场战斗。": "Captain Kromcrush hits very hard and can fear party members with Intimidating Shout. At around 50% health he will summon two Gordok Reaver to his side — be ready to control the adds and keep the tank's aggro on Captain Kromcrush. Casters should stay at max range, as with the other guards. On a tribute run you can skip this fight entirely by wearing the Gordok disguise and talking your way past him.",
    "克罗卡斯血量 50% 会召唤两只小怪，提前留好控制技能。": "Captain Kromcrush summons two adds at 50% health — save crowd control for them.",
    "入口不在街道上：从街面的格栅下到下水道，穿过地下腹地（Underbelly）后沿一根长管道走到尽头的紫色传送门。部落侧的闸门需要用「达拉然下水道钥匙」开启。": "The entrance is not on the streets: drop through a grate into the sewers, cross the Underbelly and follow a long pipe to a purple portal. The Horde-side gate is opened with a Dalaran Sewer Key.",
    "入口是立在大树下的一道蓝雾之柱，从瑟根石方向上山即可找到。": "The entrance is a column of blue mist under a large tree, reached from Thelgen Rock.",
    "入口沿途有半人马把守，建议组好队再进入。": "Centaurs guard the path, so group up before entering.",
    "全队叠点站位能显著降低亚门纳尔与冰冻之灵的范围技能威胁。": "Stacking on the tank greatly reduces the threat of Amnennar's and the Freezing Spirits' AoE abilities.",
    "兰斯利德与瑟莱德丝公主都有击退，坦克背靠墙、远程最远距离输出。": "Landslide and Princess Theradras both knock back — tank against a wall and keep ranged at max distance.",
    "兰斯利德是毒瀑的 50 级精英巨兽，技能与路上遇到的原始巨兽类似。原地开打：坦克背靠墙拉住，远程保持最远距离，规避击退与瑟莱德丝碎片的眩晕——这些小石头人会在兰斯利德死亡后消失。": "Landslide is a level 50 elite Behemoth found in Poison Falls. He has many similar abilities to the Primordial Behemoth that you fought on the way to his alcove. Keep him near the area in which he stands. Tanks, tank him with your back to a wall. Ranged, stay at max distance to avoid any knockback or stun from the Theradrim Shardling, who despawn once Landslide dies.",
    "典狱官斯迪尔基斯与维雷克同时出现。对五人小队来说这场战斗并不难：先集火杀掉典狱官斯迪尔基斯，再转火维雷克。": "Warder Stilgiss spawns with Verek. The fight is not difficult for a five man group. Just kill Warder Stilgiss first and then Verek next.",
    "兽人堆里有治疗者和施法者，优先击杀或打断，逐组拉动防止连锁。": "Orc packs contain healers and casters - interrupt and pull pack by pack.",
    "军械库小怪": "Armory trash",
    "军械库的小怪 32-42 级，一次至少会拉到两三只，需要时用控制技能。": "Armory mobs range from level 32-42, and most pulls contain at least two or three mobs — use crowd control when needed.",
    "军需官兹格雷斯 &lt;血斧军团&gt;是下层的一名精英boss，战斗本身不复杂，坦克拉住正常击杀即可。": "Quartermaster Zigris is an elite boss found within Lower .",
    "冰冻之灵": "Freezing Spirit",
    "出幽暗城沿大路向东北走，一路顺着路就能到修道院。从奥格瑞玛出发的话，在城外搭弗蕾扎<飞艇管理员>的飞艇到提瑞斯法林地的幽暗城。修道院大厅里最右边那扇敞开的门是图书馆入口。": "From the Undercity, simply follow the path northeast through Tirisfal Glades and you'll reach the monastery. From Orgrimmar, take Frezza <Zeppelin Master>'s zeppelin to the Undercity. The Library entrance is the open doorway on the far right of the monastery hallway.",
    "出幽暗城沿大路向东北走，一路顺着路就能到修道院。从奥格瑞玛出发的话，在城外搭弗蕾扎<飞艇管理员>的飞艇到提瑞斯法林地的幽暗城。修道院大厅里最左边那扇敞开的门就是墓地入口。": "From the Undercity, simply follow the path northeast through Tirisfal Glades and you'll reach the monastery. From Orgrimmar, take Frezza <Zeppelin Master>'s zeppelin to the Undercity. The Graveyard entrance is the open doorway on the far left of the monastery hallway.",
    "出幽暗城沿大路向东北走，一路顺着路就能到修道院。从奥格瑞玛出发的话，在城外搭弗蕾扎<飞艇管理员>的飞艇到提瑞斯法林地的幽暗城。军械库的门锁着，需要奥法师杜安掉落的血色钥匙，位于右侧数第二扇（图书馆入口左边）。": "From the Undercity, simply follow the path northeast through Tirisfal Glades and you'll reach the monastery. From Orgrimmar, take Frezza <Zeppelin Master>'s zeppelin to the Undercity. The Armory door is locked (requires the Scarlet Key from Arcanist Doan) and is the second door from the right, just left of the Library entrance.",
    "出幽暗城沿大路向东北走，一路顺着路就能到修道院。从奥格瑞玛出发的话，在城外搭弗蕾扎<飞艇管理员>的飞艇到提瑞斯法林地的幽暗城。教堂的门锁着，需要血色钥匙，位于左侧数第二扇（墓地入口右边）。": "From the Undercity, simply follow the path northeast through Tirisfal Glades and you'll reach the monastery. From Orgrimmar, take Frezza <Zeppelin Master>'s zeppelin to the Undercity. The Cathedral door is locked (requires the Scarlet Key) and is the second door from the left, just right of the Graveyard entrance.",
    "出港后沿路向东走到瑟根石；": "",
    "击杀副本地上的邮差类小怪可获钥匙，打开对应邮箱；第三个邮箱会触发邮差马龙。": "Key-dropping mobs guard mailboxes across the instance — the third mailbox spawns Postmaster Malown.",
    "击杀后原地留下一片回复法力的领域，站在里面就能回蓝 —— 法系职业别浪费。": "Once defeated it leaves behind an area that restores mana to whoever stands inside it — make sure to make use of that field.",
    "击杀德拉维沃尔与德姆塞卡尔之后，另外两条龙哈扎斯与摩弗拉斯会在梦想者之穴外的走廊现身。打法与前面两条完全一致：尽量别一次引到两条，并清干净附近的小怪。这是面对伊兰尼库斯的阴影之前的最后两场硬仗。": "After killing Weaver & Dreamscythe, two more drakes, Hazzas & Morphaz, will spawn in the hallway right outside the Chamber of the Dreamer . Fighting Hazzas and Morphaz is the same strategy as the previous two drakes. Try not to pull both at the same time and avoid any trash in the area. These are the last two big kills before Shade of Eranikus.",
    "击败公主后跳下扎埃塔之穴，水里还有洛特格里普与工匠吉兹洛克两个收尾 boss。": "After the Princess, drop into Zaetar's Cave for the final two bosses: Rotgrip and Tinkerer Gizlock.",
    "分布在大厅与熔岩区，会施放火焰系法术，火抗装能显著减低压力。": "Found along lava halls; they cast fire spells - fire resistance helps a lot.",
    "别急着进礼拜堂：先把外面的怪慢慢往外拉清掉。进了礼拜堂之后必须清完全部怪再开首领，提前引到首领会让所有残留的怪（包括祭坛两侧房间的）全部加入战斗。": "Don't rush into the Chapel: slowly pull the mobs outside first. Once inside, clear every pack before engaging the bosses — pulling the boss prematurely aggroes every remaining mob, including the packs beside the altar.",
    "别错过贝尼斯特拉兹的护送事件，奖励丰厚且引出最终 boss。": "Don't skip the Belnistrasz escort event — great rewards and it culminates in the final boss.",
    "剃刀图腾师": "Razorfen Totemic",
    "剃刀沼泽是野猪人巢穴风格的线性副本，考验小怪控制与打断，30 级上下的经典进阶本。": "Razorfen Kraul is a linear quillboar-den dungeon where trash control and interrupts matter as much as the bosses — a classic step-up dungeon around level 30.",
    "剃刀织尘者": "Razorfen Dustweaver",
    "剃刀高地是天灾亡灵与巨型蜘蛛盘踞的地下巢穴，含护送与敲锣两个小事件，40 级上下的经典过渡本。": "Razorfen Downs is a Scourge-infested underground lair with an escort event and a gong-summon fight — a classic stepping-stone dungeon around level 40.",
    "前往东瘟疫之地西北角的斯坦索姆城门": "Travel to the Stratholme gate in northwestern Eastern Plaguelands",
    "前往塔纳利斯，沿环形山西侧的坡道下行进入安戈洛环形山（也可经希利苏斯走东北侧坡道）；": "",
    "前往新区域「河林」（40-45 级区域）；": "",
    "前往牺牲之坑西侧即可进入堕落者的圣所，清完沿途小怪并做好开怪准备。哈卡的化身是48级精英，只有队里有人接了相关任务、或已完成该任务并持有后续道具时才能召唤——后者可以不用圣甲虫之蛋直接召唤哈卡莱护血者。不断击杀刷新的小怪，直到出现哈卡莱护血者，杀掉并从尸体上拾取血液。团队通常把这阶段设为自由拾取，让指定的一人统一拾血（哈卡现身之后记得改回来！）。用血液浇熄房间里的四个火盆之一，如此反复，直到再次刷出哈卡莱护血者、四个火盆全部熄灭。如果浇熄最后一个火盆前全队都贴近墙壁站位，可以在开怪前先脱离战斗。本体战斗相当直白：他会随机对一名玩家施放导致疯狂，最好的应对是眩晕或控制该玩家直到其恢复正常；有机会的话也驱散掉暗言术：痛。其余时间全力输出，准备迎接胜利！": "Head to the west side of the Pit of Sacrifice and you’ll enter the Sanctum of the Fallen God . Clear the trash along the way and to prepare for the encounter. Avatar of Hakkar, a level 48 elite, cannot be summoned unless someone in your group has from the quest OR, has already completed the aforementioned quest and has , which allows the player to summon Hakkari Bloodkeeper without the egg. Kill the adds until a Hakkari Bloodkeeper spawns. Kill it and grab the from the corpse. Groups usually keep Free-for-All loot on in this encounter so one designated person can loot the bloods. (Don't forget to switch it back after Hakkar spawns!) Using the blood, you can extinguish one of the four braziers in the room. Proceed until another Hakkari Bloodkeeper spawns, and all of the braziers are extinguished. If everyone moves close to a wall before extinguishing the final brazier, you can drop combat before engaging the Avatar of Hakkar. The fight itself is pretty straightforward. He'll cast Cause Insanity on a random player. The best strategy is to stun or CC that player until they're returned to normal. If possible, Dispel Shadow Word: Pain - Spell - Classic World of Warcraft, too. Otherwise, DPS him down and prepare for victory!",
    "前往菲拉斯中部的厄运之槌，进入食人魔营地": "Travel to Dire Maul in central Feralas and enter the ogre compound",
    "剜眼者是烦人大于困难的一位。暗影箭雨相当讨厌，但不至于灭团。牧师在这里可以善用防护暗影，额外的暗影抗性会让这场战斗变得毫无压力。": "Eviscerator is more annoying than difficult. Shadow Bolt Volley can be rather annoying, but it shouldn't kill the group. That said, priests can utilize Shadow Protection to their advantage here. The additional shadow resistance makes the fight trivial.",
    "副本 24-29 级（Group Finder 列为 26-33），beta 已开放 —— 下列 boss 打法随版本更新持续核对。": "The dungeon is listed at levels 24-29 (Group Finder says 26-33) and is now open in the beta — boss strategies below will be re-checked as the beta moves on.",
    "副本 35-40 级，beta 尚未开放；目前的信息全部来自 BlizzCon 演示与探索者，细节可能变化。": "The dungeon is listed at levels 35-40 and is not open in the beta yet; everything known comes from the BlizzCon demo and explorers, so details may change.",
    "副本中散落着多个上锁的邮箱，对应的钥匙由附近小怪掉落；打开第三个邮箱会触发邮差马龙和他的三个精英卫兵，开箱前先清理周围。": "Several locked mailboxes are scattered through the instance, each opened by a key dropped from nearby mobs; the third mailbox triggers Postmaster Malown and his three elite guards, so clear the area before opening it.",
    "副本中段的阶梯事件会连续刷出数波精英巨魔，控制节奏、逐波拉杀，最后一波即为耐克鲁姆与暗影祭司塞瑟斯。": "The mid-dungeon stairs event throws several waves of elite trolls at the group. Pace the pulls, clear wave by wave — the final wave spawns Nekrum Gutchewer and Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz.",
    "副本位于凄凉之地：从暗影村落向北、科多兽墓地以西即到长矛谷，巨大石门便是入口，沿途半人马把守，建议组好队再进入。副本有橙色水晶与紫色水晶两条通道，进入后内部互通；拿到塞雷布拉斯权杖后，可开启直通地鸣瀑布底部的传送门。": "The Valley of Spears is north of Shadowprey Village and west of the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace; centaurs guard the path, so group up before entering. Two entrances (orange and purple crystal paths) interconnect inside; with the Scepter of Celebras you can open a portal to the base of Earth Song Falls.",
    "副本位于吉利吉姆岛（Gillijim's Isle），荆棘谷西南的海上。目前没有船或飞行点直达，beta 探索者从荆棘谷南部的野蛮海岸游泳上岛；入口在岛上的「沉没洞穴」（Sunken Hollow）里，洞穴尽头是一道蓝色传送门。": "",
    "副本位于新区域「河林」中的一座巨型户外食人魔要塞。目前没有更具体的入口位置情报，40 级后探索河林、寻找被食人魔占据的村庄与要塞即可找到。": "",
    "副本位于环形山的山丘地带，具体入口位置待 beta 确认。": "",
    "副本位于艾萨拉的一道大门之后：部落可从奥格瑞玛向东北进入艾萨拉，沿路寻找大门；大门之后通往副本的具体路线待 beta 确认。": "",
    "副本内含四个区域：失落沼泽、潜行者灌木丛、守护者遗址与失落挖掘场。": "The files name four areas inside: Lost Marsh, Stalker's Thicket, Site of the Guardian and Lost Dig Site.",
    "副本内的原生生物包括迅猛龙（灌木丛潜行者、灌木丛猎人、灌木丛女家长）、鳄鱼、高地蜘蛛、沼泽兽（高地爬行者）与陆行龟 —— 名字与四个区域一一对应。": "The creatures inside are raptors (Thicket Lurker, Thicket Hunter, Thicket Matriarch), crocolisks, Highland spiders, a bog beast (Highland Creeper) and turtles — their names match the four areas.",
    "副本分上下两层：先在底层清完龙人与小头目，再下到中央水池区域推进。": "Clear the lower level and balcony minibosses before pushing into the central pool area.",
    "副本各处的 斯坦索姆信使 会掉落钥匙，用来打开对应的邮箱。打开第三个邮箱会触发 邮差马龙，同时出现三只使用 哀嚎死者 的精英 亡灵邮差——这个可叠加的诅咒会让坦克和治疗非常难受，要么控制小怪，要么让法师或治疗尽快驱散。开怪前确保周围清干净，因为他有恐惧技能，可能把你恐惧进别的怪堆。": "Stratholme Courier mobs throughout the instance drop keys that open their associated mailboxes. Opening the third mailbox spawns Postmaster Malown along with three elite Undead Postman that use Wailing Dead — the stacking curse gives tanks and healers a hard time, so crowd control the adds or have a mage or the healer dispel it off the tank. Make sure the area is clear before engaging, as his fear could send you running into extra mobs.",
    "副本地道通往兽穴深渊团队副本，与团本内容相连。": "Its tunnels lead toward the Barrow Deeps raid, so the dungeon connects to endgame raid content.",
    "副本大门是锁着的：钥匙、工程学 275 的大型爆盐炸弹、盗贼开锁 280 以上，或者让里面的人用火把开门，四选一。": "The entrance gate is locked: get in with the Scholomance key, a Large Seaforium Charge (Engineering 275), a rogue with 280+ lockpicking, or have someone inside open it with the torch.",
    "副本巨大，建议拆成两次刷：前半（监狱-竞技场-熔铁厂）和后半（酒吧-七贤之箱-大帝）。": "Split BRD into two runs: the first half and the Emperor half.",
    "副本里几乎所有怪物都免疫奥术伤害 —— 平时靠奥术飞弹、奥术爆炸输出的职业，以及用反制打断的职业，进本前先想好替代手段。": "Almost every mob in this dungeon is immune to Arcane damage — keep that in mind if you normally use spells like Arcane Missiles or Arcane Explosion to deal damage, or Counterspell to interrupt.",
    "副本里几乎所有怪物都免疫奥术伤害：奥术系输出（奥术飞弹、奥术爆炸等）与以奥术施放的打断（如反制）在这里统统失效 —— 组队时留意伤害构成。": "Almost every mob in this dungeon is immune to Arcane damage: arcane nukes and Arcane-based interrupts (e.g. Counterspell) are useless here — mind your damage composition when forming the group.",
    "加兹瑞拉战斗坦克背靠墙、全队叠点，防止被掀飞引到别的怪。": "Tank Gahz'rilla with his back to a wall and stack up to avoid being thrown into extra mobs.",
    "加兹瑞拉是副本尽头的 46 级精英多头蛇，用锤子敲响水渠旁的铜锣即可召唤。开打前清空整个房间；坦克背靠墙拉住他，全队叠在坦克身后，避免被掀飞上天。其余就是常规的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。": "Gahz'rilla is a level 46 elite Hydra located at the end of Zul'Farrak. He is summoned by using the Mallet on the gong near the aqueduct. Make sure to clear out the room where Gahz'rilla is summoned from. Tank him with the tank's back against a wall and stack on the tank to prevent being thrown up into the air. The rest of the fight is a tank and spank.",
    "加加恩·火锤身边带着两只暗炉地质学家，三个加起来 AOE 法术伤害满天飞。坦克拉住加加恩·火锤并人怪分离、背对队伍；控制一只暗炉地质学家，先杀另一只，再杀被控的；两只都倒下后集火加加恩·火锤。他的火焰攻击连绵不断且伤害爆炸，能把他对队友施加的火焰增益驱散掉就尽量驱散——那会放大他的火焰伤害。": "Galgann Firehammer awaits you with two Shadowforge Geologist by his side. Between these 3 NPCs, there's a lot of AoE magic damage flying around. Tanks, pick up Galgann Firehammer and separate him from the group, keeping him faced away. CC one Shadowforge Geologist, kill the other one, then kill the one that was CC'd. Once both are dead, focus on Galgann Firehammer. His range of fire attacks can be devastating. If able to, dispel any of his fire buffs that he'll cast on your party as they will amplify his fire damage.",
    "北区的食人魔多为成组巡逻，尽量把怪拉回已清空的空间，避免引到额外的小队。unga鲁莽开怪容易演变成灭团。": "The ogres of Dire Maul North patrol in tight packs — pull back into cleared space and avoid grabbing extra groups, or pulls can fall apart quickly.",
    "北区（戈多克大王所在区域）的入口位于内场西侧": "The Dire Maul North entrance is on the western side of the arena interior",
    "博学者普克尔特是 60 级精英，位于上层北边的房间。他有多个近身就会掉血的范围毒系技能。一个让他保持在最远距离的打法：让一名队员把博学者普克尔特引到上层栏杆边跳下去，等他绕楼梯跑下来时坦克在下层接住，其余人留在上层远程输出，完全不用担心他的范围技能。中了快速传染的人要立刻离开人群。技能：腐蚀酸液 毒害之灾 快速传染": "Lorekeeper Polkelt is a level 60 elite located in the northern room on the upper level. Lorekeeper Polkelt has several toxic AoE abilities that are damaging when nearby. One strategy to keep him at max range: have someone in your party pull Lorekeeper Polkelt and jump off the upper-level railing, and as Lorekeeper Polkelt runs around the stairs, your tank picks him up on the lower level. The rest of the party, remaining on the upper level, can attack him safely without worrying about his AoE abilities. If anyone is infected with his Volatile Infection, make sure they spread out from the group. Abilities: Corrosive Acid Noxious Catalyst Volatile Infection",
    "卡尔加·刺肋是伤害不低但护甲很脆的施法者。把她从小屋里拉下来，在下方平台上坦克拉住。注意打断她的读条，队伍适当散开减少承伤。她会周期性免疫所有技能，还有治疗法术续命，会稍微拖长战斗——但比起拉姆塔斯和贾格巴，这场就是小菜一碟。": "Charlga Razorflank is a caster that deals quite a bit of damage but has low armor. Pull the boss down from her hut and tank her on the platform below. Make sure to interrupt her casts and have your group spread out to avoid extra damage. Every so often, Charlga will go immune to all abilities and also has a healing spell, extending the duration of the fight. Compared to Ramtusk and Jargba, this should be a piece of cake.",
    "卡视线拉怪是坦克在这里的必修课，尤其是清完前院、接近礼拜堂门口的时候。": "Line of sight pulling is essential for the tank here, especially once you clear the courtyard and approach the entrance of the Chapel itself.",
    "卡雷迪斯镇长 是暗影牧师型的法系怪。打断他的施法、及时驱散团队身上的魔法，再把他快速打掉；有条件可以提前上暗影抗性增益，效果显著。": "Magister Kalendris is a shadow priest-type caster. Interrupt his spells, dispel any magic off the party, and burn him down; extra shadow resistance helps a lot.",
    "卫兵摩尔达 是镇守厄运之槌北区入口通道的食人魔精英。他只有近战系技能，只要坦克尽快拉住仇恨、远程站位靠后避开 击退 和 盾牌冲锋，这场战斗并不难。打贡品跑法时不要杀他——贴着北墙潜行绕过去即可。": "Guard Mol'dar is a named ogre guarding the approach to Dire Maul North. He uses only melee-focused abilities, so the fight is not too challenging as long as your tank picks up aggro quickly and the ranged stay back to avoid Knock Away and Shield Charge. On a tribute run, do not kill him — hug the northern wall and sneak past instead.",
    "卫兵斯里基克 在通往毁灭大厅的蜿蜒走廊巡逻。路上看到 游荡的基尔罗格之眼 要立刻杀掉，否则它会召唤两只 虚无行者。和其他卫兵一样，卫兵斯里基克 只有近战技能——坦克近身拉住，远程远离 击退 和 盾牌冲锋。打贡品跑法时不要杀他——对地上的破损陷阱布置冰冻陷阱，等他巡逻回来被冻住即可。": "Guard Slip'kik patrols the winding hallway into the Halls of Destruction. On the way, kill the Wandering Eye of Kilrogg on sight or it will summon two Netherwalker. Like the other guards, Guard Slip'kik is melee-focused — tank him up close and keep the ranged away from Knock Away and Shield Charge. On a tribute run, do not kill him — set a freeze trap on the broken trap on the ground so he gets caught when he patrols back.",
    "卫兵芬古斯 在庭院中央巡逻。和 卫兵摩尔达 一样，他全是近战技能——坦克拉稳，远程靠后避开 击退 和 盾牌冲锋 即可。打贡品跑法时不要杀他：有潜行职业可以等他巡逻走开后再开中间的箱子，或者让有加速技能的职业冲进去拿完就跑。": "Guard Fengus patrols the center of the Courtyard. Like Guard Mol'dar, he is all melee — keep the tank on him and let the ranged stay back to avoid Knock Away and Shield Charge. On a tribute run, do not kill him: stealth classes can wait for him to patrol away and loot the chest in the middle, or a class with a movement speed ability can dash in and grab it.",
    "厄运之槌东区：古代暗夜精灵都市的温室废墟，一路追猎变身恶魔奥兹恩。": "Dire Maul East: overgrown elven ruins, from Pusillin to Alzzin the Wildshaper.",
    "厨房区域囚禁着诺特·希姆加克，救出他之后可以用食人魔掉落的材料向他兑换独特配方。": "Knot Thimblejack is imprisoned in the kitchen area — free him and trade materials dropped by the ogres for his unique recipes.",
    "古代的石头看守者是 44 级精英傀儡。与路上遇到的傀儡小怪一样，他护甲高、血厚、免疫 DoT，还拥有讨厌的群体减速加沉默技能沙尘风暴。": "Ancient Stone Keeper is a level 44 elite golem. Like the golem mobs you fought along your way, he's also got high armor, high HP, DoT immunity and a nasty AoE slow & silence ability: Sand Storms.",
    "只有赫洛德一个首领的短小分区，32-42 级推荐，难度比图书馆稍高。": "A short wing with a single boss, Herod, recommended for levels 32-42 — a step up in difficulty from the Library.",
    "同样从斯坦索姆正门进入，进门后右转，从侧门（传染病穴）进入亡灵区。": "Enter through the same main gate, then turn right and take the service entrance (the Infectious Cavern) into the undead side.",
    "同样拥有控制技能。与图腾师一样，一次只拉一只，并把队伍站位远离其他小怪和巡逻。他们是施法者，本身很好杀，但疏忽大意时也能翻车。": "also casts a CC ability, . Like the totemic, make sure to only pull one of these at a time and have your group positioned away from any additional mobs or patrols. Because they are casters, the Death's Head Adepts are easy to kill, but can be dangerous if they catch you off guard.",
    "后门：哈默霍挖掘场以东的尘风峡谷隧道可直达副本后半段，比正门更接近腹地。": "A back-door tunnel in Dustwind Gulch, east of Hammertoe's Digsite, provides direct access to the back of the instance.",
    "向南跑进尘泥沼泽南部，在抵达大升降梯之前向东走，即可到达副本入口。": "Run to the southern part of Dustwallow Marsh and head east before you reach the Great Lift to find the entrance.",
    "向南跑进尘泥沼泽南部，在抵达大升降梯之前向西走，即可到达副本入口。": "Run to the southern part of Dustwallow Marsh and head west before you reach the Great Lift to find the entrance.",
    "和所有施法怪一样，打断他们的施法会大大减轻队伍压力。": "As with all caster mobs, interrupting their casts helps your party greatly.",
    "哈卡化身的召唤需要任务链支撑，开本前确认队伍里有能召唤的成员。": "Summoning the Avatar of Hakkar requires the quest chain - make sure someone can summon.",
    "哈雷肯是精英座狼boss，身边带着一群座狼幼崽。坦克拉住哈雷肯，团队先清掉幼狼小怪，再回头集火哈雷肯。以她的近战技能撕裂和痛击来说，击杀难度不高。但哈雷肯一倒下，立刻抓紧恢复血量和法力，因为奴役者基兹鲁尔马上就会冲进战场！": "Halycon is an elite worg boss found within Lower . Halycon comes with a group of Worg Pup. Tanks, pick up Halycon while the group kills the pup adds. Once the adds are done for, focus down Halycon. With her melee abilities, Rend and Thrash, she shouldn't be too challenging to take down. As soon as Halycon falls, replenish your health and mana ASAP, because Gizrul the Slavener will soon come running into battle!",
    "哈雷肯死后基兹鲁尔立刻接战，打完哈雷肯抓紧恢复血蓝。": "Gizrul rushes in right after Halycon dies - recover quickly between fights.",
    "四处游荡并施放击退，可能把你推进别的怪堆，开怪前先看四周；成群联动、无法单独拉，施法职业务必站远——它们有讨厌的 AOE 沉默；死后会分裂成小型瑟莱德丝碎片，有些巡逻本身就带着分身；原始巨兽是重甲巨人，尽量一只一只拉。": "wander around and cast a knockback that could throw you into additional mobs — be aware of your surroundings before engaging one. come in linked groups and cannot be pulled one at a time; casters, STAND BACK — they have a nasty AoE silence. patrol areas and split into smaller Theradrim Shardling when killed, sometimes already trailed by Theradrim Shardling. Primordial Behemoth are giants who hit hard and are preferably pulled one at a time.",
    "团灭后如果清得太慢，血色修道院的小怪会重刷，保持适中的节奏。": "Mobs respawn in Scarlet Monastery if you're too slow after a wipe, so keep a moderate pace.",
    "团灭跑尸很远：灵魂医者在希尔斯布莱德丘陵的墓地（联盟/部落各自的墓地），以幽灵状态跑回副本路程不短 —— 尽量争取战复，别轻易放魂。": "Wipe recovery is painful: the Spirit Healer sits at the graveyards in Hillsbrad Foothills (separate Alliance/Horde ones), so the ghost run back to the dungeon is long — try to secure a combat rez instead of releasing.",
    "图书馆小怪": "Library trash",
    "图书馆里卡视线拉怪非常好用：讨厌的施法怪会走近你，避免引到额外的怪。": "Line of sight pulling is very useful in the Library — the pesky caster mobs come closer to you instead of aggro'ing additional mobs.",
    "图特卡什通过敲锣事件召唤：先清掉一波波蜘蛛，每清完一波再敲一次锣召唤下一波。几波蜘蛛都简单直接，图特卡什本身也不难。坦克把他背对队伍，避免不必要的蛛网喷射，其余技能都可以无视。": "Tuten'kash is summoned through the spider gong event in RFD. Before you engage him, you will first have to clear a few waves of spiders. After each wave is finished, ring the gong again to summon the next wave. The waves are simple and straightforward, as is Tuten'kash. The tank should face him away from the group to avoid unnecessary web spray, but his other abilities are negligible.",
    "在区域中寻找被食人魔劫掠的村庄与要塞入口 —— 具体位置待 beta 确认。": "",
    "在奥伯丁码头另一侧换船到米奈希尔港（暴风城 ⇄ 米奈希尔港的航线新近开通）；": "",
    "在奥伯丁码头另一侧换船到米奈希尔港；": "Switch boats on the other side of the Auberdine dock to Menethil Harbor;",
    "在艾萨拉寻找通往副本的大门 —— 具体位置待 beta 确认。": "",
    "地下腹地的死灵法师站在堆满尸体的仪式圈旁，骷髅会不断从中爬出。优先击杀死灵法师，否则骷髅会越积越多。": "In the Underbelly, necromancers stand around a ritual circle heaped with bodies and skeletons keep rising from it. Kill the necromancers first or the skeletons will stack up on you.",
    "地鸣瀑布小怪": "Earth Song Falls trash",
    "坦克把他拉在房间中央，远程分散站到楼梯上。当他施放旋风斩时会开始旋风斩、喊出\"圣光之刃！\"并免疫法术。房间中央附近的人必须立刻跑开，否则会被打出毁灭性的伤害——绝不要试图硬抗。远程一开始就站在楼梯上会更轻松。当赫洛德 &lt;血色十字军勇士&gt;死后全队集合，会有超过 20 只非精英血色预备兵冲进房间，范围技能清掉即可。技能：顺劈斩 狂怒 急速冲锋 旋风斩": "The tank should keep him in the center of the room while the ranged spread out up the stairs. When he casts Whirlwind, he'll start to whirlwind, shout \"Blades of Light!\" and become immune to magic. Anyone near the center should run out to avoid devastating damage — do not try to tank this. When Herod dies, have everyone group up, because more than 20 non-elite Scarlet Trainee will run into the room and can easily be AoE'd down. Abilities: Cleave Enrage Rushing Charge Whirlwind",
    "坦克把施法型 boss（如卡尔加·刺肋）拉离小怪与巡逻路线，及时打断读条可显著减轻治疗压力。": "Tank the caster bosses (like Charlga Razorflank) away from packs and patrols; timely interrupts significantly ease the healing load.",
    "城市本名「伊拉莱」（I'lalai the Drowned City）；四块可阅读的伊拉莱石板以任务物品的形式讲述它的故事。": "The city's old name is I'lalai the Drowned City; four readable stone tablets (I'lalai tablets 1-4) tell its story in quest items.",
    "基尔图诺斯的卫士是 57 级精英，位于圣物间。她有几个可以驱散的诅咒。小心她的麻痹之毒，会昏迷目标 8 秒。记住这两点，然后把她打掉就行！技能：无力诅咒 虚弱诅咒 麻痹之毒": "Blood Steward of Kirtonos is a level 57 elite located in the Reliquary. She has a few curses that can be dispelled. Watch out for her Paralyzing Poison as it stuns the target for 8 seconds. With those two things in mind, DPS her down! Abilities: Curse of Impotence Curse of Weakness Paralyzing Poison",
    "墓地的小怪以 2-4 只的亡灵群为主，坦好拉稳即可。注意别让怪逃跑，否则容易滚雪球引到下一组。": "Graveyard trash comes in undead packs of 2-4. Tank them steadily and above all prevent runners — one escaping mob can snowball into the next pack.",
    "墓地的小怪大多 30-32 级，2-4 只成群行动。别让任何怪逃跑引到额外的怪堆，其余都很轻松。": "Graveyard mobs are around level 30-32, grouped in packs of 2-4. Just don't let any stray mob run away and aggro additional packs, and you'll be fine.",
    "复活的尸体": "Reanimated Corpse",
    "复活的尸体被\"杀掉\"约 10 秒后会重新站起来，做好它们再爬起来咬你的准备。": "Reanimated Corpses pop back up about 10 seconds after being \"killed\" — be ready for them to rise again and attack you.",
    "复活的畸形妖": "Risen Aberration",
    "大十字军战士达索汉 是本副本的最终首领，位于地图 11 号位置，战斗进行到一半时会变身成 巴纳扎尔。人形态下他没什么威胁，但血量过半变身后就会拥有 支配、心灵尖啸、心灵震爆、暗影震击 和 催眠术。被他精神控制的队友要做好控制处理，施法者保持最远距离躲开恐惧，能驱散就尽快驱散队友身上的沉睡。": "Grand Crusader Dathrohan is the final boss of the dungeon at number 11 on the map, and turns into Balnazzar halfway through the fight. In human form he does little, but around half health he gains Domination, Psychic Scream, Mind Blast, Shadow Shock and Sleep. Crowd control the player he mind controls, stand at max range to avoid the fear if you are a caster, and dispel the sleep off your allies when you can.",
    "大师级附魔师安娜拉": "<Master Enchanter> Annora",
    "大检察官怀特迈恩的主要攻击手段是施放圣击术。把她的血量压到一定程度后，她会施放一个无法躲避的群体催眠术，随后对血色十字军指挥官莫格莱尼施放血色复活，把两人都回满血。让坦克接住复活的血色十字军指挥官莫格莱尼，先集火杀掉大检察官怀特迈恩，再回头收拾血色十字军指挥官莫格莱尼。有些队伍能在她施放血色复活之前就把她打掉，但这样的话就无法拾取血色十字军指挥官莫格莱尼身上的战利品了。技能：圣光击 治疗术 深度睡眠 真言术：盾 血色复活": "High Inquisitor Whitemane mainly casts Holy Smite - Spell - Classic World of Warcraft as her primary attack. After you get her health down to a certain point, she'll cast an unavoidable group Sleep on your party, allowing her to cast Scarlet Resurrection on Scarlet Commander Mograine and heal both back to full health. Have your tank pick up Scarlet Commander Mograine, burn down High Inquisitor Whitemane, then finish off Scarlet Commander Mograine. Some groups may kill her before she uses Scarlet Resurrection, but then the party will be unable to loot Scarlet Commander Mograine. Abilities: Holy Smite Heal Deep Sleep Power Word: Shield Scarlet Resurrection",
    "大法师之影是副本的最终 boss。他把法力池当资源使用，法力耗尽时会接连施放两个技能把法力回满。对坦克的主要伤害技能伤害高而稳定；他还会周期性施放奥术爆炸，对 20 码内所有人造成中等伤害。偶尔他会施放「跃动法力」—— 点名一名玩家的奥术回旋镖，被命中伤害很高，飞行路径上的人都会吃到：全队散开，别与目标站成一条线，施法者保持最大距离规避奥术爆炸。想多挤一点输出或治疗的施法者，可以在他施放群体变形时躲到墙后规避 —— 但小心：他离开房间会完全重置。BlizzCon 试玩里他掉落「Ponderous Orb」；传承挑战在他死亡那一刻计为通关本副本。": "Shade of the Archmage is the final boss of the dungeon. The Archmage uses his mana pool to power his abilities, and once that mana pool is drained, he will use two abilities to regenerate his mana to full. His primary damage ability on the tank deals high steady damage; he'll also periodically use an Arcane Explosion that deals moderate damage to anyone within 20 yards. Occasionally the Archmage will cast Bounding Mana, which deals high damage to anyone hit — it targets one individual player with an arcane boomerang projectile, and anyone standing in the projectile's path will take damage. Stay spread out to avoid spreading the damage from Bounding Mana, and casters stay at max range to avoid the Arcane Explosion. Casters who are looking to squeeze a bit more damage or healing out of the fight can hide behind the wall whenever the boss casts Mass Polymorph, but be careful: if the boss leaves his room, he will fully reset. In the BlizzCon playtest he dropped a 'Ponderous Orb'; the Legacy challenge counts as completed the moment he dies.",
    "大法师之影是最终 boss：法力耗尽会用两个技能回满；「跃动法力」是点名的奥术回旋镖，别与目标站成一线；群体变形可以躲墙后规避，但把他引出房间会完全重置。": "The Shade of the Archmage is the final boss: he drains his mana pool and refills it with two abilities, throws a targeted arcane boomerang (Bounding Mana), and mass-polymorphs the group — but fully resets if anyone lures him out of his room.",
    "大部分拉怪一次 2-3 只，且会逃跑、巡逻密集。拉怪前先观察走廊。": "Most pulls contain two or three mobs at a time, runners are common and patrols frequent — scout the halls before engaging.",
    "奈鲁布恩坎 在地图 16 号位置刷新，位于锁链通道入口的西北方向，通常是你最先打的 boss。输出职业要用顺劈把他召唤的小怪一起清掉——它们伤害不高，但坦克被减速或压力很大时你很容易抢到仇恨。治疗和坦克要注意 刺穿护甲，提前沟通减伤和集中治疗。杀掉他之后同样把他身后满是 图萨丁侍僧 的房间清干净，解锁后面的大门。": "Nerub'enkan spawns at number 16 on the map, northwest of the gauntlet entrance, and is usually the first boss you make your way to. As DPS, cleave down the extra mobs he spawns — they do little damage, and you may pull aggro anyway because the tank is snared or under pressure. Healers and tanks should watch for Pierce Armor and coordinate defensives and focused healing. After he dies, clear the room behind him full of Thuzadin Acolyte to unlock a gate later on.",
    "奥兹恩会不断变身，每次变身坦克都要重新建立仇恨，输出再跟上。初始形态下，立刻驱散毒药弱化——它是一个周期性法力燃烧；疾病寒冬同样要及时驱散。两个技能都可以被打断，注意他的读条。变身为树人形态后护甲大幅提升，使用破甲攻击和破甲这类技能有助于度过这个阶段。他还会变身为恐狼，施放类似野性德鲁伊猎豹形态的技能。血量降到35%时，他身后的墙壁会崩塌，冲出一群非精英小怪——AoE清掉后回身打完奥兹恩即可。": "Alzzin the Wildshaper will shape-shift into different forms. When he shape-shifts, make sure your tank reestablishes aggro before DPSing. In his initial, Satyr Form, be sure to cleanse the poison Enervate right away as it acts as a periodic mana drain. Be sure to cleanse the disease spell, Wither, as well. Both can be interrupted, so watch out for his spell casting. When he shifts into treant form, his armor increases by a lot, so using like Sunder Armor - Spell - Classic World of Warcraft and Expose Armor will help you get through this phase. He can also shape-shift into a Dire Wolf, casting abilities similar to a feral in Cat Form. At 35% health, the wall will crumble behind him and a group of non-elite adds will come running out. They're pretty easy to AoE down and finish burning down Alzzin the Wildshaper.",
    "奥兹恩血量35%时身后墙壁崩塌、冲出小怪，提前留好AoE技能。": "At 35% Alzzin's wall crumbles and adds rush out - save AoE cooldowns.",
    "奥卡兹岛位于尘泥沼泽东海岸外的海面上，四面环水 —— 与经典旧世一样，最后一段需要游泳登岛。": "Alcaz Island sits in the sea off the eastern coast of Dustwallow Marsh and is ringed by water — as in Classic, expect to swim the final stretch to reach it.",
    "奥卡兹岛在尘泥沼泽东海岸外的海面上：部落可从蕨墙村出发，穿过尘泥沼泽向东走到海岸，再游泳登上奥卡兹岛，岛上的监狱建筑群即副本入口。": "",
    "奥术免疫": "Arcane Immunity",
    "奥术异常体是出下水道后即可挑战的 boss，招牌机制处理不当会直接减员：一道横扫房间、逆时针旋转的奥术光刃 —— 团本老玩家会认出这就是克苏恩、海莱恩与诺鲁什那套光束机制，碰到就会死，务必躲开。开怪时 boss 还会在房间边缘召唤小怪，全队留在平台的圆圈内打，避免把小怪带进 boss。除普攻外它会周期性施放奥术爆炸。": "Arcane Anomaly is one of the bosses you can kill after exiting the sewers and has a core defining mechanic that will kill you if mishandled: an arcane slicer that cuts across the room and rotates counterclockwise — the same mechanic many raiders know from C'thun, Halion and Norushen. Make sure to avoid this ability or you will die. Another thing to keep in mind is that the boss spawns small adds at the edge of the room when you engage it, so stay within the circle on the platform to avoid pulling them into the boss. The boss will periodically cast Arcane Explosion in addition to its normal melee attacks.",
    "奥达曼大量战斗是多怪群拉，善用（变形术）、（闷棍）等控制技能会让流程顺畅得多。傀儡类怪物护甲高、血厚且免疫 DoT，用直伤处理更划算。": "Many of the pulls in Uldaman will contain groups of enemies. Utilizing crowd control abilities such as , and others will make things much easier. Golem-type mobs have high armor, high HP and are immune to DoT effects.",
    "奥达曼引怪连带风险高，控制技能收益极大，坦克尽量把战斗固定在清空过的房间。": "Uldaman pulls chain easily, so CC pays off big; tank fights in cleared rooms whenever possible.",
    "奥达曼是泰坦考古遗迹风格的巨型洞穴，正门/后门双入口路线灵活，傀儡类怪物众多，也是附魔升级的必到之处。": "Uldaman is a sprawling titan-archaeology dig site with flexible front/back entrances, golem-heavy pulls and the only Artisan Enchanting trainer in the game.",
    "奴役者基兹鲁尔是精英座狼boss，打人很疼，配合技能能打出毁灭性的伤害：致命刺痛会给他自身回血，感染撕咬则是自然系持续伤害。老规矩，坦克先拉住并建立足够仇恨，再放开输出。": "Gizrul the Slavener is an elite worg boss found within Lower . Gizrul the Slavener hits pretty hard and combined with his abilities, can dish out devastating damage with Fatal Bite, which will heal himself, and Infected Bite, a nature DoT. As usual, have your tank pick him up and generate enough threat before you unleash your DPS on him.",
    "如果直接往血色区走，遇到的第一个首领就是 悲惨的提米。他是向《南方公园》致敬的彩蛋，开怪时会大喊「TIMMY!」。他没有任何机制，就是常规的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。": "Timmy the Cruel is the first boss you may encounter if you head straight for the Scarlet side. He is a reference to South Park and yells \"TIMMY!\" on engage. He has no mechanics — a simple tank and spank.",
    "如果队里有术士，对元素怪使用放逐术，集火击杀唤地者哈穆加。没有的话，先清空平台，优先打掉他的图腾，快速爆发秒掉元素怪后再转火哈穆加。": "If you have a Warlock with Banish, use it on the elemental and kill Earthcaller Halmgar. Otherwise, clear the platform, prioritize his totems, and burst the elemental down quickly before switching to Halmgar.",
    "学院大门是锁着的，进门有四种方式：有成员持有通灵学院钥匙；工程学 275 以上的成员用大型爆盐炸弹炸开；盗贼开锁 280 以上开锁；或者先让一人留在门内，用里面的火把从内侧开门。": "The gate is locked; there are four ways in: a party member with the Key to Scholomance, a Large Seaforium Charge (Engineering 275), a rogue with 280+ lockpicking, or having someone open the gate from the inside using the torch.",
    "学院里人形怪和亡灵怪很多，控制技能（变羊、束缚亡灵、恐惧亡灵等）能让整趟跑本顺滑很多。": "Scholomance is full of humanoid and undead mobs — crowd control (Polymorph, Shackle Undead, Fear undead, etc.) makes the run much smoother.",
    "安图苏尔 &lt;苏尔督军&gt;是 48 级精英沙怒巨魔。他战斗中会召唤苏利萨斯幼崽和安图苏尔的仆从，这是本场难点：增援一出现，所有 DPS 立即 AOE 清掉、优先级高于 boss 本体。坦克随时准备打断治疗技能，近战见图腾落地就优先打掉。在经典五人本里他的机制算相当繁重，每个角色各司其职才能顺利过关。": "Antu'sul is a level 48 elite Sandfury Troll. Antu'sul is a difficult boss due to his ability to summon Sul'lithuz Broodling and Servant of Antu'sul during the encounter. When this happens, all dps should immediately AOE down the additional mobs and prioritize them over the boss. The tank should be ready to interrupt the healing abilities, and melee dps should prioritize totems as soon as they're up. This boss is quite mechanically intensive for a dungeon boss in Vanilla, and requires all parties fulfilling their roles for a successful attempt.",
    "安娜丝塔丽男爵夫人 在地图 15 号位置刷新。她本身伤害不高，但技能很烦人：战斗中她会不断对玩家施放 占据——把被占据的玩家打到 50% 血以下即可解除——还会沉默施法者，并诅咒玩家降低命中几率。杀掉她之后，记得把她身后满是 图萨丁侍僧 的房间清干净，这样才能解锁副本后面的一扇大门。": "Baroness Anastari spawns at number 15 on the map. She does not hit hard, but her kit is annoying: she casts Possess on players throughout the fight — the possessed player is freed by being brought to 50% health — silences casters, and curses players to reduce their hit chance. After she dies, clear the room behind her full of Thuzadin Acolyte, as this unlocks a gate later in the dungeon.",
    "安娜丝塔丽男爵夫人、奈鲁布恩坎和苍白的玛勒基身后的房间满是蜘蛛，必须全部清完才能解锁通往男爵区域的大门。": "The rooms behind Baroness Anastari, Nerub'enkan and Maleki the Pallid are packed with spiders — clear every one to unlock the gates toward the Baron's wing.",
    "安戈洛环形山山丘上的泰坦建筑、能量水晶与野生动物：暴雪将其比作魔兽版的《侏罗纪公园》，58-60 级。": "Titan ruins, power crystals and wildlife on the hills of Un'Goro Crater — Blizzard pitches it as their Jurassic Park, 58-60.",
    "安戈洛环形山是四周峭壁环绕的盆地：部落可经塔纳利斯，沿环形山西侧的坡道下行进入；副本位于环形山的山丘地带，具体入口位置待 beta 确认。": "",
    "安戈洛环形山是峭壁环绕的盆地；与经典旧世相同，只能沿坡道进出 —— 西侧来自塔纳利斯，东北侧来自希利苏斯。": "Un'Goro is a basin ringed by cliffs; as in Classic you enter by one of the slopes — from Tanaris on the west or Silithus to the northeast.",
    "安格弗将军是可选boss，但很多玩家会专门来刷他的掉落。由于增援多，整体偏难，队伍缺AoE伤害时会更吃力。打法很直接：他像战士一样作战，战斗中会呼叫增援，全力打boss、增援一出来就AoE清掉。增援血量很低，很容易杀。": "General Angerforge is an optional boss, but a lot of players will want to farm it for and . Overall, the fight is fairly difficult because of the adds. If your group is lacking on AoE damage, the fight is harder than it would otherwise be. General Angerforge is straightforward. He behaves like a warrior, and then calls adds during the encounter. Just burn him and AoE the adds when they come. They have fairly low health, so they die fairly easily.",
    "完成挑战波次后，雷德会骑着盖斯现身。波次由大量兽人和龙人组成，全部清完后南侧大门打开，通往熔炉。大约七到八波之后，雷德就会骑着盖斯出现。对抗盖斯时，主坦克要把他面朝拉离团队，防住吐息；血量降到20%时雷德会被从盖斯背上击落，团队应当先杀盖斯再转火雷德。雷德一落地，副坦克要立刻接手，把他拉到房间一侧；盖斯死后全团转火雷德，近战注意躲好旋风斩和顺劈。他打人非常疼，而这个阶段团队法力已经见底，治疗能否撑住是击杀雷德最大的考验。": "Complete the gauntlet to beckon Rend and Gyth. The gauntlet consists of numerous waves of orcs and dragonspawn. Once completed, the Southern Gateway will open allowing passage into The Furnace. After seven to eight waves, Rend will appear riding on Gyth’s back. To combat Gyth , the MT should face Gyth away from the raid to protect them from the breath. At 20%, Rend will be knocked off Gyth’s back. The raid should kill Gyth before switching to Rend. Freeze Corrosive Acid Breath Flame Breath Your OT should immediately grab Rend as soon as he is knocked off Gyth , and position him to the side of the room. Once Gyth is slain, the raid will switch to Rend . Melee should attempt to avoid his whirlwind and cleave mechanics. He hits quite hard, so healing here is the biggest issue with killing Warchief Rend Blackhand as mana is already low going into this portion of the encounter. Whirlwind Thunderclap Cleave",
    "完成挑战波次后，雷德会骑着盖斯现身。波次由大量兽人和龙人组成，全部清完后南侧大门打开，通往熔炉。对抗盖斯时主坦克把他面朝拉离团队防吐息，血量20%时雷德被击落，团队先杀盖斯再转火雷德。雷德落地后副坦克立刻接手，把他拉到房间一侧；盖斯死后全团转火雷德，近战注意躲好旋风斩和顺劈。他打人非常疼，而这个阶段团队法力已经见底，治疗能否撑住是击杀雷德最大的考验。": "Complete the gauntlet to beckon Rend and Gyth. The gauntlet consists of numerous waves of orcs and dragonspawn. Once completed, the Southern Gateway will open allowing passage into The Furnace. After seven to eight waves, Rend will appear riding on Gyth’s back. To combat Gyth , the MT should face Gyth away from the raid to protect them from the breath. At 20%, Rend will be knocked off Gyth’s back. The raid should kill Gyth before switching to Rend. Freeze Corrosive Acid Breath Flame Breath Your OT should immediately grab Rend as soon as he is knocked off Gyth , and position him to the side of the room. Once Gyth is slain, the raid will switch to Rend . Melee should attempt to avoid his whirlwind and cleave mechanics. He hits quite hard, so healing here is the biggest issue with killing Warchief Rend Blackhand as mana is already low going into this portion of the encounter. Whirlwind Thunderclap Cleave",
    "审讯官格斯塔恩 &lt;暮光之锤审问者&gt;通常是大家第一次进本遇到的第一位boss。整体不算难，但不处理机制会翻车。击杀她是拿到监狱区任务所需物品的必要一步。本场最大的难点是她的心灵尖啸恐惧，一旦被恐惧乱跑很容易带出旁边的怪堆：部落萨满记得插战栗图腾，联盟矮人牧师上防护恐惧结界；战士坦克可以尝试狂暴之怒来对抗，但恐惧时机难以预判，更多靠运气。其他坦克治疗组合以及输出职业，尽量把自己塞进墙角，减轻恐惧的影响。恐惧之外，驱散暗言术：痛、打断法力燃烧即可。": "High Interrogator Gerstahn is the first boss many will face their first time in ! She is not exceedingly difficult overall, but can cause problems if you don't compensate for some of her mechanics. Killing her is necessary to obtain the , which is used to complete quests in the Detention Block . Overall, the approach to beating her is fairly simple. Her use of Psychic Scream is the most challenging part of the encounter as it can lead to other packs being pulled. For Horde Shamans, use tremor to deal with the fear. For Alliance Dwarf Priests, use fear ward. Further, warrior tanks can attempt Berserker Rage, but the inability to effectively time and predict the fear makes utilizing this more about luck than timing. As for other tank/healer combinations and for DPS, attempt to wedge yourself deeply in a corner to attempt to mitigate some of the fear effects. Apart from the fear, dispel Shadow Word: Pain and interrupt the Mana Burn.",
    "客户端文件里有「克罗多克大门钥匙」与「克罗多克食人魔钥匙」—— 进入要塞可能需要其中一把。": "The client files hold a Krol'dok Gate Key and a Krol'dok Ogre Key — entering the stronghold may require one of them.",
    "寒冰之王亚门纳尔是本副本颇有难度的 boss。坦克要背靠他站立处的帐篷拉住他，化解亚门纳尔之怒；全队叠在坦克身上减轻冰霜新星的威胁，他召唤的冰霜之灵一出现立刻转火。打断寒冰箭，站位是这场战斗的胜负手。": "Amnennar the Coldbringer is a challenging dungeon boss that should be tanked facing the tent where he stands to neutralize Amnennar's Wrath. Have your group stack on the tank to reduce the severity of Frost Nova, and switch to the spirit that he summons as soon as it spawns. Interrupt Frostbolt and prioritize proper positioning.",
    "将军房间前有巡逻与驻守怪混合，开boss前把房间清干净。": "Patrols mix with stationed mobs before Drakkisath - clear the room first.",
    "小怪低血量会逃跑，减速、定身、昏迷都用上，别让跑掉的怪带回一群朋友。": "Mobs run away at low health: use snares, stuns and whatever you can to stop a runner from bringing back friends.",
    "小怪等级 33-35 左右，近战与施法者混合。卡视线拉怪、打断施法、拦住逃跑怪是三件最重要的事。": "Library mobs average level 33-35, a mix of melee and casters. LoS pulling, interrupting casts and stopping runners are the three most important things.",
    "尖石兽人营地": "Spirestone Orc Camps",
    "尖石屠夫是一只57级精英食人魔，作为稀有怪出现在尖石区域，坦克拉住正常击杀即可。": "Spirestone Butcher is a level 57 elite ogre.",
    "尖石统帅是一只偶尔刷新在欧莫克大王附近房间的58级精英食人魔，身边带着两名施法者。多数队伍选择先集火杀掉施法者，再转火尖石统帅，想用控制也可以。他是标准的近战怪，开打前确认坦克拉好仇恨再全力输出。": "Spirestone Battle Lord is accompanied by two casters. Most groups opt to burn down the casters first and then move on to Spirestone Battle Lord, but you can also use CC here if you'd like. He's a typical melee mob, so make sure the tank has aggro before burning him down.",
    "尘泥沼泽近海奥卡兹岛上的迪菲亚监狱：迪菲亚曾把贵族关在这里勒索赎金，如今他们正与纳迦交战，48-53 级。": "A Defias-held prison on Alcaz Island off the coast of Dustwallow Marsh, where the Brotherhood once held nobles for ransom and now fights the naga, 48-53.",
    "岛上的监狱建筑群即副本入口。": "",
    "巡逻与引怪": "Patrols and pulls",
    "工匠吉兹洛克是毒瀑的 50 级精英地精。坦克把他背对队伍，避免地精龙枪造成团队伤害；其余所有人近战范围紧贴叠点，让他无法使用远程技能。按此站位，轻松击杀。": "Tinkerer Gizlock is a level 50 elite goblin found in Poison Falls. Tanks, face him away from the group to prevent group damage from his Goblin Dragon Gun. Everyone else — stack close together in melee range. This will prevent Tinkerer Gizlock from being able to use his ranged abilities. With this strategy in mind, he shouldn't be difficult to burn down.",
    "巫医祖穆拉恩是 46 级精英沙怒巨魔，对治疗压力很大。全程打断他的暗影箭雨，避免无谓掉血；战斗中他会不断从附近坟墓召唤僵尸攻击队伍——僵尸一刷出立刻转火快速击杀；他刷出图腾同样优先打掉。场面混乱，但只要盯紧图腾和增援，难度可控。": "Witch Doctor Zum'rah is a level 46 elite Sandfury Troll. Zum'rah is a challenging boss that is quite intensive on the healers. Interrupts are paramount during this fight in order to prevent unnecessary damage from his shadow bolt volley. Throughout the engagement, Zum'rah will summon zombies from nearby graves to attack your group. Make sure to switch over to the zombies immediately as they are summoned and burn them down fast. Whenever Zum'rah spawns a totem, prioritize it as well. This is a chaotic fight but if the totem and adds are prioritized, it shouldn't be too difficult.",
    "巴尔洛戈（41 级精英）、埃瑞克（40 级精英）与奥拉夫（40 级精英）组成失落的三兄弟，对联盟友好、对部落敌对。常规打法是控制巴尔洛戈，坦克拉住奥拉夫，集火秒掉会施放拦截群体眩晕的埃瑞克；然后转火奥拉夫，全程保持巴尔洛戈被控。只要房间清净，这场战斗不难。别忘了搜刮三兄弟身后的箱子。": "Baelog (level 41 elite), Eric &quot;The Swift&quot; (level 40 elite) and Olaf (level 40 elite) make up The Lost Dwarves. They are friendly to Alliance players but hostile to the Horde. Most groups crowd control Baelog, have the tank pick up Olaf, and burst down Eric &quot;The Swift&quot; as he can cast Intercept on party members, which results in a pesky stun. Once Eric &quot;The Swift&quot; is done for, move on to Olaf while keeping Baelog CC'd. As long as the room is clear, you shouldn't have much trouble. Don't forget to loot the chest behind The Lost Dwarves.",
    "巴瑟拉斯镇长 可能在副本开头的教堂刷新，也可能被惊动后跑到副本尾部的第二个位置（地图 12 号）。最需要注意的技能是 全力一击：它会把坦克击退几码，可能退进别的怪堆。只要背靠墙壁，就会被原地击飞而不是后退。": "Magistrate Barthilas can spawn at the church near the start, or — if alerted — run to his second spot near the end of the instance at number 12 on the map. The key ability to watch for is Mighty Blow: it knocks the tank back several yards, potentially into more mobs. Simply face your back to a wall so you get knocked straight up instead of backward.",
    "巴瑟拉斯镇长有击退，坦克背靠墙开怪就不会被推入怪堆。": "Magistrate Barthilas knocks back — have the tank fight with his back to a wall.",
    "巴纳扎尔半血变身并获得一整套恶魔技能，被精神控制的队友需要控制处理。": "Balnazzar transforms at half health and gains a full demonic kit — crowd control any mind-controlled allies.",
    "布莱中士是 45 级精英人类，在阶梯事件后登场，身边跟着一队精英护卫（欧罗·血眼、穆尔塔等）。奥罗的 AOE 与穆尔塔的治疗让这场战斗颇具挑战——先击杀奥罗和穆尔塔，再转火布莱中士。": "Sergeant Bly is a level 45 elite human who is engaged after the stairs event in Zul'Farrak. He is accompanied by several other elite mobs, namely Oro Eyegouge and Murta Grimgut. Between Oro's AOE and Murta's healing, this fight can be quite challenging. Prioritize Oro and Murta before switching to Bly.",
    "带足控制技能（变形术、冰冻陷阱、放逐术等），本副本大量战斗围绕「控住再杀」展开。": "Bring plenty of crowd control (Polymorph, Freezing Trap, Banish and so on) — most packs here revolve around CC-then-kill.",
    "常见怪堆": "Common pulls",
    "开怪后普希林会召唤4个荒野小鬼到身边，坦克拉住仇恨后全团AoE清掉即可。普希林会施放各种火焰法术——用脚踢、法术反制之类的打断技能阻止他读条。施法职业注意他的洛恩塔姆之魂：这是一个自我增益，让他体型增大、近战急速提高20%、法术反射几率提高到50%。": "Once you engage Pusillin, he will summon four (4) Wildspawn Imp to his side. Once your tank grabs aggro on Pusillin, your group can AoE down the imps. Pusillin casts a variety of Fire spells - Kick, Counterspell and other interrupts can prevent his casts from going off. Casters: watch out for his Spirit of Runn Tum, which is a self-buff increasing his size, melee haste by 20% and chance to reflect spells by 50%.",
    "弗莱拉斯大使在某种意义上是一场DPS竞速：战斗中会不断刷新冲向boss的小怪，小怪一旦抵达就会给他施加增益。好在这些小怪很容易在半路截杀。所以打法就是别让小怪碰到boss、别让他的增益叠到治疗加不上的程度。把层数控制住，这就是一场非常轻松的战斗。": "Ambassador Flamelash is a DPS race is some sense. There are adds that spawn which rush to the boss. If they reach the boss, he gets a buff. However, these adds can easily be killed before reaching him. As such, the way to beat him is to kill the adds before they reach him and increase his damage beyond which the healer is able to heal. Ambassador Flamelash summons adds continually throughout the encounter, which give him a buff if they reach him. As such, these adds need to be killed away from the boss. Keep his stacks low, and this is an incredibly easy fight.",
    "弗诺斯·达克维尔 &lt;首席建筑师&gt;是完成相关任务后才会出现的可选boss，因此很多队伍选择绕开他——把通往他路上的增援全部清掉实在太折磨人。本体战斗很直白：他打人极疼，还带治疗机制，一定要打断他的治疗，治疗则要预读治疗跟上伤害节奏。装备不好的队伍，务必把沿路的增援全部清掉，避免意外引到怪导致灭团。": "Fineous Darkvire is an optional boss once you complete the quest required to kill him. As such, many groups opt to avoid him because it is a pain trying to clear all of the adds to reach him. Fineous Darkvire is a rather straightforward boss. He hits incredibly hard and has a healing mechanic. As such, it is important to interrupt the heal and for healers to pre-cast heals to keep up with the damage output. Further, when poorly geared, it is important to make sure all the adds along the pathway are killed to avoid an accidental aggro causing a wipe.",
    "弗雷斯特恩 也是稀有怪，会在 艾兹拉·格里姆 以北的街道刷新，也可能在 不可宽恕者 以东的市场街出现。他会对随机玩家施放持续 8 秒的沉睡，他的多重射击 多重射击 只要稍微散开站位就能化解。": "Hearthsinger Forresten is another rare spawn, appearing north up the lane from Ezra Grimm, or east past The Unforgiven along Market Row. He casts an 8-second sleep on a random player, and his multi-shot Multi-Shot can be countered by spreading out a little.",
    "当6名阿塔莱防卫者全部倒下后，通往预言者迦玛兰的道路便已打开。返回副本入口方向，走左手边即可。他和可悲的奥戈姆同场出现：坦克拉住预言者迦玛兰优先集火，注意打断他的暗影法术，再转火奥戈姆。": "Now that all 6 Atal'ai Defenders are dead, the way to Jammal'an the Prophet is now open. Head on back towards the start of the instance and head left.",
    "当6名阿塔莱防卫者全部倒下后，通往预言者迦玛兰的道路便已打开。返回副本入口方向，走左手边即可。他和预言者迦玛兰同场出现：先杀迦玛兰，再集火预言者迦玛兰身边的奥戈姆。": "Now that all 6 Atal'ai Defenders are dead, the way to Jammal'an the Prophet is now open. Head on back towards the start of the instance and head left.",
    "很多玩家到了足够等级会单刷这个区来赚金，跑本节奏可以放得很快。": "Many players solo this wing at higher levels to farm gold, so the pace can be quite fast.",
    "怪堆密集、会逃跑，坦克多用卡视线拉怪。进礼拜堂前务必把外面清干净。": "Packs are dense and runners common; the tank should LoS-pull heavily. Clear the outside completely before entering the Chapel.",
    "想快速穿过这间房，直接向普拉格买6瓶酒交给罗克诺特下士。向罗克诺特下士上交三次之后他会暴怒，这会引出法拉克斯来阻止他，混战之中通往副本深处的门会被撞开。法拉克斯的全力一击打人相当疼，但也用不着长篇大论的战术。虽然工具提示说可以把酒瓶扔向酒客，但千万别这么做——他们会翻脸。绕过酒吧还有另一种办法，但更麻烦：需要完成任务，让娜格玛拉去诱惑洛克诺特。": "To get through the room quickly just buy 6 from Plugger Spazzring to give to Private Rocknot. After three turn-ins of to Private Rocknot, he will start to rage. This action causes Phalanx to activate to stop Private Rocknot. The door to the remainder of the dungeon is smashed open during the scuffle. Phalanx hit fairly hard with Mighty Blow, but this does not warrant a lengthy strategy discussion. The group may be tempted to throw these bottles at patrons as the tool tip explains, but refrain from doing this as they will become angry. The other method to reach the next room past the Grim Guzzler is not as easy. This involves doing , which allows Nagmara to seduce Rocknot.",
    "愤怒魔典": "Angry Tomes",
    "戈多克大王 是厄运之槌北区的压轴战斗，也是贡品跑法的目标。普通打法先处理 观察者克鲁什（见其条目），再集火国王。贡品跑法中击杀 戈多克大王 并保住 观察者克鲁什 的性命，就能拿到戈多克贡品。": "King Gordok is the final fight of Dire Maul North and the target of the tribute run. Deal with Cho'Rush the Observer first in a normal run (see his entry), then burn the king down. On a tribute run, killing King Gordok while keeping Cho'Rush the Observer alive yields the Gordok Tribute.",
    "成群的不死生物": "Undead packs",
    "战斗从按下未激活 boss 右侧的「档案面板」机关开始。这是一场装备与等级的检查：难点是它对坦克的高伤害和大血池。它会对 10 码内的所有人施放「雷霆一击」，大幅减速移动与攻击速度并造成中等伤害；坦克还会周期性被击退、偶尔被眩晕 5 秒。boss 可以被眩晕与减速 —— 勤交控制技能，也可以利用附近的建筑卡位风筝。": "The encounter starts by pressing the Archival Panel on the right side of the inactive boss. This is a gear and level check: the difficulty comes from high tank damage and a large health pool. The boss casts Thunder Clap on everyone within 10 yards — a heavy movement/attack-speed slow plus moderate damage. The tank is periodically knocked back and sometimes stunned for 5 seconds. The boss can be stunned and slowed: use CC liberally and kite between the nearby structures.",
    "战斗顺序参考：墓穴骑士阿特雷克西斯很靠前；奥术异常体在出下水道后的街道上；邪能古树被法力屏障锁着，要先打掉周围 boss 才解锁；大法师之影守终点。": "Fight order reference: Atrexis the Grave Knight comes very early; Arcane Anomaly is right after you exit the sewers; the Fel Ancient stays locked behind a mana barrier until surrounding bosses are defeated; the Shade of the Archmage guards the end.",
    "打伊莫塔尔前必须清掉全部法力尖塔，护盾才会消失。": "Clear every mana pylon before engaging Immol'thar — his shield only drops once they are destroyed.",
    "打审讯员韦沙斯没什么策略可言。他通常带着一个人形怪一起被拉过来，只要战斗中不引到额外的怪，就是一场标准的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。留意他的持续伤害技能。技能：献祭": "Interrogator Vishas doesn't involve much strategy. He's usually pulled with one additional humanoid, but as long as no additional mobs are aggro'd during the encounter, it's a straightforward tank and spank fight. Watch out for his DoT abilities. Abilities: Immolate",
    "打断是本副本关键词：火球、治疗术、暗影箭都要安排好打断轮换。": "Interrupts are the keyword of this dungeon: fireballs, heals and Shadow Bolts all need a rotation.",
    "托塞德林王子 攻击又快又疼。把坦克拉在角落里，用来规避击退技能 奥术冲击。注意他施放 奥术冲击 之后仇恨会重置——先停手，等坦克重新拉稳再全力输出。": "Prince Tortheldrin hits hard and fast. Tank him in the corner to avoid his knockback Arcane Blast. After casting Arcane Blast his aggro resets — cease DPS until the tank gets him back, then burn him down quickly.",
    "托塞德林王子击退之后仇恨重置，停手等坦克拉回再输出。": "Prince Tortheldrin resets aggro after his knockback — stop DPS until the tank re-establishes threat.",
    "扭木广场附近有隐形的古树巡逻者，坦克职业引怪时小心，必要时用范围技能把它们逼出来。": "Invisible ancient patrols roam the Warpwood Quarter — tank classes should pull carefully, using area attacks to flush them out when needed.",
    "扭木树人": "Warpwood Treants",
    "把奥法师杜安坦在房间中央，远程分散站到房间边缘。当他施放自爆时，所有人必须立刻跑向房间边缘。治疗在他施放魔爆术时刷好全队血线，并留意他的沉默。有些队伍会把奥法师杜安拉到前一个大厅的中央，利用柱子卡视线躲自爆。打死他后别忘了开他房间里的保险箱拿钥匙——进军械库和教堂全靠它。技能：奥术气泡 魔爆术 自爆 变形术 沉默": "Tank Arcanist Doan in the middle of the room with the ranged spread to the edges. When he casts Detonation, everyone must run as close to the edges as possible. Healers, keep up heals on the group when he casts Arcane Explosion and be wary of his Silence. Some groups opt to bring Arcanist Doan into the center of the previous hall and use the pillars to LoS his Detonation. Don't forget to pick up the key from the chest in his chamber after you kill him — it's required to access the Armory and the Cathedral. Abilities: Arcane Bubble Arcane Explosion Detonation Polymorph Silence",
    "拉 特迪斯·扭木 之前先把周围的所有古树清干净，否则它们会一起过来。注意他的范围近战击倒 践踏，远程务必站远一些。纠缠 是可以被驱散的定身效果。等坦克建立好威胁后全力输出即可。": "Clear all of the ancients in the area before pulling Tendris Warpwood, otherwise they will all aggro together. Watch out for his AoE melee knockdown Trample — ranged should stand well back. Entangle is a root effect that can be dispelled. Wait for the tank to build threat, then burn him down.",
    "拉姆斯登房间前的缝合怪伤害很高还会召唤小怪，一次只拉一只；开打后房间门会锁上，进门前提醒全队。": "The patchwork constructs before Ramstein's room hit hard and summon adds — pull one at a time, and warn the group before engaging since the door locks.",
    "拉文尼亚是 60 级精英，位于下层南边的房间（巴罗夫家族墓窖）。把他坦在墙边、背对人群。这是一场以近战为主的战斗，他打得又痛又快。小心他的范围技能，开怪前确保坦克仇恨已经拉稳。技能：顺劈斩 击退 破甲顺劈 践踏": "The Ravenian is a level 60 elite located in the southern room on the lower level (The Barov Family Vault). The Ravenian should be tanked against a wall, facing away from the rest of the group. It's a melee-centric fight, and he hits pretty hard and fast. Watch out for his AoE abilities and make sure the tank has generated enough threat before engaging. Abilities: Cleave Knock Away Sundering Cleave Trample",
    "指挥官沃恩是59级精英巨魔，身边没有护卫，但打人非常疼。在确定坦克建立起足够仇恨之前不要开怪。坦克要把他拉到墙边、自己背靠墙站位；如果指挥官沃恩转火别人，立即停手，等坦克把仇恨拉回去再继续输出。": "War Master Voone is a level 59 elite troll located in Lower . War Master Voone is not accompanied by any guards, but he hits really hard. Do not engage in the fight until you're certain tank has generated enough threat to maintain aggro. Tanks - pull him close to a wall and keep your back to the wall. If War Master Voone switches targets, stop DPS until the tank gets him back.",
    "按区域分主题的怪群": "Themed packs",
    "挖掘师长铲柄（稀有）": "Digmaster Shovelphlange (Rare)",
    "控制小怪密度": "Manage pack size",
    "控火师罗格雷恩是刷新在祭坛旁的可选boss，战斗极其简单，不做相关收集时通常直接跳过。他没什么战术可讨论，打掉图腾就行，轻松击杀。": "Pyromancer Loregrain is an optional boss that spawns near the Shrine. It is an incredibly easy fight. Skipped unless farming . Pyromancer Loregrain does not really warrant discussion of strategy outside of destroying to totem. Incredibly easy boss to kill.",
    "收割者麦什洛克是毒瀑水域的 48 级稀有精英，在入口附近的水里巡逻，外形与普通巡逻的洞窟潜伏者/洞窟游荡者几乎一样——记得用鼠标悬停或 /tar 麦什洛克宏确认是否刷新；没刷新时洞窟游荡者会替他巡逻。打法不难：坦克拉远离人群，远程尽量散开规避战争践踏，治疗注意他会用地震术打断你的施法。": "Meshlok the Harvester is a level 48 elite, rare spawn inside Poison Falls who patrols the waters near the beginning and looks very similar to either a Cavern Lurker or Cavern Shambler, so make sure you hover your mouse or use a /tar Meshlok macro to check to see if he is spawned. If he is not, Cavern Shambler will patrol in his place. He isn't very challenging. Tanks, tank him away from the group. Ranged, spread out if possible to avoid his War Stomp, and healers, be aware that he can interrupt your spell casting with Earth Shock.",
    "教堂小怪": "Cathedral trash",
    "教堂的怪堆扎得非常近，每一波都要小心拉，防止跑怪。": "Many of the mob packs in the Cathedral are grouped very closely together, so pull each pack carefully to prevent runners.",
    "数据库列出六个占位 boss（Staging Area 1-6）：祖阿莱、瓦尔塔卡、恐惧崛起船长、不死骨髓、吉尔与蛇之明洛斯；演示情报另提到辛阿卡（坦克杀手）。正式名单可能与此不同。": "The database lists six placeholder bosses (Staging Area 1-6): Zul'Alai, Var'Taka, Captain Dreadrise, Deathless Marrow, Gill and Min'loth the Serpent; demo reports add Zin'aka as a tank killer. The real roster may differ.",
    "这场战斗尚未有人见过 —— 副本完全开放测试后此条目预计会有更新。": "Nobody has seen this fight yet. Expect this entry to be updated once the dungeon becomes fully testable.",
    "敲锣召唤蜘蛛时一波一波来，清完再敲，别连敲加压。": "Ring the gong wave by wave when summoning spiders — clear each wave before ringing again.",
    "整个副本最危险的区域是盐脊一带的草丛：灌木丛潜行者并不是潜行在草里 —— 在草丛中走动几步就会像宝可梦遇敌一样直接刷新接战。灌木丛女家长散布在周边，血量低时会尖叫召唤潜行者支援。应对：别踩草、走窄道、在开阔区接怪；与非女家长的怪群作战时先速杀非女家长，让尖叫召出的增援尽量少。": "The most dangerous section is the grass around Saltspine: Thicket Lurkers are not stealthed — walking through tall grass spawns them, Pokémon-style. Thicket Matriarchs are spread around the area and screech for Lurker reinforcements at low health. Stay out of the grass, take the narrow path, fight in open areas, and when fighting Matriarchs kill the non-Matriarch mobs first so the screech summons as few extras as possible.",
    "文件中还有两件可触发任务的「克罗多克铸件」。": "Two quest-triggering Krol'dok Castings exist in the files.",
    "斯库尔 是一个稀有怪，可能出现在 艾兹拉·格里姆 之前的位置，副本东侧还有一个刷新点。他的机制非常简单——只会读法术，能打断就打断，减少团队受到的伤害。": "Skul is a rare spawn you may encounter just before Ezra Grimm, with another spawn point on the east side of the dungeon. His mechanics are very simple — he just casts spells, which you should interrupt to reduce damage.",
    "无敌的潘佐尔是模具铸造厂里的稀有boss。由于法术反转，他对施法职业相当烦人，但除此之外并不算难。平时很少会遇到他；遇到了，最要紧的就是让施法职业盯好法术反转，其余就是一场轻松的战斗。": "Panzor the Invincible is a rare boss spawn within The Mold Foundry. He is fairly annoying to casters because of Spell Reflection, but outside of that, he is a fairly easy encounter. Panzor the Invincible is not a mob that will be encountered often. However, when encountered, the biggest thing is for casters to watch out for Spell Reflection. other than that, it is an easy encounter.",
    "是副本外南方大厅巡逻的 38 级精英地精。他攻击很痛，布甲职业尤其小心。让坦克先建立仇恨再开火；除了攻速快和几个小技能，只要不多引怪，轻松击杀。": "is a level 38 elite goblin that patrols the caverns outside of the instance, in the South Common Hall, before you zone in. He can hit hard, especially for cloth wearers. Make sure the tank picks him up and has aggro before you begin DPSing. Other than a fast attack speed and a couple of abilities, so long as you don't pull any additional mobs, you should be able to burn him down with ease.",
    "是学院里的亡灵小怪。注意：它们被\"杀掉\"约 10 秒后会从地上重新站起来，做好再战一场的准备！": "The is an undead trash mob. Note: arise from the dead about 10 seconds after they are originally \"killed\" — be prepared for them to pop back up and attack again!",
    "是学院里的亡灵小怪。注意：它死亡时会喷出毒云，每秒造成约 350 点自然伤害——杀完立刻离开尸体，看到毒云出现就知道安全距离在哪。": "The is an undead trash mob. Note: spews a poison cloud when it dies that deals about 350 nature damage per second — clear the area around the corpse; the cloud itself marks the safe distance.",
    "是学院里的亡灵骸骨小怪。注意：免疫非神圣系魔法。": "The is an undead, skeletal trash mob. Note: are immune to non-Holy magic.",
    "是本副本最烦人的小怪之一。他们的核心技能陷地图腾会召唤缚地图腾，持续 30 秒并周期性定身附近玩家。一旦被定在错误位置，很容易引到额外的怪堆。应对方式：优先击杀缚地图腾，再清其余小怪。": "is one of the most annoying mobs in RFK. Their chief ability, Earthgrab Totem, summons an Earthgrab Totem that lasts 30 sec. and periodically immobilizes nearby enemies. If rooted out of position, your group may be at risk of pulling additional mob packs. Deal with this ability by prioritizing the Earthgrab Totem before killing any other mob in a pack.",
    "是游荡在剃刀高地各处的虚空幽灵。核心技能是，应对方式很简单：全队叠到坦克身上，避免被冻在错误位置。": "The is an ethereal mob located throughout RFD. is the key ability of the Freezing Spirits. The strategy to deal with this ability is to stack on the tank in order not to be caught out of position.",
    "是附魔大师级训练师，位于地图大厅与神殿大厅之间，从后门进入更容易到达。她身边环绕着蝎怪，对话前先清场。35 级且附魔 200 即可在她处学习大师级附魔；建议带足材料一次冲到 250，顺手学走、、三张顶级配方，从此不必再来。": "is the Artisan trainer for Enchanting, located between the Map Chamber and Temple Hall, and easier to get to from the Back Entrance. She's surrounded by scorpids, so be prepared to clear the area before talking with her. You can train Artisan Enchanting from her at level 35 with 200 Enchanting Skill. Come prepared with enough reagents to skill up to 250, at which point you can learn her top recipes , , and so you never have to return.",
    "普希林会沿路逃跑开怪，追击时控制好节奏，避免一路带出多组小怪。": "Pusillin runs down the path when engaged - pace the chase to avoid extra packs.",
    "暗影猎手沃什加斯是59级精英巨魔，身边跟着两名燃棘暗影牧师。与欧莫克大王的处理类似：控制住一个怪，把暗影猎手沃什加斯拉离团队再打，因为她的妖术一次能波及多名队员。先把两个燃棘暗影牧师全部杀掉，再集火暗影猎手沃什加斯。队里有能驱散职业的话，记得及时驱掉她的血之诅咒。": "Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin is a level 59 elite troll located in Lower . Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin is accompanied by two Smolderthorn Shadow Priests. Similar to Highlord Omokk, groups typically will CC one of the mobs, and pull Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin away from the group. This is due to her Hex, which can affect multiple group members at a time. Kill her both Smolderthorn Shadow Priests first, then focus down Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin. If you have a or in the group, have them cleanse her Curse of Blood.",
    "暗影石一侧小怪": "Shadowshard side trash",
    "暗炉钥匙是玩转深渊的核心：第一次来优先做任务拿钥匙，之后可开侧门直达后半区。": "The Shadowforge Key is essential - get it on your first run to unlock the shortcut doors.",
    "暗铁矮人成群驻守且巡逻密集，逐组拉动，恐惧类技能谨慎使用以免带出连锁怪。": "Dark Irons come in dense packs with patrols - pull carefully and use fear sparingly.",
    "暗铁矮人据点": "Dark Iron Camps",
    "暗齿带着两只灌木丛猎人现身，同时硬打三个目标非常吃力 —— 要么全程把小怪控制住单点 boss，要么控制一个先集火杀掉另一个；猎人对当前目标施放的毒要尽快驱散。只剩 boss 后注意两点：「撕裂」对坦克伤害不低；「恐吓咆哮」是 5 秒不可驱散的恐惧 —— 很容易被恐进草丛里刷新的迅猛龙或没清完的小怪群。清空左侧的鳄鱼湾、把 boss 拉到那片开阔区打；灌木丛猎人不会游泳，把它拖回上一个 boss 的区域会直接重置战斗。boss 可以被减速和眩晕 —— 它 30% 血以下进入「狂怒」时尤其有用。": "Shadetooth is joined by two Thicket Hunters; fighting all three at once is very difficult unless overleveled — either CC the adds for the whole fight, or CC one and kill the other first. Dispel the Hunters' poison quickly. Once only the boss remains: Tendon Rip hits the tank moderately, and Terrifying Roar is a 5-second undispellable fear — easy to get feared into grass-spawned raptors or uncleared adds. Clear the crocodile cove to the left and fight there; the Hunters cannot swim, so dragging the boss back into the previous boss area resets it. The boss can be slowed and stunned, which is especially useful during Frenzy below 30%.",
    "暴怒的阿迦赛罗斯流程直接，但单体伤害极高。这场战斗的难点在于保住坦克，治疗和队里的混合职业 DPS 都要帮忙刷血。": "Agathelos the Raging is a straightforward encounter, though this boss deals massive single-target damage. Most of this fight's difficulty is keeping the tank alive, which will fall on the healer and any hybrid DPS your group might have.",
    "暴雪将该区域比作《侏罗纪公园》：环形山山丘间遍布泰坦建筑、能量水晶与有攻击性的野生动物。": "Blizzard compares the area to Jurassic Park: titan structures, power crystals and aggressive wildlife fill the hills of Un'Goro.",
    "暴食者就是简单的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。注意躲开他留下的疾病云团，boss 施放狂暴时治疗要准备好硬刷坦克的大额伤害。": "Glutton is a simple tank and spank. Make sure to stay out of his Disease Clouds and be prepared to heal the tank through significant amounts of damage when the boss casts Enrage.",
    "最常见路线从希尔斯布莱德丘陵的南海镇出发，沿大路向北，绕过达拉然废坑与奥特兰克废墟之间的山口，向北游过洛丹米尔湖，在银松森林与提瑞斯法林地交界处上岸。": "The most common path starts at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills: head north along the road, cut through the pass between the Dalaran Crater and the Ruins of Alterac, swim north through Lordamere Lake and surface at the border of Silverpine Forest and Tirisfal Glades.",
    "最要命的是逃跑的怪：用减速、定身、昏迷等一切手段拦住它，这是这个区团灭的主要原因。": "Watch out for mobs that run away at low health: use snares, slows and stuns to stop them — runners are the main cause of wipes here.",
    "月牙钥匙是东区关键：完成普希林掉落的任务线即可获得，队里一人有就能开门。": "The Crescent Key comes from a quest item dropped by Pusillin - one per group opens the doors.",
    "杀进戈多克大王的大厅——是正面硬刚，还是满载贡品而归。": "Storm Gordok's seat — fight your way through, or sneak out with the full tribute.",
    "格瑞姆洛克 &lt;石窟酋长&gt;与石窟地占师、石窟争斗者和玉脊蜥蜴同场出现。多数队伍选择极限爆发秒掉格瑞姆洛克 &lt;石窟酋长&gt;，同时控制住一只增援——杀得够快就能让他来不及施放群体缩小。他死后先打石窟地占师，再清掉剩下两只增援。": "Grimlok comes with a Stonevault Geomancer, Stonevault Brawler and a Jadespine Basilisk all grouped up together. Many groups will opt to burn down Grimlok as quickly as possible, while CCing one of the adds. Killing Grimlok quickly can result in him dying before being able to cast his group Shrink. After he dies, focus on the Stonevault Geomancer next, and then finish off the remaining 2 adds.",
    "格里兹尔极其简单，几乎没有什么需要提防的东西，唯一要留意的还是地震术会打断施法。": "Grizzle is incredibly easy. There is nothing really to look out for. Earth Shock can interrupt casting, which is about the only real concern on this boss.",
    "档案管理员加尔福特 在地图 11 号位置的一个独立房间里，这个房间关联两个任务——做任务的话记得先捡东西再烧房。他有一个持续伤害 燃烧之风 和一个范围伤害技能，会让治疗压力变大；如果持续伤害跳到坦克身上，要做好承受大量伤害的准备。": "Archivist Galford spawns at number 11 on the map, in a room tied to two quests — loot what you need before burning down the room. He has a DoT Burning Winds and an AoE ability, which makes the fight harder on healers; if the DoT lands on the tank, be ready for heavy damage.",
    "橙、紫两条入口最终互通，先跑哪条都行；拿到塞雷布拉斯权杖后可开传送门直达地鸣瀑布。": "The orange and purple wings interconnect; once you have the Scepter of Celebras you can open a portal straight to Earth Song Falls.",
    "欧莫克大王是59级精英食人魔，身边还带着两名食人魔随从。多数队伍会控制住一个随从，坦克把欧莫克大王拉离人群、背靠墙站位，以应对他的击退。和队伍商量好随从的处理方式：控制充足就两个全控、先杀欧莫克大王；或者全程控住一个，先杀另一个再转火本体。无论哪种，控制技能都是刚需，能让这场战斗轻松许多。欧莫克大王本身打人很疼，治疗要盯紧坦克血线——他的狂怒能在瞬间打出毁灭性的伤害。": "Highlord Omokk is a level 59 elite ogre located in Lower . Highlord Omokk is accompanied by two other Ogres. Most groups tend to CC one of the adds, while the tank picks up Highlord Omokk, keeping him away from the group, with their back against a wall due to Omokk's Knock Away. Decide within your group how to handle the adds. Either CC both if possible and kill Highlord Omokk first, or keep one add CC'd the entire time, kill the other, then Omokk. The choice is yours, but be sure crowd control is involved because it will make this encounter a lot easier. Highlord Omokk himself hits pretty hard, so healers, be sure to keep an eye on the tank's health, especially if it gets low. With his Enrage, he could dish out devastating damage, quickly.",
    "正门位于荒芜之地与洛克莫丹交界处以南，见到黑暗铁矮人活动即说明位置正确。": "The primary entrance sits just south of the Loch Modan/Badlands border; you'll know you're close when Shadowforge Dwarves start appearing.",
    "死灵勇士的战斗很直接，就是劈砍型近战。所有输出都站在他背后，躲开他的顺劈斩。技能：狂暴姿态 顺劈斩": "The Fallen Champion encounter is straightforward, consisting of cleaving melee attacks. All DPS should stand behind him to avoid his Cleave. Abilities: Berserker Stance Cleave",
    "死颅信徒": "Death's Head Adept",
    "殉教者塞卡是圣甲虫房间里的任务小 boss，46 级精英。血量 30% 时他会获得持续 30 秒的物理与暗影伤害免疫——法师在这个副本里价值凸显。本体是简单的坦克拉住、输出打木桩，但他进入免疫后会引诱附近圣甲虫支援：先集火塞卡，再回头清甲虫。": "Theka the Martyr is a level 46 elite Sandfury Troll, a quest-related mini-boss found in the Scarab room of ZF. At 30%, he becomes immune to physical damage and shadow damage for 30 seconds, making Mages a valuable asset in the dungeon. He is a simple tank and spank, but once he goes immune, he will begin aggroing nearby scarabs to aide him in battle. Focus down Theka first before finishing off the scarabs.",
    "毫无疑问，这是整个副本最艰难的一场遭遇战，做好苦战的准备。如果你是战士坦克或战士输出，只要站位从容就能站得住脚。如果你们决定救下铁炉堡公主茉艾拉·铜须 &lt;铁炉堡公主&gt;，策略就是让副坦克或能打断施法的人缠住她——绝不能让她整场自由施法，因为她在战斗中会协助达格兰·索瑞森大帝，而且她还很脆。达格兰·索瑞森大帝一死，她就会解除精神控制变为友善。如果你们打算杀掉铁炉堡公主茉艾拉·铜须 &lt;铁炉堡公主&gt;，那就先集火她、再解决达格兰·索瑞森大帝。务必带好打断技能：她自身伤害可观，再叠加达格兰·索瑞森大帝的输出，治疗会很难扛住。另外拾取铁炉堡公主茉艾拉·铜须 &lt;铁炉堡公主&gt;可能出bug，开打前确保全队都完成了相应的任务链。": "This is, unquestionably, the most difficult encounter of the dungeon, so be prepared for a fun fight. However, if you're a warrior tank or dps, get super comfortable, you'll live here while working on obtaining . If you are choosing to save Princess Moira Bronzebeard, then your strategy is to keep her occupied with an off-tank, or someone who can interrupt her casts. because she can be fairly squishy. Further, she assists Emperor Dagran Thaurissan within the fight, so you can't allow her to simply free cast the entire encounter. As soon as Emperor Dagran Thaurissan dies, she breaks free from the mind control she was under to become friendly. However, if your intention is to kill Princess Moira Bronzebeard, then you burn her before killing Emperor Dagran Thaurissan. Make sure you have some form of interrupt because she can do a fair amount of damage, which can be hard to heal through coupled with the damage output of Emperor Dagran Thaurissan. Looting Princess Moira Bronzebeard can be buggy; make sure your group has completed the / chain first.",
    "水占师维蕾萨在精英堆里巡逻，务必单独拉出再开打。": "Hydromancer Velratha patrols among elite packs — single-pull her before engaging.",
    "水占师维蕾萨是接近副本尾声的 46 级精英沙怒巨魔。本体只是简单的坦克拉住、输出打木桩，考验的是全队的观察与走位——她在布满精英沙怒巨魔的房间里巡逻，务必单独把她拉出来，否则极易灭团；安全拉开后打断她的读条即可轻松获胜。": "Hydromancer Velratha is a level 46 elite Sandfury Troll located near the end of Zul'Farrak. Velratha is a simple tank and spank, but tests a group's situational awareness. Velratha patrols around the room, which is riddled with elite Sandfury. Make sure that you pull her ALONE, otherwise a wipe is likely. Once you've pulled her safely, interrupt her casts and you should be fine.",
    "水晶之牙是刷新在巢穴附近区域的稀有怪，路过时留意一下即可。": "Crystal Fang is a rare spawn found in the area around 's lair, in Lower .",
    "永醒的艾希尔有多个法术能力，其中一个会群体恐惧。开怪前先把周围清干净，否则恐惧可能把人带进额外的怪堆。小心他的火焰的召唤，就算他已经死了也可能继续造成伤害。技能：火焰的召唤 灵魂虹吸 恐吓": "Azshir the Sleepless has several magic abilities, including a fear. Make sure the area is clear before engaging him, as the fear can lead someone into additional mobs. Be wary of his Call of the Grave, which can inflict damage even after his death. Abilities: Call of the Grave Soul Siphon Terrify",
    "沙怒暗影猎手": "Sandfury Shadowhunter",
    "沙怒暗影猎手的妖术会让坦克瞬间丢仇恨，牧师的驱散魔法要按好快捷键。": "The Shadowhunters' Hex makes the tank drop all aggro — priests should keep Dispel Magic on a handy keybind.",
    "河林新区域中的巨型户外食人魔要塞：劫掠村庄、掳走居民的食人魔盘踞于此，40-45 级。": "A sprawling outdoor ogre stronghold in He-Rin, whose ogres raid villages and carry off their people, 40-45.",
    "沿南海岸向南游到塔纳利斯即可到达副本入口，别忘了顺手点亮塞拉摩岛与塔纳利斯的鸟点。": "Swim south along the coast to Tanaris to reach the entrance; don't forget the flight paths in Theramore Isle and Tanaris.",
    "沿外围绕到营地西侧": "Follow the outer path around to the western side",
    "沿外墙走到东北侧的东区入口进入副本。": "Follow the outer wall to the eastern entrance.",
    "沿长管道走到尽头，进入紫色传送门。": "Follow the long pipe to its end and enter the purple portal.",
    "法力尖塔": "Mana pylons",
    "法力幻影": "Mana Phantoms",
    "法力幻影（非精英）会读条施放法力燃烧，对被点名者压力极大 —— 优先打断或集火。饱和残余死后会留下一片回复法力的区域，路过记得踩进去回蓝。": "Mana Phantoms (non-elite) cast Mana Burn, which is very taxing on whoever is targeted — interrupt or focus them. The Saturated Remnant leaves behind a mana-restoring field on death; make use of it.",
    "泽雷利斯是在副本内巡逻的 45 级稀有精英。第一时间把他拉进近战范围（可能需要卡视野），然后就是简单的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。": "Zerillis is a level 45 rare-elite Sandfury Troll that patrols throughout Zul'Farrak. Pull him into melee range immediately (you might need to LoS). Simple tank and spank.",
    "洛特格里普是毒瀑里 50 级的巨型白色鳄鱼精英，在扎埃塔之穴的水域巡逻——就是你刚击败瑟莱德丝公主的地方。跳下水开怪，务必确认周围清净，水里还游荡着多头蛇。他伤害爆炸：坦克先稳稳建立仇恨，治疗全力保持坦克血线；刺破是物理 DoT，配合致命刺痛能在几秒内打崩前排。": "Rotgrip is a giant level 50 white crocolisk elite found in Poison Falls. He patrols in the water of Zaetar's Cave — the area in which you just defeated Princess Theradras. Drop down into the water to engage him. Be sure the surrounding area is clear, as there are also lingering Hydras in the water. He hits hard! Make sure your tank has proper aggro before everyone else engages. Healers, try your best to keep your tank and other party members topped off. Rotgrip can dish out devastating damage quickly using his two abilities: Puncture, a physical damage-over-time, and Fatal Bite.",
    "洛考尔可以说是全本最简单的boss之一——60级德鲁伊都能单刷他，难度可想而知。战斗本身毫无要点，唯一需要留意的是地震术会打断施法。": "Arguably, Lord Roccor is one of the easiest bosses in . Level 60 druids are able to solo this boss, which indicates just how easily he can be defeated. Lord Roccor is incredibly easy. There is nothing really to look out for. Earth Shock can interrupt casting, which is about the only real concern on this boss.",
    "洞穴尽头的蓝色传送门就是副本入口。": "",
    "活人区街道狭窄、小怪密集，尽量用控制技能限制数量，一次拉一队，避免同时引到巡逻怪。": "The live side streets are narrow and packed — use crowd control, pull one pack at a time, and watch for patrols to avoid overlapping pulls.",
    "海多斯博恩有两种处理方式：无视他召唤的水浪幼崽直接rush本体，或者先AoE清掉水元素再转火。这些水元素造成的伤害往往比海多斯博恩本人还高，所以选择速推的话，要盯紧治疗的血线，有机会就打断他的施法。": "Hydrospawn could be approached in 2 ways. Burn him down & ignore the Hydroling that he spawns, or AoE down the Hydroling then switch over to Hydrospawn. The Hydroling do tend to cause more damage than Hydrospawn himself, so if you choose to just burn him down quickly, keep an eye on your healers and interrupt spells when you can.",
    "深入辛德拉精灵的废墟，斩断恶魔伊莫塔尔的锁链，直面托塞德林王子的疯狂。": "Delve into the Shen'dralar ruins, break Immol'thar's chains, and face Prince Tortheldrin's madness.",
    "深入阿塔哈卡神庙，阻止阿塔莱祭司唤醒血神哈卡的仪式。": "Descend into the Temple of Atal'Hakkar and stop the Atal'ai from summoning the Blood God.",
    "清完房间里所有缝合憎恶后，吞咽者拉姆斯登 会在地图 18 号位置出现。开打这些缝合怪后房间大门会上锁，所以要提前告知队友，并且一次只拉一只——它们伤害可观，还会召唤额外的小怪。吞咽者拉姆斯登 本体就是带仇恨交换机制的木桩战：他会对坦克施放 击昏 并交换仇恨，期间还会用 践踏，治疗要给输出职业留一些治疗量。": "Ramstein the Gorger spawns at number 18 on the map after you kill all the patchwork mobs in the room. The gate into the room locks once you start pulling, so let your group know, and pull the patchworks one at a time — they hit hard and can spawn extra mobs. Ramstein the Gorger himself is basically a tank and spank with aggro swaps: he casts Knockout on the tank and swaps aggro, using Trample along the way, so healers should keep some heals ready for the DPS.",
    "湿地上方维尔加挖掘场一带被蓝雾笼罩的新挖掘场：失控的泰坦构造体在此苏醒，共 4 个 boss。": "A mist-shrouded dig site above Whelgar's Excavation in the Wetlands, where errant Titan constructs stir: 4 bosses.",
    "演示中的推进顺序大致为：马库拉与小蟹 → 复活的巨魔哨兵 → 密集成群的纳迦。": "Demo pull order was roughly makrura and small crabs first, then risen troll sentries, then naga in tight packs.",
    "演示中街道的小怪群里被拉过一只 27 级的法力幽灵。没有任何证据表明它是正式 boss —— 在 beta 确认前，此条目按占位处理。": "A level 27 Mana Wraith was pulled with the trash during the demo. There is no evidence it is a real boss — treat this entry as a placeholder until the beta confirms.",
    "潜过环水，从底部入口进入副本。": "Swim across the moat and enter from the submerged entrance.",
    "火抗装对烈焰卫士艾博希尔和达基萨斯将军的战斗帮助很大，坦克尤其需要。": "Fire resistance helps a lot for Emberseer and Drakkisath, especially for tanks.",
    "火眼莫德雷斯开打前务必清光骷髅，最后一波会连带引到 boss。": "Clear every skeleton before engaging Mordresh Fire Eye; the last pack will aggro the boss.",
    "火眼莫德雷斯是护甲很低的施法型 boss，近战可以轻松爆发带走。开打前务必清光骨堆旁跳舞的骷髅——最后一批骷髅会连带引到 boss，快速 AOE 清掉以防灭团。能打断他的高伤火球就尽量打断，胜利手到擒来。": "Mordresh Fire Eye is a low-armor cast boss that can be bursted down easily by melee dps. Before you engage him, make sure to clear all of the skeletons dancing beside the bone pile. The last pack of skeletons will pull the boss, so make sure to AOE them down quickly to prevent a wipe. Interrupt Mordresh's hard-hitting fireball when you can and this should be an easy win.",
    "炮手威利 在地图 9 号位置刷新。战斗中他会召唤几只远程小怪——要么转火清掉，要么捡起 炮手威利 旁边的炮弹装进大炮，用炮把它们轰掉。他有一个打断技能，但只要处理好小怪，整场战斗很简单。": "Cannon Master Willey spawns at number 9 on the map. He summons several ranged adds during the fight — either switch to them, or grab a cannon ball near Cannon Master Willey and load it into one of the cannons to shoot them down. He has an interrupt, but apart from that the fight is simple as long as the adds are handled.",
    "炮手威利的小怪可以转火清掉，也可以用场边大炮轰杀。": "Cannon Master Willey's adds can be burned down or shot with the nearby cannons.",
    "点击地图 8 号位置地上的锻造图样即可召唤。就是一个简单的木桩战，他只掉落护甲锻造专精的锻造师需要的图样。": "Summoned by clicking the blacksmithing plans on the floor at number 8 on the map. A simple tank and spank; he only drops plans for blacksmiths with the Armorsmithing specialization.",
    "烟网蛛后房间旁的下层洞窟是水晶之牙等稀有怪的刷新点，路过用 /target 检查。": "The cave below Smolderweb's room spawns rares like Crystal Fang - /target to check.",
    "烟网蛛后是下层里59级精英蜘蛛boss。她的结晶是正面锥形的群体眩晕，所以坦克自然要让她背对团队。她还会周期性施放母蛛之奶——一种眩晕目标及其附近玩家的毒药。盯好这两个技能，就能比较轻松地把她打掉。": "Mother Smolderweb is a level 59 elite spider boss found within Lower . Mother Smolderweb's Crystallize is an AoE frontal cone stun. So naturally, have your tank face her away from the group. She will periodically cast Mother's Milk , a poison that stuns her target and anyone within close proximity of them. Being attentive to these 2 abilities, you can burn her down relatively easy.",
    "熔岩奔跑（刷黑铁锭）的队伍可以顺路清掉伊森迪奥斯和精细的达克维尔。": "Lava Run groups can pick up Incendius and Fineous Darkvire on the way.",
    "熔岩犬与火元素": "Core Hounds & Fire Elementals",
    "熔炉房间的目标是击杀比斯巨兽。这场战斗有一定难度，难点集中在三个机制上：第一是 无法躲避的冲锋，冲锋结束后他会回到当前仇恨最高的目标身上，所以主坦克必须始终稳居仇恨第一；第二是恐惧，团队应保持最大距离并散开站位来规避；第三是名为烈焰崩裂的火焰新星，附带火焰伤害与击退——坦克背靠墙防击退，其他人尽量退到最大距离，减少吃到的AoE伤害。": "The goal here within The Furnace is to kill The Beast . Berserker Charge Immolate Flamebreak Fear The Beast is a decently difficult fight because of a few mechanics. The first is a charge that can’t be avoided. As soon as the charge happens, he will return to the top aggroed target. The MT should always have the most aggro to ensure it returns properly. The second mechanic that will cause issues is the fear. Raid groups should be at max range and spread out from The Beast to avoid this mechanic. Finally, there is a fire nova ability called Flamebreak that will do fire damage and cause a knockback. Tanks should have their back to a wall to avoid being knocked back. Everyone else should attempt to back at max range to avoid taking too much AoE damage.",
    "爬行者赫杜姆是一场非常直白的战斗，除了清毒和解掉定身效果之外，没有更多策略可言。": "Hedrum the Creeper is a fairly straightforward boss. No real strategy is present outside of cleansing the poisons and dispel the Immobilize.",
    "特别的怪": "Notable mobs",
    "狂热的玛洛尔 除了 圣疗术 之外没有任何值得注意的机制。他单独待在地图 7 号位置的房间里，他身后的箱子装着相关任务所需的物品，以及一些金币和随机物品。": "Malor the Zealous has no notable mechanics apart from Lay on Hands. He is located in his own room at number 7 on the map; the chest behind him contains the item for the related quest, plus some gold and random items.",
    "玛拉多纳是半人马地穴与元素洞穴双线推进的 45 级副本，橙/紫双入口最终汇于地鸣瀑布，产出大量自然抗性装备。": "Maraudon is a two-wing level-45 dungeon — the orange and purple crystal entrances converge at Earth Song Falls — dropping plenty of Nature Resistance gear.",
    "玛格姆斯是一场考验走位的战斗，因为整间大厅两侧全程都有火焰喷出。他站在长厅的尽头，厅内有两排喷火的傀儡，火焰伤害极高，沾上很快就会没命。坦克要把玛格姆斯拉到合适的位置，让侧面的火焰不构成威胁。处理好了站位，这场战斗本身相当轻松——一切的关键就是把boss拉对地方。": "Magmus is a tricky fight because of the fires coming from each side throughout the chamber. Magmus stands at the end of a long chamber. WIthin the chamber, there are two rows of fire belching golems. This fire is brutal and will kill you rapidly. As such, it is on the tank to put Magmus in a good position, so that the flames aren't an issue. Outside of the flames from the sides of the chamber, the fight is fairly easy. This fight is all about positioning the boss correctly.",
    "班诺克·巨斧 &lt;火印军团勇士&gt;是下层最抢手的稀有怪之一，因为他有几率掉落非常实用的配方。他刷新在烟网蛛后房间前的一间、一堆帐篷旁的兽人区域。记得用 /tar Bannok 检查他有没有刷新——他在的话，通常正坐在或睡在角落里。": "Bannok Grimaxe is a highly sought-after rare spawn in Lower , because he has a chance to drop . He spawns in the room before Mother Smolderweb, among packs of orcs, by a cluster of tents. Be sure to use /tar Bannok to see if he's spawned. If he is, he's either sitting or sleeping in a corner.",
    "琥珀岩一侧小怪": "Ambershard side trash",
    "瑞文戴尔男爵 是亡灵区的最终 boss。他的技能组合会降低坦克受到的治疗效果，并通过光环和顺劈持续造成范围伤害，战斗中还会不断召唤骷髅——要尽快顺劈清掉，否则会给团队造成大麻烦。推荐打法：在外面加好增益再一起进门，因为开怪后大门会关闭。坦克向右跑，把 boss 拉到房间右侧，近战跟上；远程输出和治疗站在左侧的骨堆上，规避 邪恶光环。近战要站在 boss 背后躲顺劈。骷髅刷新后，输出的第一要务是转火——它们死得很快，坦克不必全部拉住。尽量远离光环，这场战斗就会轻松很多。": "Baron Rivendare is the final boss of the undead side. His kit reduces healing on the tank and deals consistent AoE damage with his aura and cleave, and he summons skeletons throughout the fight — cleave them down quickly or they will wreak havoc. A proven strategy: buff up outside and run in together, as the door closes on pull. The tank runs right and pulls him to the right side of the room with the melee; ranged DPS and the healer stand on the bone piles on the left to avoid Unholy Aura. Melee should stay behind the boss to avoid his cleave. When skeletons spawn, switching to them is the DPS priority — they die quickly and the tank does not need to pick them all up. Keep your distance from the aura and the fight becomes much easier.",
    "瑟尔林·卡斯迪诺夫教授 &lt;屠夫&gt;是 60 级精英，位于上层东边的房间（诅咒之厅）。让坦克开怪并背靠墙站。他的血量到 50% 时攻击速度会大幅提升，正是开防御和治疗大招的好时机。他只有近战技能，保持坦克存活，集火打掉即可！技能：击退 撕裂": "Doctor Theolen Krastinov is a level 60 elite located in the eastern room on the upper level (The Hall of the Damned). Have your tank pull Doctor Theolen Krastinov and keep their back to a wall. At 50% health, his attack speed will dramatically increase — a great time to use defensive and healing cooldowns. He has melee-only abilities, so keep the tank alive and burn him down! Abilities: Knock Away Rend",
    "瑟莱德丝公主的群体恐惧要提前布置应对手段（防恐结界、解恐等）。": "Prepare tools against the Princess's group Fear in advance (Fear Ward, dispels and the like).",
    "瑟雷姆·刺蹄会周期性把一名队员传送到他的祭坛上并施放牺牲。治疗注意：被点名的人需要大量治疗！他的另一个法术剧烈痛楚相当于群体版的暗言术：痛，可以驱散，远程保持最大距离就能避开。如果队里有术士，还有一种打法是奴役一个荒野唤魔者或荒野暗影行者，让它去攻击瑟雷姆·刺蹄。": "Zevrim Thornhoof will periodically teleport a party member to his ritual alter and cast Sacrifice. Healers: whoever is targeted by this will need BIG heals! His other spell, Intense Pain is like an AoE Shadow Word: Pain that can be dispelled. Ranged, stand max distance to avoid this. If you have a in your group, one tactic is to enslave a Wildspawn Hellcaller or Wildspawn Shadowstalker and use them to attack Zevrim Thornhoof.",
    "男爵开怪后大门关闭，远程和治療站上骨堆可以大幅减轻治疗压力。": "The Baron's door closes on pull — ranged and healers standing on the bone piles ease the healing load dramatically.",
    "瘟疫食尸鬼": "Plagued Ghoul",
    "瘟疫食尸鬼死亡时会喷出毒云，每秒约 350 点自然伤害——杀完立刻离开尸体附近。": "Plagued Ghouls spew a poison cloud when they die, dealing about 350 nature damage per second — clear the area around the corpse immediately.",
    "的核心技能（妖术）处理不当足以灭团：被妖术的目标会丢失全部仇恨，若中招的是坦克，周围所有敌人都会转头攻击其余队友。坦克中招时必须由牧师瞬间驱散；队里有法师的话，也可以变羊暗影猎手、清完剩余小怪再单挑他。": "The is a Sandfury Troll located inside Zul'Farrak. is the key ability of the Shadowhunters, and if not dealt with properly, will result in a wipe for the group. The Hex ability causes all mobs to drop aggro on the hexxed target, meaning that if the target is the tank, all nearby enemies will begin attacking the remaining members of the group. In order to deal with a Hexxed tank, you must have a priest instantly dispel the effect from the tank. Alternatively, if you have a mage in your group, you can polymorph the Shadowhunter, clear out the remainder of the pack, and deal with the Shadowhunter alone.",
    "盐史通缉者会掉落任务物品「注入巫毒的神器」，与城中相互冲突的魔法有关。": "Saltseer Manhunters drop Voodoo-Infused Artifact, a quest item tied to the city's conflicting magics.",
    "目前 boss 与掉落均无公开数据（记录为 0 件掉落），因此本攻略暂无 boss 条目 —— 待 beta 开放后补充。": "No bosses or drops have public data yet (0 drops recorded), so this guide has no boss entries yet — it will fill in once the beta opens the area.",
    "盲眼猎手就在蝙蝠洞里，打法简单。他开始读音素爆破（群体沉默）时，施法职业务必停手。除此之外就是常规的坦克拉住、输出打木桩，掉落相当不错。这只稀有怪还可以被猎人驯服，是热门宠物。": "Blind Hunter is a simple fight that takes place inside the Bat Cave in RFK. Make sure your casters stop casting when he begins casting his Sonic Burst (Sonic Boom), which is an AOE silence ability. Aside from that, the fight is a simple tank and spank with fantastic loot. This Rare can be tamed by Hunters and is a sought-after pet.",
    "石头与元素类怪物免疫 DoT 且高护甲，直伤职业优先处理。": "Elementals and rock-type mobs are DoT-immune with high armor — let direct-damage classes handle them.",
    "石脊 是在地图 14 号位置刷新的稀有怪，会沿着那条走廊来回巡逻。除了 恶毒撕裂 之外没有任何值得一提的机制，不过他会掉一些不错的装备。": "Stonespine is a rare spawn that appears at 14 on the map and paths up and down that section. He has no notable mechanics apart from Vicious Rend, though he does drop some decent gear.",
    "破坏者奥科索尔是法律之环里最难的一位，技能多、变数大。他打法像法师，变形术脸黑的话可能直接灭团。关键是及时驱散变形术，并让尽可能多的团员保持距离站位，把魔爆术的影响降到最低。": "Ok'thor the Breaker is the most difficult boss within Ring of the Law because of the number of abilities. He plays like a mage, and bad Polymorph luck could lead to a wipe. The key is to dispel the Polymorph and have as many members stay at range as possible to minimize the effect of Arcane Explosion",
    "祖尔法拉克是巨魔都市遗迹风格的 40 级经典本，以阶梯事件与密集精英怪闻名，AOE 与控场收益极高。": "Zul'Farrak is a classic level-40 troll-city dungeon famous for its stairs event and dense elite packs — AoE and crowd control pay off hugely.",
    "稀有怪斯库尔和弗雷斯特恩各有两个刷新点，推进时留意脚下。": "Rare spawns Skul and Hearthsinger Forresten each have two spawn points — keep an eye out as you push.",
    "穿过中央竞技场进入内场": "Pass through the central arena into the interior",
    "穿过传染病穴直取瑞文戴尔男爵，小心满屋的蜘蛛与缝合憎恶。": "Push through the Service entrance to Baron Rivendare — beware the spider dens and patchwork horrors.",
    "穿过腐孢洞穴就会遇到锐刺鞭笞者。他不挡路，部分队伍会选择跳过。锐刺鞭笞者是 48 级精英，琥珀岩一侧的第二个 boss。他的刺破造成持续 10 秒的痛苦 DoT，近战范围内还有 AOE顺劈斩——施法职业站在最远距离输出即可安稳击杀。": "Continue down Foulspore Cavern and you'll run into Razorlash. Some groups opt to skip this boss encounter, as it isn't mandatory to kill him to advance forward. Razorlash is a level 48 elite and the second boss found in the Ambershard Side. His Puncture causes a painful DoT (damage over time) tick for 10 seconds, and an AoE Cleave ability for those in melee range. Therefore, casters should stand at max range while burning him down.",
    "竞技场随机会抽到哪个斗士，6个Ring of Law boss打法都在本指南里。": "The Ring of Law arena picks a random combatant - all six strategies are covered here.",
    "等级范围为 40-45 —— 暴雪从最初公布的 40-55 级修正而来。": "The level range is 40-45 — Blizzard corrected it from an initially announced 40-55.",
    "等级范围为 48-53 级，即暴雪公布的范围。": "The level range is 48-53, the range Blizzard gives.",
    "等级范围为 55-60 级，即暴雪公布的范围。": "The level range is 55-60, the range Blizzard gives.",
    "等级范围为 58-60 级，即暴雪公布的范围 —— 属于满级副本。": "The level range is 58-60, the range Blizzard gives — a level-cap dungeon.",
    "经典旧世最大的五人副本：暗铁矮人的都城深处，直抵索瑞森大帝的王座。": "The largest classic dungeon: through the Dark Iron capital to Emperor Dagran Thaurissan.",
    "继续坐这班船到希尔斯布莱德丘陵的南海镇；": "Stay on this boat until it takes you to Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills;",
    "维克图斯是 60 级精英，位于观礼室，相当脆，以火焰系法术为主。小心他的范围技能：别站在火里，很快就能把他打掉。技能：冲击波 烈焰风暴": "Vectus is a level 60 elite located in the Viewing Room. Vectus is a pretty squishy target with fire-based spells. Watch out for his AoE abilities: don't stand in the fire and you'll DPS him down pretty quickly. Abilities: Blast Wave Flamestrike",
    "维利塔恩是 49 级精英，身边跟着两只潜行的腐烂巡影者护卫。全队紧贴坦克叠点，可以让他无法使用自动射击与多重射击；他会用闪现术脱身，他一瞬移就立刻重新叠好。多数队伍先集火机动性强的维利塔恩，再回头清理两只护卫。": "Lord Vyletongue is a level 49 elite accompanied by two stealthed Putridus Shadowstalker guards. If the entire group stacks on Lord Vyletongue, you negate his ability to use Auto Shot & Multi-Shot, so have everyone stack close together on the tank. He'll use Blink to get away, so make sure you are quick to stack up again whenever he does so. Most groups DPS Lord Vyletongue down first since he is mobile and can move around the room. Once he's down, finish off his two guards.",
    "维姆萨拉克是下层的最终boss。坦克开怪时背靠墙、让他面朝远离团队的方向建立初始仇恨。战斗进行到他血量降至50%时会召唤增援。多数队伍会选择控制住增援、以最快速度把维姆萨拉克打掉，之后再回头清理小怪。": "Overlord Wyrmthalak is the final boss of Lower . Tanks, face Overlord Wyrmthalak away from your party, with your back against a wall while generating your initial threat. He will summon adds during the fight when he reaches 50% health. Most groups will opt to CC the adds and burn Overlord Wyrmthalak down as quickly as possible, then move on to the adds once he's down.",
    "绿龙Boss区的小怪刷新快，拖怪时注意别带出第二组。": "Respawns are quick in the dragon areas - avoid pulling extra packs.",
    "缝合憎恶": "Patchwork constructs",
    "缝合憎恶一次只拉一只，开打后房间大门会锁上。": "Pull patchwork constructs one at a time — the room gate locks once combat starts.",
    "耐克鲁姆与暗影祭司塞瑟斯一同在阶梯事件最后一波出现。先集火秒掉耐克鲁姆，再回头处理塞瑟斯；期间安排近战盯住打断他的治疗术，暗影系法术能断则断。": "Nekrum Gutchewer and Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz spawn as the last wave of the stairs event in Zul'Farrak. Burn down Nekrum first; he has fewer abilities and is lower level. In the meantime, keep one of your melee on interrupt duty for Sezz'ziz's heal, and switch to Sezz'ziz once his partner is down.",
    "耐克鲁姆与暗影祭司塞瑟斯是阶梯事件最后一波刷出的精英沙怒巨魔（46 与 47 级）。最佳策略是先集火耐克鲁姆——他技能更少、等级更低，法术被闪避/未命中/抵抗的概率也更小。同时安排一名近战随时打断塞瑟斯的治疗术。": "Nekrum Gutchewer and Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz are level 46 and 47 elite Sandfury Trolls who spawn as the last wave of the stairs event in Zul'Farrak. The best strategy to deal with these two is to burn down Nekrum first. He has fewer abilities and is lower level, meaning less chance to dodge/miss/resist spells. Make sure one of your melee interrupts Sezz'ziz's heal in the meantime.",
    "联盟一般经湿地米奈希尔港坐船到棘齿城，再从棘齿城向东北进入艾萨拉；": "",
    "联盟做暗炉钥匙任务的起点同样在燃烧平原一侧。": "The key quest chain also starts from the Burning Steppes side.",
    "联盟可以从鹰巢山、冰风岗或圣光之愿礼拜堂出发，前往西瘟疫之地凯尔达隆岛。": "Alliance can travel from Aerie Peak, Chillwind Point or Light's Hope Chapel to Caer'Darrow island in Western Plaguelands.",
    "联盟玩家可从尼耶尔前哨站出发向西横穿凄凉之地，抵达长矛谷的巨大石门入口。": "Alliance players can travel from Nijel's Point west across Desolace to the Valley of Spears entrance.",
    "联盟玩家飞往洛克莫丹的塞尔萨玛，向南进入荒芜之地即可抵达副本正门。": "Alliance groups can fly to Thelsamar in Loch Modan and travel south into the Badlands.",
    "肯瑞托死灵法师": "Kirin Tor Necromancers",
    "育龙厅地面全是龙蛋，踩破会孵出小龙，全程贴墙走位。": "Don't crack the eggs in the Rookery - hug the walls to avoid whelp waves.",
    "育龙厅是全本最大的灭团风险点，因为地上布满龙蛋。多数队伍会避开父焰事件，沿西墙绕到俯瞰育龙厅的高台；也有团队选择做这个事件，但难度不小。要开事件，全团贴紧北墙走到尽头，先清掉一些龙蛋会有帮助——不过龙蛋会很快重刷，不少团队因此觉得这是徒劳。先把龙人清理干净，然后点击父焰并拾取物品。事件期间会迎来多波怪物：第一波是育龙厅孵育者，它们会砸蛋，必须第一时间击杀；破壳而出的小龙交给法师和术士处理。第二波是育龙厅守卫，让坦克拉住、背靠东墙，优先级低于孵育者。几分钟后索拉卡登场——这反而是场简单的战斗：坦克把他拉到墙边，团队先清完剩余小龙再集火他，全团保持距离，他有一发能眩晕全团的战争践踏。击杀后全团继续贴墙，沿房间边缘回到高台，小龙刷新就AoE清掉；贴角走位可以避免一次踩破多个龙蛋。": "This room is a major wipe risk because of the eggs on the ground. Most groups avoid the Father Flame event in this room and continue around the West wall to reach the upper landing overlooking The Rookery . However, some groups opt to do the event, which is quite difficult. To start the encounter, reach Father Flame by hugging the Northern wall tightly as a raid and walking down to the far end. It is wise to clear out a few of the eggs before starting the encounter, but be aware that they will respawn fairly quickly. As such, some groups avoid focusing on this because it is seen as a futile effort. Clear out the dragonspawn before beginning the event. Then, click Father Flame and loot the item. During the event, multiple waves of mobs will come at your raid. The first is the Rookery Hatcher. They will break the eggs, so it is critical to kill these mobs immediately. Have your mages and warlocks deal with the released whelps. The second mob type of the Rookery Guardian. Have your tanks grab these mobs and tank them back against the Eastern wall. The targets have lower priority than the Hatchers. After a few minutes, Solakar will come, which is a simple encounter. Have your tank grab Solakar and position him along the wall. Finish off the remaining whelps, and then have your group focus on Solakar. Have your raid stay at range. He has a war stomp, which can stun the whole raid. Once killed, your raid should hug the wall again and work your way back around the edge of the room and up the landing. AoE whelps as they spawn, but it is possible to avoid cracking multiple eggs by hugging the corner. Rage Talon Dragonspawn Fixate Enrage Sunder Armor Rage Talon Flamescale Fireball Volley Fire Nova Flamestrike Rookery Hatcher Heroic Strike Sunder Armor Rookery Guardian Heroic Strike Sunder Armor Rookery Whelp Fireball",
    "育龙厅龙蛋": "Rookery Eggs",
    "背景故事中迪菲亚正在岛上与纳迦交战，副本里盗匪与纳迦两类敌人多半都会出现。": "The lore has the Defias fighting the naga on the island, so both bandits and naga are likely inside.",
    "腐烂的普雷莫尔是可选护送事件的收官 boss。贝尼斯特拉兹开始仪式后，逐个集火刷出的小怪，最好由副坦克把小怪拉离贝尼斯特拉兹。仪式完成后，普雷莫尔就是一场直接的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。": "Plaguemaw the Rotting is the final boss of an optional escort event. When Belnistrasz begins his ritual, focus down mobs that spawn one at a time, preferably with an offtank pulling adds off Belnistrasz. Plaguemaw is a straightforward tank and spank.",
    "艾萨拉大门后方的熊怪城市：居民正与腐化抗争，地道通往兽穴深渊团队副本，55-60 级。": "A furbolg city behind the gate in Azshara, whose people fight corruption and whose tunnels lead toward the Barrow Deeps raid, 55-60.",
    "艾隆纳亚是 40 级巨人。召唤她需要把失落三兄弟身后箱子里的物件与鲁维罗什掉落的另一半组合，再把合成物放进下一房间城市模型状的基座中。她护甲高、血厚、免疫持续伤害（DoT）且会击退玩家。坦克拉住并把她的正面转离队伍，规避圆弧斩；远程散开站位。记住她的技能特点后，这就是一场直接的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。": "Ironaya is a level 40 giant. To summon her, you need to combine the item from the chest behind The Lost Dwarves with a drop from Revelosh, then place the combined item in the model of a city-looking keystone within the next room. She has high armor, lots of HP, is immune to damage-over-time (DoT) effects and can knock players back. Have your tank pick her up and face her away from the rest of the group to avoid her Arcing Smash. Ranged, spread out. Keeping her abilities in mind, it's a fairly straightforward tank & spank type fight.",
    "苍白的玛勒基 在 安娜丝塔丽男爵夫人 北边的路上，地图 17 号位置。他通常会用 寒冰之墓 把坦克困住，持续 6 秒——期间治疗和输出要注意仇恨。这是这场战斗唯一需要操心的机制。杀掉他之后同样清掉他身后满是 图萨丁侍僧 的房间，解锁后面的大门。": "Maleki the Pallid is down the path north of Baroness Anastari, at 17 on the map. He will generally entomb the tank in Ice Tomb, which lasts 6 seconds — during that time healers and DPS should watch their threat. That is the only mechanic worth worrying about. After he dies, clear the room behind him full of Thuzadin Acolyte to unlock a gate later on.",
    "苏斯 是潜伏在厄运之槌西区上层精灵庭院坡道附近的盗贼型白银精英。和 苏斯 战斗就像面对一个盗贼，她的攻击相当疼——确保坦克先建立仇恨再开怪。能驱散就尽快驱散队友身上的 致盲，然后把她集火打掉。": "Tsu'zee is a rogue-type silver elite found near the ramps in the Court of the Highborne, in Dire Maul West. Fighting Tsu'zee is like encountering a rogue, and she hits pretty hard — make sure your tank gains aggro before attacking. Dispel Blind from your party if able, then burn her down.",
    "荆棘谷外海沉没已久的巨魔古城伊拉莱重新浮出海面：巨魔、纳迦与搁浅的海盗船盘踞其中，35-40 级。": "I'lalai, a troll city long under the waves off Stranglethorn, risen again: trolls, naga and a wrecked pirate ship, 35-40.",
    "荒野萨特与恶魔": "Satyrs & Demons",
    "莱斯·霜语是 60 级精英，位于穿过观礼室的走廊尽头。开怪前把他周围整个区域清干净。他有多个冰霜系法术。坦克背对人群，留意他的恐惧术，安排好打断链，尽量少让他读条。技能：冰冻新星 霜甲术 恐惧术 冰冻术 连发寒冰箭": "Ras Frostwhisper is a level 60 elite located along the passage through the Viewing Room. Make sure the entire area surrounding Ras Frostwhisper is clear before engaging. He has several frost-type magic spells and abilities. Tank, face him away from the group, watch out for his Fear and plan an interrupt rotation to minimize his spell casting. Abilities: Chill Nova Frost Armor Fear Freeze Frostbolt Volley",
    "蕾瑟塔蒂丝有一大堆奥术系法术。她的虚空箭是4秒施法，应当打断——其余看到读条的技能也尽量打断。她会给人上好几层诅咒，队里有能解诅咒的职业记得及时驱散。她的小鬼匹姆吉布也会施放各种火焰法术，血量只有本体的三分之一左右，先集火杀掉小鬼，再转火蕾瑟塔蒂丝。": "Lethtendris has a plethora of -related spells. Her Void Bolt is a 4-second cast and should be interrupted, as should most of the spells you see casting. She afflicts a couple of curses, so if you have a or , be sure to have them decurse the group. Her imp, Pimgib also casts a variety of fires pells. He has about 1/3 of her HP, so focus down the imp first then move on to Lethtendris.",
    "虽然被视为最终 boss，多数队伍的顺序是先打兰斯利德（兰斯利德），再回头处理公主，最后跳下去解决洛特格里普与工匠吉兹洛克。遭遇公主前还要再战两两成组的原始巨兽，一次集火一只。瑟莱德丝公主是毒瀑的 51 级精英，这场战斗不易，理解机制是关键：在洞穴深处开怪，留出走位空间。她的群体恐惧憎恨怒视非常致命，防护恐惧结界、狂暴之怒、战栗图腾都是应对恐惧的手段；群体击退灰尘力场附带伤害，远程保持最远距离即可规避。注意洞穴周围的中性乌龟——被打到法术会转火，留意四周。": "Although considered the final boss, most groups will head to Princess Theradras after killing Landslide, and then jump down to kill Rotgrip and Tinkerer Gizlock after. You'll fight more groups of Primordial Behemoth before encountering Princess Theradras, this time in packs of 2 — focus down one at a time. Princess Theradras is a level 51 elite found in Poison Falls. She is not an easy fight, so understanding her mechanics is vital. Groups tend to engage her towards the back of her cavern to allow for more space. She has a group of Fear called Repulsive Gaze; Fear Ward, Berserker Rage & Tremor Totem are all spells to help with this effect. She also has a pesky group knockback ability, Dust Field, which not only pushes you back but damages as well — at max range, non-melee players should be able to avoid this. Also, be aware that there are non-aggressive turtles in the area around her cavern: if they get hit with a spell, they will aggro on you, so be mindful of your surroundings.",
    "蜘蛛房全清": "Clear the spider rooms",
    "蝙蝠洞的稀有怪盲眼猎手掉落优秀，猎人还能把它驯服成宠物，别错过。": "Don't skip the Blind Hunter rare in the Bat Cave — great loot, and Hunters can tame it as a pet.",
    "血法师萨尔诺斯以法术为主，这是一场法术伤害很重的战斗。他会在自己身边施放多个范围法术，远程注意保持距离，治疗要盯紧坦克和近战的血线。技能：暗影箭 烈焰尖刺 火焰新星": "Bloodmage Thalnos mostly casts spells, so it will be a heavy magic damage fight. He casts several AoE magic abilities in his close proximity, so ranged should keep their distance and healers should keep a close eye on the tank and melee. Abilities: Shadow Bolt Flame Spike Fire Nova",
    "血色修道院四个区中最轻松的一个，遍地成群的不死生物，26-36 级来刷正合适。": "The easiest of Scarlet Monastery's four wings, full of mindless undead packs — recommended for levels 26-36.",
    "血色修道院最终也是最难的一个区，35-45 级推荐，莫格莱尼与怀特迈恩的双首领战就在这里。": "The final and toughest wing of Scarlet Monastery, recommended for levels 35-45 — home to the Mograine & Whitemane encounter.",
    "血色修道院第二个区，29-39 级推荐；杀掉奥法师杜安还能拿到进军械库和教堂的血色钥匙。": "The second wing of Scarlet Monastery, recommended for levels 29-39; Arcanist Doan drops the Scarlet Key to the Armory and Cathedral.",
    "血骨傀儡是 61 级精英，位于大骨堆的地下室。清完周围再开怪。他的技能以近战为主，打得非常痛！远程尽量站远，坦克把他背对人群。破甲类技能如破甲攻击、破甲能帮全队更快放倒他。技能：击退 打击 战争践踏 破甲攻击 破甲": "Rattlegore is a level 61 elite located in the Great Ossuary's Basement. Pull Rattlegore once your surrounding area is clear. His abilities are melee focused, and he hits like a truck! Ranged, keep back as far as possible. Tank, face Rattlegore away from the group. Armor reducing abilities such as Sunder Armor or Expose Armor can help your team take him down quicker. Abilities: Knock Away Strike War Stomp Sunder Armor Expose Armor",
    "街道上围绕邪能古树的邪能古树群。把 boss 拉离它们，或先把这群树怪清完再开 boss。": "Fel-touched treants standing around the Fel Ancient in the streets. Pull the boss away from them or clear the pack first.",
    "街道上肯瑞托法师与奥术傀儡密度很高；演示中甚至从 trash 里拉出过一只 27 级的法力幽灵。贴墙拉怪，留意巡逻。": "The streets are dense with Kirin Tor mages and arcane golems; a level 27 Mana Wraith was even pulled with the trash during the demo. Pull around corners and watch for patrols.",
    "街面巡逻": "Street patrols",
    "被无视的琳的机制目前尚无公开资料，beta 等级上限提升后会补充。": "Lyn the Ignored's mechanics are currently unknown and will be updated once we have enough information from the beta following the raised level cap.",
    "被诅咒的塞雷布拉斯是毒瀑尽头的 49 级精英，战斗中会不断召唤非精英的腐化的自然之力。他最常施放的愤怒可以打断，安排好打断轮次；召唤物死一只他会再补一只。先集火塞雷布拉斯本体，再清掉剩余的召唤物。": "Celebras the Cursed is a level 49 elite found at the end of Poison Falls. He summons non-elite Corrupt Force of Nature to constantly spawn during the encounter. He will most often use his Wrath spell, which can be interrupted, so make sure it's getting interrupted as often as possible. If one of his Corrupt Force of Nature falls, he will summon another one. Focus down Celebras the Cursed first, then polish off the remaining Corrupt Force of Nature.",
    "西区（厄运之槌西）的入口位于营地西侧的花园废墟处": "The Dire Maul West entrance lies among the ruined gardens on the west side of the compound",
    "西瘟疫之地凯尔达隆岛上的亡灵魔法学校，55-60 级五人本，六个房间各有一位首领，最终面对黑暗院长加丁。": "A school of necromancy on Caer'Darrow island in Western Plaguelands — a level 55-60 dungeon with a boss in each of six rooms, ending with Darkmaster Gandling.",
    "观察者克鲁什 是 戈多克大王 的施法者随从。普通打法先集火秒掉他——他会辅助 戈多克大王，注意打断他的施法。打贡品跑法时必须让他活下来：戈多克大王 死后 观察者克鲁什 会变成友好状态并停止攻击。": "Cho'Rush the Observer is King Gordok's caster attendant. In a normal run, burn him down first — he supports King Gordok, so keep his casting interrupted. On a tribute run he must survive: once King Gordok falls, Cho'Rush the Observer becomes friendly and stops attacking.",
    "詹迪斯·巴罗夫是 61 级精英，用南墙上的火把召唤出来。她会制造出多个分身散布在房间里，分身无法用范围技能一起清掉，必须逐个点杀。有些队伍选择无视分身，直接集火詹迪斯本体。记得让有驱散能力的队友解掉她的血之诅咒。技能：血之诅咒 放逐术": "Jandice Barov is a level 61 elite who is found by using a torch on the south wall. Jandice Barov will create several copies of herself that spread throughout the room. You can't AoE them down, so you must target them down individually. Some parties opt to ignore the adds and just focus down Jandice herself. Remember to have someone dispel her Curse of Blood. Abilities: Curse of Blood Banish",
    "讲师玛丽希亚是 60 级精英，位于上层南边的房间。她有几个治疗技能，务必安排好打断链，减少她的施法。让有驱散能力的队友解掉她的诅咒火焰的召唤，然后把她打掉。技能：火焰的召唤 腐蚀术 治疗术 恢复 减速术": "Instructor Malicia is a level 60 elite located in the southern room on the upper floor. Instructor Malicia has a few heals at her disposal, so be sure to sort out an interrupt rotation to minimize her casting. Have someone dispel her Call of the Grave curse and DPS her down. Abilities: Call of the Grave Corruption Heal Renew Slow",
    "诺克赛恩是 48 级精英，琥珀岩一侧（紫门）的第一个 boss。他拥有 AOE 技能毒性箭雨和击退上钩拳。战斗中他会分裂成多个小型副本体，全部消灭后才会重新合体继续战斗。可以把他从水池里拉出来打，方便清理小分身。": "Noxxion is a level 48 elite and the first boss found in the Ambershard Side. He has an AoE Toxic Volley ability as well as a knockback called Uppercut. After a little while, Noxxion will split into smaller versions of himself. Once they're all defeated, Noxxion will reform, and the fight will continue. Some groups opt to pull him out of the pool, to make killing the adds easier.",
    "诺特·希姆加克": "Knot Thimblejack",
    "贝尔加是可选boss，多数队伍因为他不影响副本推进而直接跳过。他会召唤需要击杀的增援；坦克要把贝尔加的面朝向拉离团队，这样熔岩喷溅就构不成威胁。除了坦克承伤偏高之外，这场战斗相当轻松。": "Bael'Gar is an optional boss that most groups skip because he is not important to the advancement of the dungeon. Bael'Gar spawns adds, which needs to be kill. Also, tanks need to face Bael'Gar away from the group Magma Splash is not a major concern if that is done. Outside of the tank taking a lot of damage, this fight is fairly easy.",
    "贡品跑法中观察者克鲁什必须存活，戈多克大王死后他会变为友好。": "On a tribute run Cho'Rush must survive — he turns friendly once King Gordok dies.",
    "贡品跑法依赖潜行、开锁与陷阱配合，跳过的首领越多，最后的贡品越丰厚。": "The tribute run relies on stealth, lockpicking and traps — the more bosses you skip, the better the tribute.",
    "赫尔努拉斯 是厄运之槌西区的特殊 boss，只有持有术士史诗坐骑任务线三件召唤物品的术士才能召唤。仪式在 伊莫塔尔 被击败后于其原本所在的祭坛举行。团队要顶住一波又一波的恶魔进攻，同时术士需维持三件仪式物品的效力；召唤完成后 赫尔努拉斯 本体反而只是常规战斗。": "Lord Hel'nurath is a special boss in Dire Maul West that can only be summoned by warlocks carrying the three summoning items from their epic mount quest line. The ritual takes place at the altar where Immol'thar originally stood, after that boss is dead. The group must survive many waves of demons while the warlock keeps all three ritual items active; Lord Hel'nurath himself is then a straightforward kill.",
    "走廊里有不少巡逻队，开怪前留意移动的怪堆。": "There are quite a few patrols — watch out for packs moving around the halls before you pull.",
    "践踏者克雷格 &lt;醉鬼&gt; 是沿着北坡一路跳舞的醉醺醺的食人魔厨师，想不看见都难。他的 喷酒 会波及全队，让所有人喝醉并降低 75% 的命中几率；除此之外就是常规的坦克拉住、输出打木桩的近战战斗。打贡品跑法时不要杀他——等他睡着后从旁边潜行绕过。": "Stomper Kreeg is the drunken ogre chef dancing along the northern ramp — hard to miss. His Booze Spit hits the whole party, getting everyone drunk and reducing their chance to hit by 75%. Other than that it is a straightforward tank-and-spank melee fight. On a tribute run, do not kill him — wait for him to fall asleep and sneak past.",
    "踩破龙蛋会孵出小龙并可能连锁引爆，非事件期间一律贴墙绕行。": "Cracked eggs spawn whelp waves - hug the walls unless doing the Father Flame event.",
    "达拉然位于奥特兰克山脉，城门入口钉点约在奥特兰克山脉地图的 8.0, 61.2。部落最快路线：从幽暗城出发穿过银松森林，从银松海岸游泳渡海，在洛丹伦废墟（The Sepulcher）登陆后步行几分钟即达。进城后走城内的特殊隧道 —— 大法师莫德拉的影像会为部落开放通路；开启闸门需要队伍中至少一人持有「达拉然下水道钥匙」。": "Dalaran sits in the Alterac Mountains; the city-gate pin is at about 8.0, 61.2 on the Alterac map. Fastest Horde route: run from Undercity through Silverpine Forest, swim across from the Silverpine coast and land at The Sepulcher in the Ruins of Lordaeron, then walk a few minutes. Inside the city, take the special tunnel — the Image of Archmage Modera grants Horde access; opening the gate requires at least one player with a Dalaran Sewer Key.",
    "这个房间的流程很直接：点击祭坛激怒所有黑手囚禁者，解除对烈焰卫士的束缚，随后击杀艾博希尔，打通进入育龙厅的道路。开怪方式是点击黑石祭坛。囚禁者血量很低，法师和术士AoE清掉就行。对付艾博希尔，坦克要让他远离人群站位，避免多人同时被火焰新星打中。除此之外这场战斗相当轻松，boss很快就会倒下。": "This room is straightforward. Click the Altar to aggro all of the Incarcerators to release the bind on Pyroguard Emberseer . Once released, kill Pyroguard to advance into The Rookery. Click the Blackrock Altar to start the fight. The Incarcerators have low health, so killing them is quite easy. Just AoE them down with mages and locks. As for Pyroguard, tanks should keep him away from the group to avoid multiple people getting hit with the fire nova. Outside of that, this fight is quite easy. Boss should die fairly quickly.",
    "这个房间的流程很直接：这里的boss是古拉鲁克，可选boss杰德也可能同在场。清完所有小怪后把古拉鲁克和（如果在的）杰德杀掉即可；有的队伍会整间跳过，因为两个都是可选boss。战斗本身是场基础遭遇：坦克把他拉在墙边、远离团队。": "This room is straightforward. The boss in this room is Goraluk Anvilcrack, but the optional boss Jed Runewatcher might also present within the Hall. Clear all the mobs then kill Goraluk Anvilcrack and Jed if present. Some groups skip this room as both are optional bosses. This fight is a basic encounter. Tank him against the wall apart from your group. Backhand Head Crack Heroic Strike",
    "这场战斗最关键的是拉戈斯诺特的统御意志（精神控制）。一旦坦克或治疗被控，混合职业要立刻补位顶上。打断他的治疗术避免战斗拖长，打断暗影箭减少团队承伤。": "Ragglesnout's Dominate Mind is by far the most important ability in this encounter. If your tank or healer get MCed, make sure to have your hybrids fill in where needed. Interrupt his heal to prevent a longer encounter and his Shadow Bolts to minimize incoming damage.",
    "这是BRD的最终首领战。团队有两种选择：救下铁炉堡公主茉艾拉·铜须 &lt;铁炉堡公主&gt;只杀达格兰·索瑞森大帝，或者两个都杀。多数队伍第一次会选择救铁炉堡公主茉艾拉·铜须 &lt;铁炉堡公主&gt;来完成任务，之后每次再来都会把她杀掉，因为她的掉落相当不错。": "This is the final boss encounter within BRD. Groups can proceed in one of two directions. Either they can choose to save Princess Moira Bronzebeard and kill Emperor Dagran Thaurissan, or they can choose to kill both. Most groups will save Princess Moira Bronzebeard to complete the quest and then kill her each time afterwards because she had good drops.",
    "这是一座巨型户外地下城：食人魔劫掠周边村庄并掳走居民，攻略体验更接近野外拉怪而非走廊推进。": "This is a huge outdoor dungeon: its ogres raid nearby villages and carry off inhabitants, so expect open-world style pulls rather than corridors.",
    "这是一座正与腐化抗争的熊怪城市，副本中预计以被腐化的熊怪为主。": "It is a furbolg city whose people are fighting corruption — expect corrupted furbolg throughout.",
    "这是上层黑石塔的最后一个房间，最终boss达基萨斯将军就驻守于此，房内还有一些巡逻和站位怪。杀掉将军即完成本副本。最常见的打法是风筝法（有猎人的队伍基本都用），比另一种方法简单得多：猎人把将军拉开，一路风筝回比斯巨兽的房间，然后假死把将军交还给团队；与此同时每名坦克各接一个多彩精英卫士并集火杀掉，主坦克再去接手将军，面朝拉离团队防住火焰吐息。抛开卫士不论，将军本体并不难，这就是团队偏爱这个方法的原因。第二种打法类似但不风筝：在初始位置同时坦克住增援和将军，目标是尽快AoE劈死多彩精英卫士；术士可以链式恐惧一个卫士来减轻治疗压力。低装备水平下这个方法明显更难，因为卫士和将军的叠加输出很高。卫士清完之后，和风筝法一样，将军本体相当轻松。": "This is the final room within Upper Blackrock Spire . General Drakkisath , the final boss, is located here. There are a few patrols within this room as well as stationed mobs. Kill General Drakkisath to complete the raid. Cleave Conflagration Flame Breath Thunderclap General Drakkisath is the most difficult by far. The most common approach is the kite method, which many groups with hunters will use. It is significantly easier than the other method. In the kiting method, the hunter will pull General Drakkisath and kite him back through into the Beast’s room. Once there, the Hunter with feign death returning Drakkisath to the raid. While this is going on, each tank will grab a Chromatic Elite Guard and burn it down. The MT will then be prepared to grab General Drakkisath . Face him away from the raid to account for the flame breath. General Drakkisath is easy on his own apart from the guards, which is why this method is favored amongst raid groups. The second strategy is similar, but without the kite. Your group can tank both the adds and General Drakkisath at the starting position. The goal is to AoE Cleave the Chromatic Elite Guards down quickly. A possible assist here is to chain fear one of the guards with a warlock, which lessens the healing burden. Either way, this method is significantly harder at lower gear levels because of the damage output between the guards and General Drakkisath . Once the guards are dead, just as with the kiting method, General Drakkisath is fairly easy on his own.",
    "这是另一场相当轻松的战斗：对抗7波矮人英灵的多阶段遭遇。每个英灵对应一个职业（例如牧师、术士、盗贼），但没必要为每个职业单独准备策略，他们都很好杀。唯一要担心的是打得太慢——他们按固定时间依次放出，可能你还没杀完当前目标，下一个就已经出场了。除了快速逐个击杀之外没有别的策略，他们只会施放本体职业的一两个弱化版技能，尽量别让自己同时面对两三个。七位矮人分别是：Hate'rel、Anger'rel、Vile'rel、Gloom'rel、Seeth'rel、Doom'rel、Dope'rel。": "is another fairly easy fight. This is a multistage encounter against 7 waves of dwarven spirits. Each spirit reflects a particular class (e.g., priest, warlock, and rogue); however, it isn't worth offering unique strategy for each. They are all quite easy to kill. The only concern is killing them too slowly, which might mean you get an additional dwarf before you've completely killed the one you're focusing as they are released on a set timer. No real strategy other than killing each quickly. They will possess one or two abilities of their specific class, but in a weakened state. Try to kill them quickly to avoid fighting two or more at a time. The names of the seven dwarves are: Hate'rel Anger'rel Vile'rel Gloom'rel Seeth'rel Doom'rel Dope'rel",
    "进入上层需要晋升印章（黑石塔下层任务链获得），队里一人持有即可开门。": "UBRS requires the Seal of Ascension from an LBRS quest chain - one per group is enough.",
    "进入厄运之槌营地后，穿过中央竞技场内场，北区的入口就在内场西侧的食人魔营地。": "Enter the Dire Maul compound, pass through the central arena interior — the Dire Maul North entrance is on the western side of the arena.",
    "进入厄运之槌营地后，绕到营地西侧，西区（精灵废墟）的入口就在西侧的花园废墟处。": "Enter the Dire Maul compound and circle around to the western side — the Dire Maul West entrance sits among the ruined gardens on the west.",
    "进入黑石塔，穿过后层走廊，由持有晋升印章的队友开门进入上层。": "Enter Upper Blackrock Spire through the Seal of Ascension door in LBRS.",
    "进入黑石山，沿内部环桥走到中央下层平台进入副本。": "Enter Blackrock Mountain and take the inner ring down to the central platform entrance.",
    "进入黑石山，沿环桥走到上层平台的黑石塔入口进入。": "Enter Blackrock Mountain and take the upper platform entrance.",
    "进城后从街面的格栅下到下水道，穿过地下腹地（Underbelly）；": "Inside the city, drop through a street grate into the sewers and cross the Underbelly;",
    "进门后沿主街推进，依次经过市集区与血色区": "Push up the main street through Market Row toward the Scarlet bastion",
    "邪能古树的机制目前尚无公开资料，beta 等级上限提升后会补充。注意：它被一道法力屏障保护着 —— 只有先打掉周围的 boss、打破屏障后才会解锁。": "Fel Ancient's mechanics are currently unknown and will be updated once we have enough information from the beta following the raised level cap. Note: Fel Ancient is only unlocked once surrounding bosses are defeated and the mana barrier protecting him is broken.",
    "邪能古树群": "Suffused Treants",
    "邮箱与钥匙": "Mailboxes and keys",
    "部落在圣光之愿礼拜堂或塔伦米尔集合前往西瘟疫之地；副本入口在凯尔达隆岛学院后门的铁闸门后。": "Horde players can travel from Light's Hope Chapel or Tarren Mill to Western Plaguelands; the instance entrance is behind a locked gate at the back of the Scholomance building on Caer'Darrow island.",
    "部落方任务，需要57级。从药剂师金格 &lt;皇家药剂师学会&gt;处接取后，他会让你去找卡加斯的暗法师薇薇安·拉格雷 &lt;卡加斯远征军&gt;；后续要求你带回一件物品——它就在上层黑石塔的育龙厅里，满地龙蛋中间（也就是著名的“李罗伊，上路！”那间房）。": "Faction: Horde Level Required: 57 Rewards: or 8,300 experience reputation with - begins with Apothecary Zinge in , who gives you : Apothecary Zinge She asks you to find Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave, in Kargath, : Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave will follow up with, , asking you to bring him . This is found inside Upper , inside The Rookery, with all of the eggs. (the Leeroy Jenkins room)",
    "部落玩家前往贫瘠之地南部，在抵达大升降梯之前向东走，即可到达剃刀高地入口。": "Horde players can travel to the southern part of the Barrens and head east before reaching the Great Lift to find the entrance.",
    "部落玩家向东南穿过千针石林抵达闪光平原，继续南下进入塔纳利斯即可到达；记得在自由风营地（千针石林）和加基森（塔纳利斯）开鸟点。": "Horde players can travel southeast through Thousand Needles to the Shimmering Flats, then continue south into Tanaris; pick up the flight paths at Freewind Post and Gadgetzan along the way.",
    "部落玩家直接前往贫瘠之地南部，在抵达大升降梯之前向西走，即可到达剃刀沼泽入口。": "Horde players can simply travel to the southern part of the Barrens and head west before reaching the Great Lift to find the entrance.",
    "部落玩家飞往荒芜之地的卡加斯，直接跑到副本正门；若未开通卡加斯鸟点，可先到阿拉希高地的落锤镇，向南穿过洛克莫丹进入荒芜之地。后门入口在尘风峡谷的隧道中（哈默霍挖掘场以东、莱瑟罗峡谷西北），可直达副本后半段。": "Horde groups can fly to Kargath in the Badlands and run to the entrance; without the Kargath flight path, head to Hammerfall in Arathi and travel south through Loch Modan into the Badlands. A back-door tunnel in Dustwind Gulch (east of Hammertoe's Digsite) leads directly into the back of the instance.",
    "重建后穹顶消失的达拉然城：从下水道潜入这座魔法之都，直面失控的奥术构造体与肆虐的邪能，共 9 个 boss。": "Dalaran rebuilt and dome-free, entered through its sewers: arcane constructs gone haywire and fel energy rampant, 9 bosses.",
    "重返被瘟疫吞噬的斯坦索姆，在血色十字军的最后据点里揭开巴纳扎尔的真面目。": "Return to plague-stricken Stratholme and unmask Balnazzar within the Crusade's last stronghold.",
    "铁脊死灵就是一场简单的坦克拉住、输出打木桩。他施放毒云术时治疗要盯紧全队血线，这一下的伤害不低。技能：虚弱诅咒 毒云术": "Ironspine is a simple tank and spank encounter. Healers, keep an eye on your party's health when Ironspine casts Poison Cloud, as it can deal quite a bit of damage. Abilities: Curse of Weakness Poison Cloud",
    "队伍里最好有一名 300 开锁的盗贼或一名工程师，内门需要他们打开。": "Bring a rogue with 300 lockpicking or an engineer — the inner door requires one of them.",
    "队伍里最好有能驱散诅咒的职业——多个首领战都吃驱散，特别是巴罗夫夫妇。": "Bring someone who can dispel curses — several boss fights rely on it, especially the Barov couple.",
    "阶梯事件": "The Stairs Event",
    "阶梯事件逐波清怪、控制节奏，最后一波集火耐克鲁姆并打断塞瑟斯的治疗。": "Clear the stairs event wave by wave; on the last wave burn Nekrum down and interrupt Sezz'ziz's heals.",
    "阿努希尔的难度仅次于破坏者奥科索尔。语言诅咒和包围之网都必须第一时间驱散，这两个才是真正的难点，其余机制并不棘手——除了驱散之外不需要什么特别的策略。": "Anub'shiah is almost as difficult as Ok'thor the Breaker. Curse of Tongues and Enveloping Web both need an immediate dispel. These are the difficult mechanics. The rest aren't too tricky. No real strategy needed other than the dispels.",
    "阿塔莱祭司": "Atal'ai Priests",
    "阿塔莱祭司会治疗同伴，优先打断或击杀，否则小怪战会拖得很长。": "Atal'ai priests heal their allies - interrupt or kill them first.",
    "阿扎达斯会持续召唤小怪，全队集火清理；20% 血量出现的 4 只精英会随他一起死亡。": "Archaedas summons constant non-elite adds — AoE them down; the 4 elite adds at 20% die with him.",
    "阿扎达斯血量极高，战斗全程不断召唤非精英小怪，全队要尽快集火清理；血量 20% 时他会召唤 4 只精英增援——它们会随他的死亡而消失，此时多数队伍选择全力爆发抢血。这是一场持久战，需要全队倾尽全力：药水、绷带、冷却技能，有什么用什么！": "Archaedas has a lot of HP and summons non-elite adds throughout the encounter. Make sure your group burns the adds down as quickly as possible. At 20%, he will summon 4 elite adds, who die when he dies. At this point in the fight, many groups opt to burn Archaedas down as quickly as possible. This is a long fight and will require the entire group to perform in order to defeat. Remember to use potions, bandages, cooldowns, and everything you've got!",
    "阿格姆是一场简单的坦克拉住、输出打木桩，但他会召唤野猪守卫助战。野猪一出现就优先集火杀掉，再转回阿格姆本体。": "Aggem Thorncurse is a simple tank and spank with the ability to summon a boar guardian to aide him in battle. When he summons the boar, prioritize it and kill it before switching back to Aggem.",
    "阿特雷克西斯在副本很靠前的位置就能遇到，是场非常简单的坦克拉住打的木桩战。他的主要机制是召唤骷髅 —— 非精英怪，需要及时清掉。整场战斗没有时间敏感的机制，唯一会出事的方式是坦克还没建立仇恨就放开大范围 AOE，注意这点即可。boss 会周期性狂暴，但不影响打法思路。BlizzCon 试玩里他还会缴械当前目标 —— 坦克被缴械期间注意自保减伤；试玩中有人看到他掉落一把弩「Gravespike Repeater」。": "You will encounter Atrexis very early in the dungeon, and as a consequence he is a very easy tank-and-spank style boss. His primary mechanic is summoning Skeletons, non-elite mobs that need to be killed. They don't have any time-sensitive mechanics, and the only way you die during this encounter is if you use heavy AOE before the tank has established threat, so be careful. The boss will also periodically enrage, but it doesn't change how you approach the fight. In the BlizzCon playtest he also disarmed his current target — tanks should mind their cooldowns and mitigation while disarmed; he was seen dropping a crossbow, 'Gravespike Repeater'.",
    "阿雷克斯·巴罗夫是 60 级精英，位于下层东边（巴罗夫家族墓窖），算得上通灵学院最难打的 boss 之一。他身边有两名骷髅护卫，打人很痛，但可以用束缚亡灵或超度亡灵之类控制。他所在房间的地上有绿色毒液，千万别踩。他的范围光环邪恶光环会对范围内所有人持续造成伤害，坦克必须把阿雷克斯·巴罗夫拉到最远距离，别让光环波及全队。他的暗影迷雾若不驱散会非常麻烦——解不了诅咒的话，治疗要全力保持坦克满血，因为这个诅咒生效的 15 秒里坦克几乎刷不上血。技能：献祭 邪恶光环 暗影迷雾 束缚亡灵 超度亡灵": "Lord Alexei Barov is a level 60 elite located in the eastern portion of the lower level (The Barov Family Vault) and is considered one of the toughest bosses in Scholomance. Two skeletal bodyguards accompany him; they hit pretty hard but can be CC'd with Shackle Undead or Turn Undead. The room he's in has toxic green liquid on the floor that you must not stand in. His AoE aura Unholy Aura constantly ticks damage to anyone in range, so tanks must pull Alexei back at max range so the aura doesn't afflict the rest of the group. His Veil of Shadow can be very hard on the group if not cleansed: if you can't cleanse the curse, healers, keep the tank topped off as best you can — when Veil of Shadow strikes, you'll have a lot of difficulty healing your tank for 15 seconds. Abilities: Immolate Unholy Aura Veil of Shadow Shackle Undead Turn Undead",
    "附魔师安娜拉在副本内教授大师级附魔，练附魔的玩家带足材料再来。": "Annora trains Artisan Enchanting inside the dungeon; enchanters should come stocked with reagents.",
    "隐形古树": "Invisible ancients",
    "难度不高。他趴在地上，开怪后才会起身。他会给一名队员施放可以驱散的血之诅咒。还要小心他对队员施放恐惧术和催眠术，以及给自己上的真言术：盾。打断他的治疗术，这场战斗就稳了。技能：血之诅咒 治疗术 真言术：盾 催眠术": "Not a particularly challenging fight; he is found lying on the ground until you engage him. He casts Curse of Blood on a party member that can be dispelled. Watch out for him also casting Fear and Sleep on party members, as well as Power Word: Shield on himself. Interrupt his Heal and you've got him. Abilities: Curse of Blood Heal Power Word: Shield Sleep",
    "集齐失落三兄弟身后箱子的物件与鲁维罗什掉落的另一半，可召唤艾隆纳亚并开启隐藏密室。": "Combine the item from the chest behind The Lost Dwarves with Revelosh's drop to summon Ironaya and unlock the hidden chamber.",
    "雷德的挑战波次开打前吃好喝好补好buff，战斗中途没有恢复窗口。": "Buff and consume up before the Rend gauntlet - there's no break mid-fight.",
    "非精英怪，会读条施放非常难受的法力燃烧，务必打断 —— 集火快速清掉。": "Non-elite mobs that cast a very nasty Mana Burn which should be interrupted. They should be focused down quickly.",
    "预言者迦玛兰倒下后，双头龙德拉维沃尔与德姆塞卡尔会在牺牲之坑现身。这两条龙比较好打：坦克背靠墙把它们拉住，龙头始终不要朝着团队，避免全队吃到正面锥形吐息和击退技能。": "After Jammal'an the Prophet has fallen, the two drakes Weaver & Dreamscythe will spawn in the Pit of Sacrifice . They’re relatively easy to burn down. Tanks should tank with their backs to a wall, keeping the drakes facing away from the party to avoid their frontal cone and knockback abilities.",
    "饱和残余": "Saturated Remnant",
    "马杜克·布莱克波尔是 58 级精英，位于观礼室。坦克把他定在原地，远程站远，避免吃到他的污染光环。近战注意他的暗影之盾——激活期间你每次攻击他都会受到反伤。除此之外他就是个软柿子。技能：顺劈斩 污染光环 暗影之盾": "Marduk Blackpool is a level 58 elite located in the Viewing Room. Tanks should hold Marduk Blackpool in place while ranged stand back, ensuring they are not affected by his Defiling Aura. Melee, watch out for his Shadow Shield — it deals damage each time you attack him as long as it's active. Other than those two factors, he's pretty easy to burn down. Abilities: Cleave Defiling Aura Shadow Shield",
    "驯犬者格雷布玛尔又是一场轻松的战斗，只要按照他的巡逻路线来安排就不会出问题。他在两组犬类小怪之间来回巡逻：先杀他巡逻方向反侧的那一组，等他走回去再杀另一组，两组清完就可以单独开boss了。": "Houndmaster Grebmar is another fairly easy boss fight. He shouldn't cause issues as long as he is handled appropriate to his patrol path. Houndmaster Grebmar pats around the room between two packs of hounds. Kill the pack of hounds opposite of his patrol path. Then, when he pats back, kill the other pack. Once both packs are dead.",
    "驯犬者洛克希是这个区遇到的第一个首领，身边带着 3 只精英血色捕猎犬。猎犬可以用一切对野兽有效的控制技能控制，比如变形术。常规打法：控制住一只猎犬，坦克拉住驯犬者洛克希，输出先把猎犬清掉，再回头集火驯犬者洛克希。注意他血量低的时候会嗜血术。技能：剑类武器入门 战斗怒吼 嗜血术": "Houndmaster Loksey, the first boss you'll encounter, is accompanied by 3 elite Scarlet Tracking Hound. The hounds can be crowd controlled with anything that works on beasts, such as Polymorph. A general strategy: crowd control one of the hounds, have the tank keep Houndmaster Loksey busy while the DPS kill the hounds, then focus down Houndmaster Loksey. Be aware that he will Bloodlust at low health. Abilities: Sword Finesse Battle Shout Bloodlust",
    "魔导师商贸区一带的附魔法典，接近不稳定的哨兵时会从建筑里刷出。开怪前先清掉或控制住 —— 它们数量不少。": "Enchanted books around the Magus Commerce Exchange that spawn from the buildings as you approach the Unstable Sentinel. Clear them before the pull or keep them controlled — they add up fast.",
    "鲁古格是可选目标，与萨满和战士的专属职业任务相关。鲁古格本身很简单，唯一的变数是周围的小怪：开打前务必清场，能控制的目标尽量先控住。如果队里有术士，记得对旁边的元素怪使用放逐术，减轻坦克的承伤压力。": "Roogug is optional and tied to the Shaman- and Warrior-exclusive class quests. Roogug is a simple encounter with one notable exception: the surrounding mobs. Before engaging Roogug, make sure to clear the area and CC whatever mobs you can prior to engagement. If you have a Warlock with Banish, make sure to use it on the elemental at his side to reduce incoming damage onto the tank.",
    "鲁维罗什是 40 级精英穴居人，与两只石窟嚼石者联动，开怪时会一起参战。能控的话先控制一只石窟嚼石者；否则尽快集火秒掉鲁维罗什。他的闪电链伤害很高，他一读条就要优先打断。": "Revelosh is a level 40 elite trogg. Revelosh is linked with two Stonevault Rockchewer, so when you pull him, they will also join the battle. You could try to CC one of the Stonevault Rockchewer if you've got it. Otherwise, try to burn down Revelosh as quickly as possible. His Chain Lightning can deal a lot of damage to your party, so take priority in interrupting whenever he gets ready to cast it.",
    "黑手大厅守军": "Hall of Blackhand Garrisons",
    "黑暗院长加丁是 61 级精英，位于巴罗夫家族墓窖中央，杀掉前面六个首领之后才会出现——所以打完别站在场地中央，防止提前引到。多数坦克会把黑暗院长加丁坦在他出现的中央位置，远程站在楼梯上保持距离。他会周期性把一名玩家传送到隔壁房间，里面的门会锁住，杀光里面的怪才能出来——坦克或治疗被传走时要提前想好预案。他施放奥术飞弹时按好打断顺序效果很好。中了强化暗影箭要尽快驱散。除此之外他血量很厚，正确执行机制就能拿下！技能：奥术飞弹 黑暗主宰诅咒 暗影之盾 强化暗影箭": "Darkmaster Gandling is a level 61 elite located in the center of The Barov Family Vault, and spawns once you kill the last of the previous six bosses — so don't stand in the center and prematurely aggro him. Many tanks keep Darkmaster Gandling in the center where he spawns while the ranged stay atop the stairs. He'll periodically teleport a player to an adjacent room, where they are locked in until they defeat the enemies inside — be prepared in case your tank or healer gets teleported. An interrupt order works nicely for Arcane Missiles. Have someone dispel Improved Shadow Bolt - Spell - Classic World of Warcraft as quickly as possible. Other than that, he has a lot of HP, so execute the mechanics properly and you'll be rewarded! Abilities: Arcane Missiles Curse of the Darkmaster Shadow Shield Improved Shadow Bolt - Spell - Classic World of Warcraft",
    "黑曜石哨兵是后门附近的 44 级精英傀儡，护甲高、血厚且免疫 DoT。血量降到 66% 和 33% 时他会召唤出非精英的黑曜石碎片，常规打法是先杀掉这些小傀儡，再回头打 boss。": "Obsidian Sentinel is a level 44 elite golem found right by the Back Entrance. He's got high armor, high HP, and DoT immunity. At 66% and 33% health, he will spawn two non-elite Obsidian Shard. Groups typically kill the two Obsidian Shard first, then return back to the boss.",
    "黑石塔上层：经典旧世最经典的团队副本，直面雷德·黑手与达基萨斯将军。": "UBRS: the classic 10-15 man raid, ending with Rend Blackhand and General Drakkisath.",
    "黑石塔下层：食人魔与龙人的巢穴，一路杀向维姆萨拉克。": "LBRS: ogre halls and dragonkin lairs, ending at Overlord Wyrmthalak.",
    "黑石塔龙人成群且会施放吐息，正面锥形伤害高，坦克记得让它们背对团队。": "Dragonspawn use frontal breath attacks - tank them facing away from the group.",
    "黑衣守卫铸剑师 是一个小头目，点击 安娜丝塔丽男爵夫人 右侧地上的锻造图样即可召唤。他没有任何机制，除了锻造图样之外也没有特殊掉落。": "Black Guard Swordsmith is a mini boss summoned by clicking the blacksmithing plans on the ground to the right of Baroness Anastari. He has no mechanics and no unique loot apart from a plan for blacksmiths.",
    "黑铁酒吧买酒触发法拉克斯是最快的开门路线，省去清场时间。": "Buy ale in the Grim Guzzler to trigger Phalanx and smash the door open.",
    "黑铁酒吧里的一连串小型遭遇在任务攻略中另有详述，这里不再展开。法拉克斯是酒吧里的主要战斗对象。酒吧是黑石深渊里的一间中立酒馆，既有中立酒客，也有普拉格和罗克图斯·暗契 &lt;瑟银兄弟会&gt;两位商人。当然，为了做任务或者杀某些boss，你可能需要故意和酒客们干上一架。": "There are a series of encounters in The Grim Guzzler that are covered in the Blackrock Depths Quest Guide , so I won't spend a great deal of time covering the minor encounters, such as and . However, Phalanx will be discussed as it is the primary encounter within The Grim Guzzler. The Grim Guzzler is a bar in Blackrock Depths featuring neutral patrons as well as the vendors Plugger Spazzring and Lokhtos Darkbargainer. However, you may want to get into barfights with the patrons to complete quests or kill bosses.",
    "龙人哨卫": "Dragonspawn Guards",
    "龙人多成对出现且会召唤援军，逐组拉怪、控制好击杀节奏。": "Dragonkin come in pairs and call reinforcements - pull pack by pack.",
    "龙人成群": "Dragonkin Packs",
    # ── 达拉然之城 2026-10-09 数据更新（foreverchanges + wowhead 核对）─────────
    "重建后穹顶消失的达拉然城：从下水道潜入这座魔法之都，直面失控的奥术构造体与肆虐的邪能，共 8 个 boss（含 1 个隐藏 boss）。": "The rebuilt dome-less city of Dalaran: sneak into this magical capital through its sewers and face rogue arcane constructs and rampant fel energy — 8 bosses (1 of them hidden).",
    "副本里几乎所有怪物都免疫奥术伤害：奥术系输出（奥术飞弹、奥术爆炸等）与以奥术施放的打断（如反制）在这里统统失效 —— 组队时留意伤害构成。构造体与元素生物还不吃流血和毒药，树人则免疫自然伤害。": "Nearly every mob in the dungeon is immune to Arcane damage: Arcane damage spells (Arcane Missiles, Arcane Explosion, etc.) and interrupts cast as Arcane (like Counterspell) all fail here — mind your damage composition when forming the group. Constructs and elementals are also immune to Bleed and Poison, and treants are immune to Nature damage.",
    "不稳定的哨兵的「故障」有 2 秒起手，随后 6 秒内对 25 码内所有人连续造成重创：远程全程 25 码外，近战看到起手就出。": "Unstable Sentinel's Malfunction has a 2-second wind-up, then hits everyone within 25 yards repeatedly for 6 seconds: ranged stay beyond 25 yards for the whole fight, melee run out when you see the wind-up.",
    "大法师之影是最终 boss：法力耗尽会群体变形全队、再引导唤醒把法力回满；「弹跳法力」是点名的奥术回旋镖，被穿过还会沉默 6 秒 —— 别与目标站成一线；群体变形可以躲墙后规避，但把他引出房间会完全重置。": "The Shade of the Archmage is the final boss: when his mana runs out he Mass Polymorphs the whole party, then channels Awakening to refill it; Bounding Mana is a targeted arcane boomerang that silences for 6 seconds anyone it passes through — don't stand in line with the target; you can hide behind walls to avoid Mass Polymorph, but pulling him out of the room fully resets him.",
    "推进顺序参考：下水道先打墓穴骑士阿特雷克西斯，隐藏 boss 被无视的琳也在下水道（要先用影牙城堡与安伯米尔的流程合成「达拉然巨著」才能召唤）；出下水道后的街道上有奥术异常体、奥术谜团与不稳定的哨兵，法力吞噬者守在紫罗兰监狱门口；邪能古树被城市中央的法力屏障锁着；大法师之影守终点。": "Rough order of progress: clear Atrexis the Grave Knight in the sewers first; the hidden boss Lyn the Ignored also lives in the sewers (you must forge the Dalaran Codex via the Shadowfang Keep and Ambermill steps before you can summon her); after the sewers, Arcane Anomaly, Arcanic Enigma and Unstable Sentinel roam the streets, and Mana Devourer guards the Violet Hold entrance; the Fel Ancient is locked behind the mana barrier in mid-city; the Shade of the Archmage waits at the end.",
    "Forever 新增肯瑞托声望，肯瑞托战袍需要崇拜：大部分敌人给 5 点、下水道精英 12-13 点、阿特雷克西斯 15 点，被无视的琳与大法师之影各 25 点。": "Forever adds a Kirin Tor reputation; the Kirin Tabard asks for exalted: most enemies give 5 points, sewer elites 12-13, Atrexis 15, and Lyn the Ignored and the Shade of the Archmage 25 each.",
    "法力屏障": "Mana Barrier",
    "城市中央的邪能古树被一道法力屏障和一群充能树人守着 —— 先清光树人，再找屏障南边的魔导师 Fansy Goodbringer 对话撤除屏障，boss 才会解锁。": "The Fel Ancient in mid-city is guarded by a mana barrier and a grove of Suffused Treants — clear the treants first, then talk to Magus Fansy Goodbringer south of the barrier to remove it; only then is the boss unlocked.",
    "街道上肯瑞托法师与奥术傀儡密度很高，贴墙拉怪、留意巡逻；小怪群里偶尔还会窜出法力幽灵。": "Kirin Tor mages and arcane golems are dense along the streets — hug walls, watch the patrols; a Mana Wraith occasionally springs out of the trash packs.",
    "墓穴骑士阿特雷克西斯守在下水道最前段的一个仪式法阵旁，身边围着肯瑞托死灵法师，是场非常简单的坦克拉住打的木桩战。他的主要机制是召唤骷髅 —— 非精英怪，从法阵里不断爬出来，出现就杀。整场战斗没有时间敏感的机制，唯一会出事的方式是坦克还没建立仇恨就放开大范围 AOE。他会周期性缴械当前坦克约 6 秒 —— 被缴械期间注意开减伤自保；他对坦克的高伤技能也不容小觑，坦克这场记得带盾。": "Atrexis the Grave Knight stands by a ritual circle early in the sewers, surrounded by Kirin Tor necromancers — a very easy tank-and-spank. His primary mechanic is summoning Skeletons — non-elite mobs that keep climbing out of the circle; kill them on sight. The fight has no time-sensitive mechanics, and the only way to die is popping heavy AOE before the tank has established threat. He periodically disarms the active tank for about 6 seconds — use defensives while disarmed; his hard-hitting abilities on the tank are nothing to sneeze at, so bring a shield for this one.",
    "被无视的琳是下水道深处的隐藏 boss，要先完成召唤流程：①在影牙城堡击杀大法师阿鲁高，拿走他房间桌上的黑色魔典；②到银松森林安伯米尔的堡垒里，在蓝色水晶「地脉聚焦器」旁使用魔典，把它变成「达拉然巨著」；③回到下水道，过了阿特雷克西斯后不走右侧上街面的路，直行走进通往紫色符文法阵的房间，由带巨著的玩家点击法阵 —— 琳会从圆形大铁栅门后走出来（出场动画致敬拉格纳罗斯）。战斗本身出乎意料地凶：她会周期性施放暗影弹，伤害可观；「荆棘诅咒」是 1.5 秒施法、持续 3 分钟的诅咒 —— 中招者攻击时会时不时伤到自己，近战尤其难受，务必解除诅咒；她还会召唤两只非精英骷髅助战，及时清掉。": "Lyn the Ignored is a hidden boss deep in the sewers and must be summoned first: 1) kill Archmage Arugal in Shadowfang Keep and take the Black Tome from the book on his room's table; 2) in the keep at Ambermill, Silverpine Forest, use the tome next to the blue crystal Leyline Focus to turn it into the Dalaran Codex; 3) back in the sewers, after Atrexis don't take the right-hand path up to the streets — go straight into the room with the purple rune circle and have the Codex carrier click it — Lyn steps out from the round iron grate gate (with a wink to Ragnaros). The fight itself is surprisingly punishing: she periodically hurls Shadow Bolts for noticeable damage; Bramble Curse is a 1.5-second cast, 3-minute curse that makes the afflicted hurt themselves when attacking — brutal for melee, dispel it; she also raises two non-elite skeletons — kill them promptly.",
    "奥术异常体守在出下水道后的城内，招牌机制处理不当会直接减员：「聚焦冲击」施法 3 秒后向前方射出一道持续 6 秒、每秒命中四次的奥术光刃，并逆时针旋转横扫整间房 —— 团本老玩家会认出这就是克苏恩、海莱恩与诺鲁什那套光束机制，碰到就会死，一开始施法就离开光束的路径。光束之间它会用 1.5 秒施法的奥术箭打坦克。开怪时 boss 还会在房间边缘召唤小怪，全队留在平台的圆圈内打，避免把小怪带进 boss。": "Arcane Anomaly guards the city right after the sewers, with a signature mechanic that will kill you if mishandled: Focused Blast fires a beam in front of it after a 3-second cast, lasting 6 seconds and hitting four times a second, sweeping the whole room counterclockwise — raid veterans will recognize the C'thun / Halion / Norushen beam; touching it is lethal, so leave the beam's path as soon as the cast starts. Between beams it hits the tank with a 1.5-second Arcane Bolt. Engaging also spawns small adds at the edge of the room — keep the group inside the circle on the platform to avoid dragging them into the boss.",
    "奥术谜团在城内街道东侧。开战时 boss 身边带着两只法力幻影，它们的法力燃烧对被点名者压力极大，优先集火秒掉 —— 幻影不会补充，但 boss 会不断召唤小型奥术人偶，用顺劈和 AOE 顺手清掉（优先级低于幻影）。「法力变形」会把一名玩家变成动物 8 秒 —— 是魔法效果，让能驱散魔法的队友解掉；它还会对近身目标施放范围奥术伤害并沉默 —— 治疗全程与 boss 保持距离。": "Arcanic Enigma waits on the eastern side of the city streets. Two Mana Phantoms accompany the boss — their Mana Burn is very taxing on whoever is targeted, so burn them down quickly (no extra Phantoms spawn, but the boss continuously summons small Arcane Manalings — cleave and AOE them down, lower priority than the Phantoms). Mana Morph turns a player into an animal for 8 seconds — it is a Magic effect, have someone dispel it; the boss also hits nearby targets with AOE Arcane damage and silence — healers keep their distance at all times.",
    "不稳定的哨兵守在魔导师商贸区一带。唯一的关键机制「故障」：施法 2 秒后，6 秒内每 2 秒对 25 码内所有人造成约 140 点奥术伤害 —— 远程全程待在 25 码外，近战看到起手就跑出范围；等级和配置够硬的话近战也可以选择硬吃，但善待治疗是底线。注意：接近 boss 时旁边的建筑里会刷出非精英的愤怒魔典 —— 开怪前先清掉，战斗会轻松不少。": "Unstable Sentinel stands around the Mage District. Its one defining mechanic, Malfunction: after a 2-second cast it hits everyone within 25 yards for roughly 140 Arcane damage every 2 seconds for 6 seconds — ranged stay beyond 25 yards for the whole fight, melee run out on the wind-up; with enough level and gear melee can tank through it, but being kind to your healer is the baseline. Note: non-elite Angry Tomes spawn from the buildings as you approach — clear them before engaging.",
    "法力吞噬者守在紫罗兰监狱门口，看着不显山露水，打起来很容易翻车：它会周期性对 45 码内所有人造成伤害并吸取 200 点法力；还会对当前坦克施放「吸取活力」—— 10 秒内每 2 秒约 65 点奥术伤害的魔法减益，记得驱散。这场仗本质是与时间的赛跑 —— 全队法力迟早见底，越快击杀越稳；boss 免疫奥术。开怪前把 boss 区域的小怪清干净，否则它们会一起加入战斗。": "Mana Devourer resides by the entrance to the Violet Hold — deceptively difficult: it periodically deals damage to everyone within 45 yards and drains 200 mana; it also casts Siphon Vitality on the active tank — a Magic debuff dealing about 65 Arcane damage every 2 seconds for 10 seconds, dispel it. The fight is essentially a race against time — the group's mana will run out sooner or later, so the faster you kill it the better; the boss is immune to Arcane. Clear all the trash in the boss area first — it will join the fight otherwise.",
    "邪能古树被一道法力屏障保护在城市中央，前面有充能树人看守：先清光树人，再与屏障南边的魔导师 Fansy Goodbringer 对话撤除屏障，才能开 boss。两个机制叠在一起会非常致命：「根须缠绕」偶尔定身 2 个目标并施加持续伤害；「邪能原木」会冲向一名玩家、砸中其 5 码内的所有人，并在地上留下一滩持续伤害的毒雾 —— 被定身时务必躲开原木与毒雾，圣骑士的自由祝福、侏儒的逃命专家这类解控技能在这里价值极高。": "The Fel Ancient is protected by a mana barrier in mid-city, watched over by Suffused Treants: clear the treants first, then talk to Magus Fansy Goodbringer south of the barrier to remove it before engaging. Two mechanics stacked together are deadly: Entangle occasionally roots 2 targets and deals damage over time; Fel Timbers charges a player, hitting everyone within 5 yards and leaving a damaging fel pool on the ground — while rooted, be sure to dodge the timber and the pool; movement removers like a paladin's Hand of Freedom or Escape Artist are worth a lot here.",
    "大法师之影是副本的最终 boss，守在紫罗兰密室 —— 大法师莫德拉的影像会为队伍开启传送门送大家过去。他把法力池当资源使用，法力耗尽时会施放群体变形把全队变成动物 8 秒，再引导唤醒 6 秒把法力回满。对坦克的主要伤害技能（奥术爆炸）伤害高而稳定；他还会周期性对 20 码内所有人造成中等伤害。偶尔他会施放「弹跳法力」—— 一颗法球飞向随机玩家再弹回他身边，被穿过的人受到奥术伤害并沉默 6 秒：全队散开，别站在他与被点名玩家之间，施法者保持最大距离。想多挤一点输出或治疗的施法者，可以在他施放群体变形时躲到墙后规避 —— 但小心：战斗中只要有人离开房间，他就会重置回满血。传承挑战在他死亡那一刻计为通关本副本。": "The Shade of the Archmage is the final boss, waiting in the Violet Chamber — the Image of Archmage Modera opens a portal to bring the group to him. He powers his abilities with his mana pool, and once it drains he Mass Polymorphs the whole party for 8 seconds, then channels Awakening for 6 seconds to refill it. His primary damage on the tank (Arcane Explosion) is high and steady; he also periodically deals moderate damage to everyone within 20 yards. Occasionally he casts Bounding Mana — an orb flies to a random player and back to him, dealing Arcane damage and a 6-second silence to anyone it passes through: spread out, don't stand between him and the target, and keep casters at max range. Casters looking to squeeze out extra damage or healing can hide behind the wall during Mass Polymorph — but careful: if anyone leaves the room during the fight, he fully resets. The Legacy challenge counts the dungeon as done when he dies.",
}
